[śrīḥ
śāktapramodaḥ 

kālyādidaśamahāvidyātantrātmakaḥ 
kumāryādipaṃcāyatanadevatānāṃ tantraiśca samalaṃkṛtaḥ 

śivahararājadhānīrājabhiḥ

śrīrājadevanandanasiṃhabahāduranarādhipaiḥ
saṃgṛhya viracitaḥ]

<mudraka evaṃ prakāśakaḥ >

<khemarāja śrīkṛṣṇadāsa>

<adhyakṣa śrīveṃkaṭeśvara presa>

<khemarāja śrīkṛṣṇadāsa mārga boṃba-ī 400 004>

<saṃskaraṇa san 1892, samvat 1949>


śrīgaṇeśāya namaḥ

{atha śāktapramodaḥ}

natvā kālīṅkṛpārdrāṅkalikaluṣaharāṅkomalāṅkāntadehām |
kurvve śāktapramodaṃ sukṛtasumatidaṃ śobhanaṃ sajjanānām ||
śaktīnāṃ satsaparyādikamiha gaditaṃ tatsamantrandaśānām |
pañcānāndevatānāmapi tadakhilakaṅkhaṇḍanandurmmatīnām ||

atha śrīkālīdhyānam

śavārūḍhāmmahābhīmāṅghoradaṃṣṭrāṃ hasanmukhīm |
caturbhujāṅkhaḍgamuṇḍavarābhayakarāṃ śivām || (1) ||

muṇḍamālādharāndevīṃ lalajjihvāndigambarām |
evaṃ sañcintayetkālīṃ śmaśānālayavāsinīm || (2) ||

<p. 4> atha yantroddhāraḥ

ādau trikoṇamālikhya trikoṇantadbahirlikhet |
tato vai vilikhenmantrī trikoṇatrayamuttamam || (1) ||

tatastrivṛttamālikhya likhedaṣṭadalaṃ tataḥ |
vṛttaṃ vilikhya vidhivallikhedbhūpuramekakam || (2) ||

atha mantroddhāraḥ 

kālībījatrayamproktvā lajjābījadvayantataḥ |
hū(/)kārau dvau tataḥ paścāddakṣiṇe kālike tataḥ || (1) ||

kālībījatrayantasmāllajjābījadvayaṃ paṭhet |
dvau ca svāhāntahūṅkārau kālīmantra udāhṛtaḥ || (2) ||

atha mantraḥ 

krīṃ krīṃ krīṃ hrīṃ hrīṃ hūṃ hūṃ dakṣiṇe kālike krīṃ (3) hrīṃ (2) 
hū(/) (2) svāhā ||

atha śrīdakṣiṇakālīsaparyāpaddhatiḥ

prathamampañcavarṇarajaścitraṃ śuddhaṃ sthānaṃ gatvā pūjāvedyā 
bahiḥ sthitvā gurumpraṇamya iṣṭadevatāmpraṇamya dikpālāṃśca 
praṇamya ācamya tataḥ kuśahasto maunī pāpaśamanārthaṃ 
ślokadvayampaṭhet | tadyathā  

o devi tvatprakṛtañcittampāpākrāntamabhūnmama |
tannissarantu cittānme pāpaṃ hūṃ phaṭ ca te namaḥ || (1) ||

sūryassomo yamaḥkālo mahābhūtāni pañca ca || 

<p. 5> ete śubhāśubhasyeha karmaṇo nava sākṣiṇaḥ '

iti paṭhitvā samprārthya gṛhe praviśet | maunī mūlenācamya 

'o vajrodake hūṃ phaṭ svāhā' iti jalaṅgṛhītvā 'hūṃ svāhā' iti kare 
ādāya 'oṃ hrīṃ viśuddhasarvapāpāniśamayāśeṣavikalpamapanaya hū(/) 
phaṭ svāhā' ityanena pādau prakṣālya 'oṃ hrīṃ svāhā' iti punarācamya 
'aiṃ kālikāyai namaḥ(,) aiṃ kapālinyai namaḥ(,) aiṃ kullāyai namaḥ' iti 
trirācamya tato mūlena hastau prakṣālya 'oṃ kālikāyai namaḥ | oṃ 
kapālinyai namaḥ' iti daśahastāṅgulībhiroṣṭhau dvirunmṛjya 'oṃ kullāyai 
namaḥ' iti karaṃ prakṣālya mūlena 
saṅkucitāṅgulībhirmukhatarjanyaṅguṣṭhābhyāṃ nāsikāṃ mūlena 
anāmikāṅguṣṭhābhyāṅkarṇamaṅguṣṭhakaniṣṭhābhyānnābhintalenah
ṛdayaṃ sarvāṅgulībhirmastakaṃ bhujau ca spṛśet | 
tatastilakaṅkulacandanādinā 
lalāṭodarahṛtkaṇṭhadakṣapārśvāṃsakaṇṭhapṛṣṭhakakudi bhujadvandve 
mūrddhani dvādaśasvapi sthāneṣu kuryāt | tato 

'devyastra(/)vvilikhedbhāle kālībījantato hṛdi || 
śaktimmadhyagatāṅkṛtvākūrcabījannyasetsudhīḥ'
 
tataḥ sāmānyārghyasthāpanaṅkuryāt || 

tadyathā(-)svavāmetrikoṇavṛttabhūpurātmakammaṇḍala(/)vvilikhya tataḥ 'oṃ 
ādhāraśaktibhyo namaḥ' iti puṣpākṣatādibhirabhyarcya 'oṃ haḥ 
dvārārghyaṃ sādhayāmi' ityuktvā 'phaṭ' itiprakṣālitaṃ 
śaṅkhādipātrantripādikopari nidhāya 'namaḥ' iti jalenāpūrya 

'gaṅge ca yamune caiva godāvarisarasvati | 
narmade sindhukāverijale'sminsannidhiṅkuru'

itimantreṇāṅkuśamudrayāsūrya maṇḍalāttīrthantajjale āvāhya(,) 
gandhādikampraṇavenaniḥkṣipya(,) dhenumatsyamudre darśayitvā(,) 
praṇavenāṣṭādaśakṛtvovābhimantryaphaḍiti mantreṇadvāramabhiṣecayet 
'oṃ maṇidhariṇi vajriṇi śikhariṇi sarvalokavaśaṅkari hūṃphaṭsvāhā' iti 
śikhāmbadhnīyāt || tato dvāradevatāḥ pūjayet 'gaṃgaṇeśāya namaḥ(,) 
baṃ baṭukāya namaḥ(,) kṣaṃkṣetreśāya namaḥ(,) yaṃ yoginībhyo namaḥ' 
iti ūdhveṃ vāmedakṣe 

<p. 6> adha iti caturdikṣu pūjayet ' gaṃgaṅgāyai namaḥ(,) yaṃyamunāyai 
namaḥ' iti śākhāpārśvayoḥ 'laṃlakṣmyainamaḥ(,) saṃsarasvatyainamaḥ' 
|| iti ūrdhve adhaścapūjayet ||
'oṃ brahmāṇyādyaṣṭamātṛbhyonamaḥ' itidehalyām 
gandhapuṣpādinābhyarccyatatodakṣiṇāṅgaṃsaṅkocayan 
dakṣacaraṇamagre nidhāya vāmaśākhāmaspṛśan maṇḍalābhyantare 
gatvā 'oṃ rakṣarakṣahū(/)phaṭsvāhā' iti jalenābhiṣicya ' oṃ 
pavitravajrabhūmehū(/)phaṭsvāhā' ityabhimantrya 
'hīṃādhāraśaktikamalāsanāyanamaḥ' ityāsanamabhyarcyatrikoṇa(/) 
vilikhya 'āsurekhevajrarekhehū(/)phaṭsvāhā' iti maṇḍala(/)vvilikhya tatra 
'hasauṃ' itipretabīja(/)vvilikhya 'hrīṃ ādhāraśaktikamalāsanāyanamaḥ' 
ityāsanamabhyarcya | oṃ anantāya namaḥ(,) vimalāsanāyanamaḥ(,) 
padmāsanāyanamaḥ' iti kuśānāstīrya 
vyāghrājinakṛṣṇasāramṛgājinaṅkambalāsana(/) vā prakalpayet | 
tadabhāvetupañcaviṃśatikuśanirmitaviṣṭaraṃ śavarūpa(/) vā prakalpayet 
|| 'hsauṃmahāpretapadmāsanāyanamaḥ' ityabhyarcya tatrāsane 
ātmamantreṇa 
upaviśyavāmorūparidakṣiṇapādaṅkṛtvābaddhavīrāsanaḥ 
vāmapādopari dakṣiṇorundhṛtvāviparīta(/)vvā pūrvābhimukha 
uttarābhimukhovā(-)āsanandhṛtvā mantrampaṭhet || 
āsanamantrasyamerupṛṣṭhaṛṣiḥ sutalañchandaḥ kūrmodevatā 
āsanaparigraheviniyogaḥ 'oṃ pṛthvitvayādhṛtālokā devitva(/)vviṣṇunādhṛtā 
|| tvañcadhārayamānnityampavitraṅkurucāsanam' iti 'oṃ 
vāstupuruṣāyanamaḥ(,) oṃ brahmaṇenamaḥ' iti nairṛtyesampūjya 'oṃ 
dharmāyanamaḥ(,) oṃ jñānāyanamaḥ(,) oṃ vairāgyāya namaḥ(,) oṃ 
aiśvaryāyanamaḥ' itidikṣusampūjya 'oṃ adharmāyanamaḥ(,) oṃ 
avairāgyāyanamaḥ(,) oṃ anaiśvaryāyanamaḥ' iti vidikṣusampūjayet || 'oṃ 
hū(/)phaṭsvāhā' iti mantreṇa 'oṃ hrīṃsvāhā' itimantreṇa vā 
kāyavākcittaśodhanaṅkṛtvā 'rakṣarakṣahū(/)phaṭsvāhā' 
ityātmānamabhirakṣayet 'oṃ śatābhiṣeke 
śatābhiṣekepadehū(/)phaṭsvāhā(,) oṃ puṣpaketurājārhat puṣpe puṣpe 
mahāpuṣpe supuṣpe puṣpasambhave |

<p. 7> puṣpacayāvakīrṇehū(/) phaṭsvāhā' itipuṣpamabhimantrayet | anyāni 
pūjāvastūnisarvāṇi 
sāmānyārghyodakenābhiṣicyadhenumudrāmatsyamudre darśayitvā 
puṣpāṇi śuddhāni vibhāvayet || vamitijaladhārāmprakṣipya(,) 
vahnibījenavahniprākāraṃ vicintya 'hū(/)phaṭ' itimantreṇa 
caturddikṣukrodhadṛṣṭyānirīkṣya sarvān vighnānutsārayet | tadyathā 
'sarvavighnānutsārayahū(/)phaṭsvāhā' itimantreṇa ūrdhvamavalokya 
divyā(/)ścaturddikṣujalakṣepeṇāntarikṣagān vāmapārṣṇighātatrayeṇa 
bhaumān vighnānutsārya 
lājacandanasiddhārthatiladadhidūrvākṣatānāmanyatamamādāya 'oṃ 
apasarpantu te bhūtā ye bhūtā bhūmisaṃsthitāḥ | ye 
cātravighnakartāraste naśyantu śivājñayā' itipaṭha(/)ścaturddikṣu kṣipet | 
tato vāme oṃ gurubhyo namaḥ(,) oṃ paramagurubhyonamaḥ(,) oṃ 
parātparagurubhyonamaḥ(,) oṃ parameṣṭhigurubhyonamaḥ' dakṣiṇe 'oṃ 
gaṇeśāyanamaḥ' purataḥ 'oṃ dakṣiṇakālikāyainamaḥ' itipraṇamet || tataḥ 
karaśuddhiṅkuryāt || tadyathā(-) 'hū(/)' itimantreṇacandanāktāni 
kusumānyaṅgulyagreṇādāya 'hauṃ' itimantreṇa karābhyāmmarddayitvā 
'klīṃ' iti bījena dakṣahastena sammṛjya 'oṃ tatsat' 
itimantreṇavāmahastenāghrāya 'hauṃ' iti mantreṇa 
aiśānyāndiśipuṣpamparityajet 'oṃ tesarvevilaya(/)yyāntu 
yemāṃhiṃsantihiṃsakāḥ || mṛtyurogabhayakrodhāḥ patanturipumastake' 
iti mantreṇavāparityajet | parityāgaścanārācamudrayā ||

atha bhūtaśuddhiḥ

	śirasi bhairavāyaṛṣayenamaḥ | mukhe uṣṇikchandasenamaḥ | hṛdaye 
oṃ dakṣiṇakālikāyainamaḥ | guhye krīṃbījāyanamaḥ | pādayoḥ hū(/) 
śaktayenamaḥ | sarvāṅge krīṃkīlakāyanamaḥ ||

<p. 8> atha ṣaḍaṅganyāsaḥ

'krāṃhṛdayāyanamaḥ' aṅgulībhistarjjanīmadhyamānāmabhiḥ 
prasāritābhirhṛdayaṃspṛśet || 'krīṃśirasesvāhā' 
ititarjjanīmadhyamābhyāṃ śirasispṛśet || 'krūṃśikhāyaivaṣaṭ' 
itibaddhamuṣṭinā aṅguṣṭhenaśikhāṃ spṛśet || 'kraiṃkavacāyahum' 
itimantreṇavyastahastābhyāṃ sarvāṅge || 'krauṃnetratrayāyavauṣaṭ' 
ititarjjanyā(-)anāmayā netre(,) 
madhyamayābhrūmadhyamevannetratrayaṃspṛśet || 'kraḥ astrāyaphaṭ' iti 
choṭikayādigbandhanaṃ kuryāt || evaṅkaranyāsaḥ  'krāṃ(-)
aṅguṣṭhābhyānnamaḥ(,) krīṃtarjjanībhyāṃ svāhā 
krūṃmadhyamābhyāṃvvaṣaṭ(,) kraiṃ(-)anāmikābhyāṃ hūm(,) 
krauṃkaniṣṭhābhyāṃ vauṣaṭ(,) kraḥkaratalakarapṛṣṭhābhyāṃphaṭ(,) 
evaṅkaranyāsa(/)vvidhāya daśadhāsaptadhāpañcadhā vā mūlena 
vyāpakanyāsaṅkuryāt | tataḥ 
pūrvoktakrameṇaprāṇāyāmatraya(/)vvidadhyāt || tadyathā  
dakṣiṇahastāṅguṣṭhenadakṣanāsāpuṭannirudhyavāmanāsāpuṭena 
mūlaṃ ṣoḍaśavārañjapan 
śanaiḥśanaiḥprāṇākhyavāyumākṛṣyaśirasisahasrāredhārayediti 
pūrakaḥ | dakṣahastānāmikātarjanyaṅguṣṭhaiḥ nāsāpuṭadvayannirudhya 
mūlañcatuḥṣaṣṭivārañjapan kumbhayet | 
punarddakṣanāsāpuṭamaṅguṣṭhanirodhanantyaktvāmūlandvātriṃśadvā
rañjapañchanaiḥ śanaistadvāyuṃ recayet iti prāṇāyāmatrayam || 
yadisa(/)vicchodhanamicchettadātraivakarttavyam | tadvidhistu 'oṃ 
siddhāḍhyāṃśivagehinīṅkaralasatpāśāṅkuśāmbhairavīmbhaktābhī.
sṭavarapradāṃsukuśalāṃ saṃsārabandhacchidām || 
pīyūṣāmbudhimanthanodbhavarasāṃsa(/)vvidvilāsāṃ parā(/) 
vvīrārādhitapādukāṃ suvijayāndhyāyejjaganmohinīm' iti dhyātvā 'oṃ 
sa(/)videbrahmasambhūtebrahmaputrisadānaghe | bharavānandatṛptyarthaṃ 
pavitrābhavasarvadā ||' oṃbrāhmaṇyainamaḥ svāhā 'oṃ siddhamūlakriye 
devi hīnabodhaprabodhini || rājaprajāvaśaṅkariśatrukaṇṭhaniṣūdini |' 

<p. 9> aiṃkṣatriyāyainamaḥ svāhā || 'oṃ 
ajñānendhanadīptāgnijvālāgnijñānarūpiṇi || ānandasyāgamaprītiṃ 
samyagjñānamprayacchame ||' hrīṃvaiśyāyainamaḥ svāhā || 'oṃ 
namasyāminamasyāmiyogamārgapradarśini | trailokyavijaye mātaḥ 
samādhiphaladābhava' klīṃśūdrāyai namaḥ svāhā 
ityetairmantraissaṃśodhya tataḥ 'oṃ amṛte amṛtodbhave amṛtavarṣiṇi 
amṛtamākarṣaya ākarṣaya siddhindehisarvammevaśamānayasvāhā' iti 
mantreṇābhimantrayet | tataḥ 'oṃ hrīṃ hlīṃ lūṃ aḥ aṃḍaṃ 
eṃmahāghoreśāya namaḥ' ityaghoramantreṇacābhimantryamūlamantraṃ 
saptavārañjaptvāśrīṣṭadevīmāvāhyadhenumudrā(/)yyonimudrāñca 
pradarśya choṭikābhirdigbandhanantālatrayañca kṛtvā tatra 
śrīṣṭadevīmmānasopacāraiḥ sampūjya 'ai(/) gurupādukābhyo namaḥ' 
itimantreṇabrahmarandhre śrīguruntridhātarpayet 
mūlenahṛtkamaleśrīṣṭadevatāmpañcadhātarpayet | tataḥ svīkāraḥ 'ai(/) 
ātmatattvena ātmatattvaṃ śodhayāmisvāhā(,) 
aiṃvidyātattvenavidyātattvaṃśodhayāmisvāhā(,) 
aiṃśivatattvenaśivatattvaṃśodhayāmisvāhā' mūlamuccārya 
'sarvatattvenasarvatattvaṃśodhayāmisvāhā' 
'aiṃvadavadavāgvādinimamajihvāgresthirā bhavasarvasattvavaśaṅkari 
svāhā' itimukhenajāṭharāgnaujuhuyātmūlamantreṇa sarvampibet | tataḥ 
stuvīta 
'sa(/)vviddevigarīyasīguṇamayīvaiguṇyavidhvaṃsinīmāyāmohamadāndhak
āraśamanītāpatrayonmūlinī || 
vāgdevīvadanāmbujaikarasikāsambodhinīdīpikābrahmajñānavivekasiddh
avijayīvijñānamūrttyainamaḥ || (1) ||
sa(/)vvidāsavayormmadhye sa(/)vvidevagarīyasī ||
bhayanāśāya nirggandhāvikhyātāmodakāriṇī || (2) ||'
itistutvāśrīguruṃ śrīṣṭadevatāñcapraṇamyaṛṣyādinyāsaṃ(,) 
ṣaḍaṅganyāsaṃ(,) karanyāsañcakuryāt | tadyathā(-)
śirasibhairavāyaṛṣayenamaḥ(,) mukhe(-)uṣṇikchandasenamaḥ(,) hṛdaye oṃ 
dakṣiṇākālikāyainamaḥ(,) guhyekrīṃbījāyanamaḥ(,) pādayoḥ hū(/)śaktaye 
namaḥ(,) sarvāṅge krīṃkīlakāyanamaḥ || atha ṣaḍaṅganyāsaḥ || 
krāṃhṛdayāya namaḥ(,) 

<p. 10> krīṃśirasesvāhā(,) krūṃśikhāyaivaṣaṭ(,) kraiṃkavacāyahum(,) 
krauṃnetratrayāyavauṣaṭ(,) kraḥastrāyaphaṭ || evaṃkaranyāsaḥ || krāṃ(-)
aṃguṣṭhābhyāṃnamaḥ(,) krīṃtarjjanībhyāṃsvāhā(,) 
krūṃmadhyamābhyāṃvaṣaṭ(,) kraiṃ(-)anāmikābhyāṃhum(,) 
krauṃkaniṣṭhābhyāṃvauṣaṭ(,) kraḥkaratalakarapṛṣṭhābhyāṃphaṭ || 
evaṃ karanyāsa(/) vidhāyabhūtaśuddhiṅkuryāt || 
aṅkekarāvuttānīkṛtyaniścalacittaḥ 'soham' 
itimantreṇaprabodhitāṅkuṇḍalinīmmūlādhārāt suṣumnāvartmanā 
svādhiṣṭhāne maṇipūre'nāhatekrameṇānīya tatra 
sthitañjīvampradīpakalikākāra(/)vvicintyatanmukhe 
nikṣipyatatoviśuddhākhyājñācakre 
ānīyatataḥśiro'vasthitādhomukhasahasrāracakrehimanibhasarvavarṇavibhu
uṣitākakhāditrirekhāsu(-)ālakṣatrayavibhūṣitasahasradalayuktampadmam | 
tatra guruṃ tasminsamānīya tatkarṇikāsthaparaśive 'haṃsaḥ' iti mantreṇa 
sa(/)yyojayet || atha pādato jānuparyantañcatuṣkoṇaṃ suvarṇābhaṃ 'lam' iti 
bījena yuktaṃ 
savajrakampṛthvīmaṇḍalantatragamanasahitampādendriyaṅgandhasahitaṅghr
āṇendriyannivṛttikalāyuktambrahmāṇaṃ(,) samānavāyuñca vibhāvayet | 
tato jānuto nābhiparyantamarddhacandrākāraṃ śvetābhaṃ 'vam' iti bījena 
yuktampadmadvayalāñchitañjalamaṇḍalantatra ca 
graṇakriyāsahitampāṇīndriyaṃrasenasahajihvendriyampratiṣṭhākalāsahita.
m śrīviṣṇumudānavāyuñcavibhāvayet || tato 
nābhitohṛdayaparyyantantrikoṇaṃ raktaṃ 'ram' iti bījena 
yuktaṃsvastikānvitantejomaṇḍalantatra ca 
visargakriyāsahitampāyvindriyaṃrūpeṇacakṣurindriya(/) vvidyākalāsahitaṃ 
śiva(/)vvyānavāyuñcavibhāvayet || (3) ||
tato hṛdayād bhrūmadhyaparyanta(/) vvartulaṃ dhūmravarṇaṃ 'yam' iti 
bījenayuktaṃ 
ṣaḍbindulāñchita(/)vvāyumaṇḍalantatrānandakriyāsahitopasthendriyaṃ 
sparśasahitantvagindriyam || śāntikalāsahitamīśānamapānavāyuñca 
vibhāvayet || tatobhrūmadhyādbrahmarandhraparyanta(/)vvarttulaṃ svacchaṃ 
'ham' iti

<p. 11> bījenayuktannabhomaṇḍalantatra 
vacanakriyāsahita(/)vvāgindriyaṃśabdasahitaṃ kṣotrendriyaṃ(,) 
