śmaśānāyanamaḥ(,) munibhyodevebhyonamaḥ(,) 
bahumāṃsāsthimodamānābhyaḥ śivābhyonamaḥ(,) 
śavamuṇḍacitāṅgārebhyonamaḥ(,) oṃjayāyainamaḥ(,) oṃvijayāyainamaḥ(,) 
oṃjitāyainamaḥ(,) oṃ(-)aparājitāyainamaḥ(,) oṃ nityāyainamaḥ(,) 
oṃvilāsinyainamaḥ(,) oṃdogdhyainamaḥ(,) oṃ(-)aghorāyainamaḥ(,) 
oṃmaṅgalāyainamaḥ(,) tataḥ hsauṃmahāpretapadmāsanāyanamaḥ(,) 
evaṃdehamayaṃpīṭhaṃ vibhāvya prātaḥkṛtyoktaprakāreṇa 
kuṇḍalyutthānādi kṛtvā devīṃdhyātvā tattanmudrāḥ pradarśya 
mānasairupacāraiḥ pūjayet | tadyathā  mūlādhāre dhvajādhogudordhve 
catuḥśoṇapatre vaṃśaṃṣaṃsamitisahite prasuptabhujagākārāṃ 
svayambhūliṅgaveṣṭinīṃ dhyāyet || tadyathā ||
dhyāyetkuṇḍalinīṃ sūkṣmāṃ mūlādhāranivāsinīm |
prasuptabhujagākārāṃ vidyutpaṭalasannibhām ||
tāmiṣṭadevatārūpāṃ sārddhatrivalayānvitām |
koṭisaudāminībhāsāṃ svayambhūliṅgaveṣṭinīm ||
tāmutthāpya mahādevīṃ haṃsaṃ mantreṇa sādhakaḥ | 
udyaddinakaradyotāṃyāvacchāsandṛḍhāsanaḥ ||
aśeṣāśubhaśāntyarthaṃsamāhitamanāściram |
tatprabhāpaṭalavyāptaṃ śarīramapi cintayet ||
suṣumnāvartmanaivaināṃ parabrahmaṇi yojayet |
tatra parabrahmaṇi saṅgamayya tataścandramaṇḍalāntargatāmṛtadhārāṃ 
nipīya tayā 
lolībhūtāñcaitanyamayīñcaraṇayugalāntarvigalitairamṛtanivahaiḥ 
prapañcaṃ sañcatīmmūlādhāramānayet || ātmānaṃ 
śuddhacaitanyānandamayaṃ
 
<p. 28> devatārūpaṃ vibhāvayet || tato mūlādhārātkuṇḍalinīṃ 
haṃsaṃmantreṇotthāpya dvādaśadale hṛdayasarasije(,) 
ṣaḍbiṃdulāñchitakādicāntasahite gatvā pradīpakalikākārajīvarūpāṃ 
dvitīyāmpradīpakalikāmākṛṣya svamukhe niḥkṣiptavatīmparabrahmaṇi 
saṅgamayya punarhṛdayadeśamānīya tanmukhātpradīpakalikāṃ 
viniṣkṛṣya mūlādhāre saṃsthāpayet || 
tāmpradīpakalikāndevatārūpāndhyāyet || tadyathā || 
meghāṅgī(/)vvigatāmbarāṃ 
śavaśivārāvāntrinetrāmparāṅkarṇṇālambitavālayugmabhayadāmmuṇ
ḍasrajāmālinīm || vāmādhordhvakarāmbuje naraśiraḥkhaḍgañca 
savyetare dānābhītivimuktakeśanicayā(/) vvande sadā kālikām ||
itidhyātvā tattanmudrāmpradarśya mānasairupacāraiḥpūjayet || tatra 
prārthayedanena mantreṇa 'oṃ svāgatandevadeveśi sannidhau bhava kālike || 
gṛhāṇa mānasīmpūjā(/) yyathārtthaparibhāṣitām' tato'ṣṭottaraśata(/) 
vvarṇamayyā mālayā japet || iti mānasapūjāvidhiḥ ||

atha bahiḥpūjā

	tatra prāṇāyāmaṣaḍaṅganyāsādi kuryāt || tadyathā || 
krāṃhṛdayāya namaḥ(,) krīṃśirasesvāhā(,) krūṃśikhāyaivaṣaṭ(,) 
kraiṃkavacāyahum(,) krauṃnetratrayāyavauṣaṭ(,) kraḥ(-)astrāyaphaṭ(,) 
itichoṭikayā digbandhanaṅkuryāt || evaṃ karanyāsaḥ | 
krāṃaṅguṣṭhābhyāṃnamaḥ(,) krīṃtarjjanībhyāṃsvāhā(,) 
krūṃmadhyamābhyāṃvvauṣaṭ(,) kraiṃ anāmikābhyāṃhum(,) 
krauṃkaniṣṭhikābhyāṃvauṣaṭ(,) kraḥkaratalakarapṛṣṭhābhyāmphaṭ(,) 
evannyāsādikaṅkṛtvā 'āḥsurekhevajrarekhehu(/)phaṭsvāhā' anena 
mantreṇa kuṅkumasindūrādibhiḥ 
sauvarṇarājatatāmrasphāṭikavaidrumādyanyatamapātre 
ṣaṭkoṇatrikoṇāṣṭadalabhūpurātmaka(/) yyantraṃ likhet || taduktaṃ 
rudrayāmale 'tataḥ kuṅkumasindūraiḥ kārya(/) yyantrantu yoginām || 
sauvarṇerājatetāmre sphāṭike vaidrume tathā || cakreyathoktavidhinā

<p. 29> pūjyā devī narottamaiḥ ||' sārasaṅgrahe'pi 'tāmredvādaśaka(/) 
vvarṣaṃ sphāṭikādau tu sarvadā || teṣāmmadhyesphāṭikantu 
sarvasiddhipradambhavet' ityādi || tantrāntarepi 'yāvajjīvaṃ suvarṇe 
syādraupye dvāviṃśati priye || tāmredvādaśavarṣāntantadarddha 
bhūrjjapatrake || ekatolandvitola(/) vvā tritola(/) vvedatolakam || 
svecchātolannaraḥkṛtvā pratyavāyaṃ samaśnute' || iti bahiḥpūjā ||

athārgghasthāpanavidhiḥ

	tadyathā(-) ātmayantrayormmadhye 
trikoṇavṛttaṣaṭkoṇacaturasramaṇḍala(/) vviracya īmitivilikhya(,) 
mūlakhaṇḍatrayeṇa trikoṇaṃ sampūjyaṣaṭkoṇeṣuṣaḍaṅgaṃ sampūjya 
caturasre 'pūrṇagiripīṭhāyanamaḥ' iti pūrvve(,) 
'uḍḍīyānapīṭhāyanamaḥ' itidakṣiṇe 'kāmarūpapīṭhāyanamaḥ' 
itipaścime(,) 'jālandharapīṭhāyanamaḥ' ityuttare(,) itisampūjya madhye 'oṃ 
ādhāraśaktayenamaḥ' itisampūjya trikoṇagarbhatrikoṇaṣaṭkoṇabhūṣitā(/) 
yya(/)trikāmmūlena saṃsthāpya 'namaḥ' 
itisāmānyārghasthajalenābhyukṣya 
'vāṃvīṃvuṃhasakṣamalavarayūṃdharmadavahnimaṇḍalātmanekālikār
gghyapātrādhārāyanamaḥ' itisampūjya yaṃdhūmrārcciṣenamaḥ(,) raṃ 
ūṣmāyainamaḥ(,) laṃjvalinyainamaḥ(,) vaṃjvālinyainamaḥ(,) 
śaṃvisphuliṅginyainamaḥ(,) ṣaṃsuśriyainamaḥ(,) saṃsurūpāyainamaḥ(,) 
haṃkapilāyainamaḥ(,) laṃhavyavāhāyainamaḥ(,) kṣaṃkavyavāhāyainamaḥ(,) 
itibahnidaśakalāḥ sampūjya ṣaṭkoṇeṣu ṣaḍaṅgañca sampūjya 
madhyamūlenadevīmprapūjya 'śrīkālikāśrīpātraṃ 
sthāpayāminamaḥ(,)' itipaṭhitvā tadupari sauvarṇaṃrājatantāmrannārikela(/) 
vvā pātraṃ phaḍitiprakṣālitaṃ saṃsthāpya 'hrīṃ hrīṃ hūṃ 
hasakṣamalavarayūṃvasupradatapinyādidvādaśakalātmane 
arkkamaṇḍalāyaśrīdakṣiṇākālikārghyapātrāyanamaḥ(,)' itisampūjya 
pūrvādiprādakṣiṇyena kalāmpūjayettadyathā  
'kaṃbhaṃtapinyainamaḥ(,) khaṃbaṃtāpinyainamaḥ(,)

<p. 30> gaṃphaṃdhūmrāyai namaḥ(,) ghaṃpaṃmarīcyainamaḥ(,) 
ṅaṃnaṃjvālinyainamaḥ(,) caṃdhaṃrucyainamaḥ(,) 
chaṃdaṃsuṣumnāyainamaḥ(,) jaṃthaṃbhogadāyai namaḥ(,) 
jhaṃtaṃviśvāyainamaḥ(,) ñaṃṇaṃbodhinyainamaḥ(,) 
ṭaṃḍhaṃdhāriṇyainamaḥ(,) ṭhaṃḍaṃkṣamāyainamaḥ' iti sampūjya 
tatpātramadhyetrikoṇaṃ ṣaṭkoṇavṛttammūlenavilikhya 
ṣaḍaṅgaṃsampūjyamūlenatrikoṇaṃ sampūjya vilomamātṛkayā 
daśadhājaptena vā kṣīrañjala(/) vvā madhusa(/)vvidādi vā nikṣipya tena 
trikoṇamparipūrya yaṃraṃvamitidoṣaśoṣaṇadahanaplāvanāni kṛtvā 
sāṃsīṃsūṃsahakṣamalavarayūṃkāmapradāmṛtādiṣoḍaśakalātmane 
somamaṇḍalāya 'srīdakṣiṇākālikārgghyāmṛtāyanamaḥ' itisampūjya 
kalāḥpūjayet | 'aṃ amṛtāyainamaḥ(,) āṃmānadāyainamaḥ(,) 
iṃpūṣāyainamaḥ(,) īṃtuṣṭyainamaḥ(,) uṃpuṣṭyainamaḥ(,) 
ūṃvṛttyainamaḥ(,) ṛṃdhṛtyainamaḥ(,) ṝṃśaśinyainamaḥ 
ḷṃcandrikāyainamaḥ(,) ḹṃkāntyainamaḥ(,) eṃjyotsnāyainamaḥ(,) 
aiṃśriyainamaḥ(,) oṃprītyainamaḥ(,) auṃ(-)aṅgadāyainamaḥ(,) 
aṃpūrṇāyainamaḥ(,) aḥpūrṇāmṛtāyainamaḥ' itikalāḥ sampūjya 
elālavaṅgakarpūrādisugandhādiniḥkṣipya pūrvavadyantrandravye vilikhya 
trikoṇarekhāyām 'aṃ (16) kaṃ (16) khaṃ (16)' itivilikhya madhye 
'haṃlaṃkṣaṃ' itisa(/)llikhya mūlakhaṇḍatrayeṇa sampūjya 
'gaṅgecayamunecaivagodāvarisarasvati || 
narmmadesindhukāverijalesminsannidhiṅkuru || oṃ brahmāṇḍodaratīrthāni 
karaiḥ spṛṣṭāni te rave || tena satyena me deva tīrthandehidivākara' 
ityādibhistīrthānyāvāhyāṅkuśamudrayā 'vauṣaṭ' itipuṣpaṃ 'vaṣaṭ' 
ityanena gālinīṃmudrāṃppradarśya | gālinīmudrā yathā 
'kaniṣṭhāṅguṣṭhakauyuktaukarayoritaretaram || 
tarjjanīmadhyamānāmāsaṃhatābhugnavarjjitāḥ' || vamitidhenumudrayā 
amṛtīkṛtya iṣṭadevatāndhyātvā sampūjya 
saṅkalīkṛtyaśaṅkhamudrāmpradarśya(,) ṣaṭkoṇe ca ṣaḍaṅgaṃ sampūjya 
pūrve glūṃgaganaratnebhyonamaḥ(,) dakṣiṇe slūṃsvargaratnebhyonamaḥ(,) 
iti paścime plūṃpātālaratnebhyonamaḥ(,) uttare mlūṃ 
manuṣyaratnebhyonamaḥ(,) nūṃnāgaratnebhyonamaḥ(,) itimadhye

<p. 31> sampūjya aiṃmūlaṃ amṛte(-)amṛtodbhave(-)amṛteśvari(-)amṛtavarṣiṇi 
amṛtaṃsrāvayasāṃjūṃjūṃ(-)amṛteśvaryai svāhā 
ityamṛteśvarīntridhā japtvā traiyambakena gāyatryā vā 
śāṃśīṃśūṃśaiṃśauṃśaḥ śukraśāpavimocitāyaisvāhā 
ityamṛteśī smṛtvā 
'akhaṇḍaikavarānandakareparasudhātmani | 
svacchandasphuraṇāmatra nidhehyamṛtarūpiṇī || 
sūryakoṭipratīkāśañcandrakoṭisuśītalam | 
aṣṭādaśabhujandevampañcavaktrantrilocanam | 
amṛtārṇavamadhyasthabrahmapadmoparisthitam | 
vṛṣārūḍhannīlakaṇṭhaṃ sarvābharaṇabhūṣitam |
kapālakhaṭvāṅgadharaṅghaṇṭāḍamaruvādinam ||
pāśāṅkuśadharandevaṅgadāmuśaladhāriṇam |
khaḍgakheṭakapaṭṭīśamudgarocchūlakuntinam ||
vicitrakheṭakammuṇḍa(/) vvaradābhayamālinam |
lohitandevadeveśambhāvayetsādhakottamaḥ ||
bhāvayecca surāndevīñcandrakoṭyayutaprabhām |
himakundendudhavalāmpañcavaktrāntrilocanām ||
aṣṭādaśabhujairyuktāṃ sarvānandakarodyatām |
prahasantī(/) vviśālākṣīndevadevasyasammukhīm ||' 
itimantreṇavāmāṅguṣṭhamadhyamābhyāndravyamuddhṛtyānaṃdabhaira
vamithunantatraivasampūjyasantarpyaca(-)amṛteśīṃsmṛtvā 
klīṃkulasthāmṛtākāresiddhijñānakarepare || amṛtatvannidhehyatra vastuni 
klinnarūpiṇi || haṃsaḥtarpayāminamaḥ' itipūrvavatsaṃtarpya 
amṛteśīṃsmṛtvā sauṃ tadrūpaikarasākhyañca datvāhyetatsvarūpiṇī || 
bhūtvā kulāmṛtākārammayi visphuraṇaṅkuru || 'haṃsaḥ' iti 
prāgvatsantarpyamūlaṃ saptadhājaptvā kavacenāvaguṇṭhyāstreṇa 
saṃrakṣya matsyamudrayācchādya yonidhenumudre pradarśayet || 
itiśrīpātrasthāpanavidhiḥ || dakṣiṇe argghyasthāpanaṃ kuryāt || tadyathā 
|| trikoṇavṛttaṣaṭkoṇabhūpurāṇikṛtvā | ādhāraśaktayenaḥ 
ityabhyarcyāgnimūrddhvaṅkoṇāgraṅkṛtvā śaṅkhamudrāndarśayet || 
śaṅkhamudrā yathā  'vāmamuṣṭyantareṅguṣṭhanniveśya

<p. 32> saralāṅgulīḥ || dakṣiṇasya karasyaiva vāmāṅguṣṭhenasaṃspṛśet || 
śaṅkhamudreyamākhyātā mantravidbhiranuttamā' itipuṣpākṣataiḥ 
ṣaḍaṅgāni(-)agnīśāsuravāyavyeṣu madhyadikṣu casampūjya 'phaṭ' iti 
prakṣālitamādhāraṃ saṃsthāpya tatra vahnimaṇḍalamabhyarcya(,) tara 
pūrvabījena śaṅkhamprakṣālya(,) tatra saṃsthāpya(,) 
pūrvoktamantreṇārkamaṇḍalantatra sampūjya mūlena jalandatvā(,) 
pūrvoktamantreṇa candramaṇḍalamabhyarcya 'gaṅgeca' ityādinā 
tīrthamāvāhya(,) 'vauṣaṭ' itisa(/)yojya sampūjya tīrthaśaktiñca sampūjya 
'vaṣaṭ' iti puṣpannyasya gālinīmudrāmpradarśya(,) 'ram' iti svadhābījena 
dhenumudrayā amṛtīkṛtya(,) iṣṭadevatāndhyātvā(,) sakalīkṛtya(,) ṣaḍaṅgāni 
sannyasya(,) astreṇa saṃrakṣya sampūjya aṣṭakṛtvomūlenābhimantrya(,) 
matsyamudrayācchādya(,) 
kuśāgrākṣatatilavrīhiyavājyasiddhārthampuṣpāṇi saṅkṣipya(,) 
yonimudrāndarśayitvā(,) 
śrīpātrasthajalaṅkiñcitsaṅkṣipedityargghyasthāpanavidhiḥ || tadvāme 
pādyapātrantrikoṇavṛttacaturasre ādhāraśaktiṃ sampūjyapātraṃ 
sādhāraṃ saṃsthāpya 'namaḥ' itimūlena vā jalena prapūrya 'vaṣaṭ' 
itipuṣpaṃ 'namaḥ' iti gandhañca niḥkṣipya uśīraṃ rocanañca 
śyāmākaviṣṇukrāntākṣadūrvā(-)itivā 
saṅkṣipyāstreṇāṣṭakṛtvo'bhimantrya mūlenābhimantryadhenuyonimudre 
darśayet || evantatpārśve ācamanīyapātrantrirāvṛttacaturasre 
ādhāraśaktiṃ sampūjya pātraṃ sādhāraṃ saṃsthāpya 'namaḥ' 
itimūlena vā jalena prapūrya 'vaṣaṭ' iti puṣpaṃ 'namaḥ' iti gandhañca 
niḥkṣipya 
jātikarpūrakaṅkolalavaṅgatamālakādicūrṇannikṣipyāstreṇāṣṭakṛtvo'
bhimantrya mūlenābhimantrya dhunuyonimudredarśayet || taddakṣiṇe 
madhuparkapātrantrikoṇavṛttacaturasre ādhāraśaktisampūjya pātra 
sādhārammadhughṛtaśarkarādadhidugdhayutaṃ 
saṃsthāpyāstreṇāṣṭakṛtvobhimantryamūlenābhimantryadhenuyonimudre 
darśayet || taddakṣe snānīyapātrantrikoṇavṛttacaturasre ādhāraśakti 
sampūjya pātraṃ sādhāraṃ saṃsthāpya 'namaḥ' iti mūlena vā jalena

<p. 33> prapūrya 'vaṣaṭ' itipuṣpaṃ 'namaḥ' itigandhañca nikṣipya uśīraṃ 
rocanañca 
saṃkṣipyāstreṇāṣṭakṛtvo'bhimantryamūlenābhimantryadhenuyonimudre 
darśayet | tatraiva śrīcandanādipuṣpandakṣevasanabhūṣaṇādi tatraiva 
sthāpayet 
sāmānyārgghyasthajalenaviśeṣajalenavābhiṣicyamūlenāṣṭavāramabhim
antrya dhenuyonimudre darśayet | evaṃ sarvavastuśodhana(/) 
vviśeṣajalenātmamṛrdhni bhairavau tarpayet | śrīpātrāmṛtena 
viśeṣārgghyapātreṇa vā devīṃ hṛdi trivārantarpayet || tarpaṇañca 
tattvamudrayā || sā cānāmikāṅguṣṭhayogena bodhyā || atra 
tattvaśuddhyādyapi kaulikairācaraṇīyam || tadyathā tatra śrutiḥ || 
prāṇāpānavyānodānasamānā me śudhyantāṃ jyotirahaṃ virajā 
vipāpmā bhūyāsaṃ svāhā | oṃ pṛthivyaptejovāyvākāśāni me 
śuddhyantāmityādi oṃ prakṛtyahaṅkārabuddhimanaḥśrotrāṇi me 
śuddhyantāṃ jyotirahaṃ virajā vipāpmā bhūyāsaṃ svāhā | oṃ 
sparśarūparasagandhākāśāni me śuddhyantām jyotirahaṃ virajā 
vipāpmā bhūyāsaṃ svāhā | oṃ vāyutejaḥsalilabhūmyātmāno me 
śuddhyantāñjyotirahaṃ vvirajā vipāpmā bhūyāsaṃ svāhā | iti 
parāmṛśan saptadhā sarvāṅge oṃ tvakcakṣurjihvāghrāṇavacāṃsi me 
śuddhyantām || jyotirahaṃ virajā vipāpmā bhūyāsaṃ svāhā | oṃ 
pāṇipādapāyūpasthaśabdā me śuddhyantām jyotiraha(/) vvirajā 
vipāpmā bhūyāsaṃ svāhā || ititattvaśuddhiḥ || 
īśānavahniniṛtivāyukoṇeṣu maṇḍalāni vidhāya 
baṭukayoginīgaṇeśakṣetrapālabhūtebhyaḥ sampūjya 
vaṭakādibalindadyāt | maṇḍalamabhyarccya vaṭakādidravyasaṃsthāpayet || 
oṃ ehyehidevī putrakapiśajaṭābhārabhāsvarajvālāmukha 
sarvavighnānnāśaya nāśaya sarvopacārasahitambaliṅgṛhṇagṛhṇa 
svāhā || anenāṅguṣṭhānāmikāyogena īśāne baṭukāya balindadyāt || 
ūrddhvambrahmāṇḍato vā divigatasutale bhūtale niṣkale vā pātāle 
vānale vā salilapavanayoryatratatrasthitāvā || kṣetre pīṭhopapīṭhādiṣu 
kṛtasupadāḥ

<p. 34> puṣpadhūpādikena prītā devyassadātāśśubhavalividhināyāntu 
devendratulyāḥ || 'yāṃ yīṃ yūṃ yaiṃ yauṃ yaḥ yoginībhyaḥ 
hū(/)phaṭsvāhā' anena kaniṣṭhāṅguṣṭhayogena vahnikoṇe balindadyāt || 
'kṣāṃkṣīṃkṣūṃkṣaiṃkṣauṃkṣaḥ 
kṣetrapāladhūpadīpādisahitambaliṃ gṛhṇagṛhṇasvāhā' 
aṅguṣṭhatarjjanībhyā(/) vvāyukoṇe balindadyāt || 
'gāṃgīṃgūṃvaravaradasarvajanamme vaśamānaya baliṃ gṛhṇagṛhṇa 
svāhā' muṣṭimadhyasthāmaṅgulīndaṇḍavatkṛtvā naiṛte balindadyāt || 
vāmabhāge maṇḍalaṃ kṛtvā sādhārapātraṃ saṃsthāpya tatra 
balidravyandattvā sekādikṛtvā 'oṃ 
hrīṃsarvavighnakṛdbhyaḥsarvabhūtebhyohū(/)phaṭsvāhā' ityanena 
tattvamudrayā bhūtehyo balindadyāt | idambalidāna(/)vastutaḥpuraścaraṇe 
eva karttavyam || suvarṇasphaṭikādau 
kāśmīramṛganābhimalayodbhavaraktacandanādidravyeṇa 
'āsurekhevajrarekhehūmphaṭsvāhā' itimantreṇa ca 
ṣaṭkoṇagarbbhantrikoṇatrayāṣṭadalabhūpurātmaka(/) yyantra(/) llikhet || tatra 
pañcagavyena pañcāmṛtena ca prakṣālya prāṇapratiṣṭhāmantreṇa 
aṣṭottaraśatakṛtvaḥ prāṇān pratiṣṭhāpya || mantroyathā 
'āṃhrīkroṃyaṃraṃlaṃvaṃśaṃṣaṃsaṃhoṃoṃkṣaṃsaṃhaṃsaḥhrīṃ 
oṃ haṃsaḥ 
śrīmaddakṣiṇakālikāyāṣṣaṭkoṇagarbbhatrikoṇatrayāṣṭadalabhūpurāt
makayantrasya sajīvavāṅmanaścakṣuśśrotraghrāṇaprāṇā ihāgatya 
sukhaṃ cirantiṣṭhantu svāhā' || tataḥ 'oṃyantrarājāya vidmahe 
mahāyantrāya dhīmahi | tanno yantraḥpracodayāt' itidaśadhā japtvā(,) 
daśadhāpuṣpāñjaliṃsaṅkṣipya(,) homaṃ kṛtvā pratihome 
hutaśeṣantasminkṣipet | tatrādhāraśaktyādipūjanaṅkuryāt || tadyathā 
'hrīṃ ādhāraśaktibhyonamaḥ iti sampūjya | tato 
raktacandanapuṣpākṣatapuñjannidhāya 'oṃ jayāyainamaḥ' 
'oṃvijayāyainamaḥ' 'oṃ ajitāyainamaḥ' 'oṃ aparājitāyainamaḥ' 
'oṃnityāyainamaḥ' 'oṃvilāsinyainamaḥ' 'oṃdogghryainamaḥ' 'oṃ 
aghorāyainamaḥ' 'oṃmaṅgalāyainamaḥ' itipīṭhaśaktīrabhyarcya 
'hrīṃkālikāyogapīṭhātmanenamaḥ' 
'hsauṃsadāśivamahāpretapadmāsanāyanamaḥ' ityabhyrcya

<p. 35> tato devī(/) yyajet | hastepuṣpākṣatapuñjannidhāya 
kūrmamudrā(/)vvidhāya kulakuṇḍalinī hṛdayadeśe ānīya tanmukhe 
prakṣipya tāmparabrahmaṇi 
saṅgamayyacandramaṇḍalāntargatāmṛtalolībhūtāndvidale sanniveśya 
vāmanāsāpuṭena 'yam' itiniṣkṛṣya pūrvaṅkāmakalāndhyāyet | 

'mukhambinduvadākārantadadhaḥkucayugmakam |
tadadhassaparāṅgañca sapariṣkṛtamaṇḍalam ||'

	tataḥ puṣpādicakre kṣipet | devīndhyātvā āvāhayet | dhyānañca

'karālavadanāṅghorāmmuktakeśīñcaturbbhujām |
kālikāndakṣiṇāndivyāmmuṇḍamālāvibhūṣitām || (1) ||
sadyaśchinnasiraḥ khaḍgavāmordhvādhaḥ karāmbujām |
abhaya(/) vvaradañcaiva dakṣiṇādhordhvapāṇikām || (2) ||
mahāmeghaprabhāṃ śyāmāntathā caivadigambarām |
kaṇṭhāvasaktamuṇḍālīgaladrudhiracarcitām || (3) ||
karṇāvataṃsatānītaśavayugmabhayānakām | 
ghoradaṃṣṭrākarālāsyāmpīnonnatapayodharām || (4) ||
śavānāṅkarasaṅghātaiḥkṛtākāñcīṃ hasanmukhīm |
sṛkkadvayagaladraktadhārāvisphuritānanām || (5) ||
gorarūpāmmahāraudrīṃ śmaśānālayavāsinīm |
danturāndakṣiṇavyāpimuktalambakacoccayām || (6) ||
śavarūpamahādevahṛdayoparisaṃsthitām |
śivābhirghorarūpābhiścaturdikṣusamanvitām || (7) ||
mahākālena sārddhorddhvamupaviṣṭaratāturām |
sukhaprasannavadanāṃ smerānanasaroruhām || (8) ||
evaṃ sañcintayeddevīṃśmaśānālayavāsinīm |'

athavāhaṃsatantroktandhyānaṅkuryāt | yathā(-)

'namāmi dakṣiṇāmūrtiṅkālikāmparabhairavīm |
bhinnāñjanacayaprakhyāmpravīraśavasaṃsthitām || (1) ||
galacchoṇitadhārābhiḥ smerānanasaroruhām |
pīnonnatakucadvandvāmpīnavakṣonitambinīm || (2) ||
dakṣiṇāmmuktakeśālīndigambaravinodinīm |
mahākālaśavāviṣṭāṃ smerānandoparisthitām || (3) ||
mukhaṃsāndrasmitāmodamodinīmmadavihvalām |
āraktamukhasāndrābhirnnetrālībhirvirājitām || (4) ||

<p. 36> śavadvayakṛtottaṃsāṃ sindūratilakojjvalām |
pañcāśanmuṇḍaghaṭitamālāśoṇitalohitām || (5) ||
nānāmaṇiviśobhāḍhya(-)nānālaṅkāraśobhitām |
śavāsthikṛtakeyūraśaṅkhakaṅkaṇamaṇḍitām || (6) ||
śavavakṣassamārūḍhā(/) llelihānāṃ śavaṅkvacit |
śavamāṃsakṛtagrāsāṃ sāṭṭahāsammuhurmmuhuḥ || (7) ||
khaḍgamuṇḍadharā(/) vvāme savye'bhayavarapradām |
danturāñca mahāraudrīñcaṇḍanādātibhīṣaṇām || (8) ||
śivābhirghorarūpābhirveṣṭitāmbhayanāśinīm |
mā bhairmā bhaissvabhakteṣu jalpantiṅghoraniḥsvanaiḥ || (9) ||
yūyaṅkimicchatha brūta dadāmītiprabhāṣiṇīm |' 

itidhyāyet || āvāhanañca 'ātmasaṃsthāmajāṃ 
śuddhāntvāmahamparameśvarīm || 
āraṇyamivahavyāṃśammūrttāvāvāhayāmyaham' itimūlañca paṭhan 
'bhagavati dakṣiṇakālike ihāgaccha' iti 
prasāritasaṃhatāṅgulīmūlaparvaṇoraṅguṣṭhau niḥkṣipya āvāhayet || 
tataḥ 'oṃ deveśi bhaktisulabhe parivārasamanvite || yāvattvāmpūjayiṣyāmi 
tāvattvaṃ susthirā bhava || taveyammahimāmūrtistasyāntvāṃ 
sarvagāmprabho || bhaktisnehasamākṛṣṭāndīpavatsthāpayāmyaham' || 
itimūlampaṭhitvā pūrvoktayā adhomukhyā mudrayā sthāpayet || 'oṃ 
sarvāntaryāminyai devi sarvabījamaye śubhe | svātmasthāyai paraṃ 
śuddhamāsanaṅkalpayāmyaham' mūlañca paṭhanpadmamudrayā 
puṣpādyāsanandadyāt || tataḥ 'oṃ asminvarāsane devi 
sukhāsīne'kṣarātmike || prathiṣṭhitā bhavessā tvamprasīda parameśvari' 
mūlañca paṭhan 'iha pratiṣṭhitābhava' itipūrvoktayā mudrayā 
pratiṣṭhāpayet | 'ananyā tatra deveśi mūrtiśaktiriyamprabho | 
sānnidhyaṅkuru tasyāntvambhaktānugrahatatpare' mūlañca paṭhan 'iha 
sannidhehi' ucchitāṅguṣṭhamuṣṭayossa(/)yyogātsannidhāpanamudrayā 
sannidhānaṅkuryāt || 'oṃ ājñayā tava deveśi kṛpāmbhodhe guṇāmbudhe 
|| ātmanā caikadṛptāntvāṃ saṃruṇaddhi maheśvari' itimūlañca paṭhan 

<p. 37> antaḥ praveśitāṅguṣṭhamuṣṭyātmikayā 'iha sannirudhyasva' 
itisannirodhanaṅkuryāt || 'ajñānāddurmanastvādvā vaikalyātsādhakasya 
ca || mama ūnaṃ bhavetkṛtyantadāpyābhimukhībhava' iti(,) mūlañca paṭhan 
'ihasammukhībhava' 
itiuttānamuṣṭiyugalātmikayāsammukhīkaraṇaṅkuryāt || tato 'hūma' 
ityanena 
savyahastamuṣṭidīrghādhomukhatarjjanyātmikayā'bhitobhrāmitayā'vagu.
nṭhayet || 'oṃdaśapīyūṣavarṣiṇyāpūrayedyajñaviṣṭaram || mūrttau 
vāyajñasampūrttau sthirābhava maheśvari || devatāṅge 
ṣaḍaṅganyāsātmakaṃ sakalīkaraṇaṅkuryāt || tadyathā 
'krāṃhṛdayāyanamaḥ(,) krīṃśirasesvāhā(,) krūṃśikhāyaivaṣaṭ(,) 
kraiṃkavacāyahūm(,) krauṃnetratrayāyavauṣaṭ(,) kraḥ astrāyaphaṭ || tataḥ 
'svabhaktavāṅmanaścakṣuḥśrotradūrārpitasthite || svatejaḥ 
pañjareṇāśu veṣṭitā bhava sarvataḥ ||' svadhābījena dhenumudrayā 
amṛtīkaraṇam || tato mahāmudrayā paramīkaraṇam || mahāmudrā yathā  
'anyonyagrathitāṅguṣṭhāprasāritaparāṅguliḥ || mahāmudreyamuditā 
paramīkaraṇe priye ||' tathā 'oṃyasyādarśanamicchanti 
devāssvābhīṣṭasiddhaye || tasyai te paramaiśānyai āgataṃ svāgatañca 
me' mūlañca paṭhan 'sāṅge sāyudhe savāhane sāvaraṇe 
śrīmaddakṣiṇakālike tava svāgatam' 
itiprasāritāṅgulyadhomukhakaradvayena svāgataṅkuryāt || 'oṃ 
kṛtārthonugṛhītosmi saphalajjīvitañca me | āgatā devadeveśi 
susvāgatamidampunaḥ' mūlañca paṭhannūrdhvamukhyā 
pūrvoktamudrayā susvāgataṅkuryāt || 
lelihānamudrayāprāṇasthāpanampūrvoktarītyā kuryāt || lelihānamudrā 
yathā || 'tarjjanīmadhyamānāmāṃ samāṅkuryādadhomukhīm | 
anāmāyāṅkṣipedbaddhāmṛjuṅkṛtvā kaniṣṭhikām || 
lelihānātmamudreyañjīvanyāse prakīrttitā || ' 
pūrvoktaprāṇasthāpanarītiryathā  
āṃhrīṃkroṃyaṃraṃlaṃvaṃśaṃṣaṃsaṃhoṃoṃkṣaṃsaṃhaṃsaḥ 
hrīṃoṃhaṃsaḥ śrīmaddakṣiṇakālikāyāḥ prāṇā iha prāṇāḥ | 
āṃhrīkroṃyaṃraṃlaṃvaṃśaṃhoṃoṃkṣaṃsaṃhaṃsaḥhrīṃoṃsaḥ 
śrīmaddakṣiṇakālikāyā jīva iha sthitaḥ | āṃhrīṃkroṃ(-)

<p. 38> yaṃraṃlaṃvaṃśaṃṣaṃsaṃhoṃoṃkṣaṃsaṃhaṃsaḥhrīṃ oṃ 
haṃsaḥ śrīmaddakṣiṇakālikāyāssarvendriyāṇi iha sthitāni | 
āṃhrīṃkroṃyaṃraṃlaṃvaṃśaṃṣaṃsaṃhoṃsaḥ 
oṃkṣaṃsaṃhaṃsaḥśrīmaddakṣiṇakālikāyā 
vāṅmanastvakcakṣuśśrotrajihvāghrāṇaprāṇā ihāgatya 
sukhañcirantiṣṭhantu svāhā || tato mūlamantreṇārgghyodakena 
triḥprokṣaṇam | śālagrāme maṇau yantre nāvāhanavisarjjane || 
prāṇapratiṣṭhāñca na kuryāt ||' yonimmahāyoniñca badhvā 
khaḍgamuṇḍā'bhayavaramudrāndarśayet | mahāyonimudrā yathā  
'tarjjanyanāmike madhye kaniṣṭhe ca kramādapi | karayoryojayeccaiva 
kaniṣṭhāmūlabhedataḥ | aṅguṣṭhāgrantu niḥkṣipya mahāyoniḥ 
prakīrttitā || adhomukhīmimāṅkṛtvā darśayedbījapūrvikām ||' bījam 
aimiti || yonimudrāyāntu(-) 'aṅguṣṭhāgrantu na niḥkṣipediti ||' 
khaḍgādimudrā tu spaṣṭaiva | tataḥ puṣpāñjalindadyāt || tatra ekampāde(,) 
dvitīyañjānuni(,) tṛtīyannābhau(,) caturthaṃ hṛdaye(,) mastake pañcamamiti || 
tataḥ pādyādi dadyāt || tadyathā | 
'yadbhaktileśasamparkātparamānandasambhavaḥ || tasmai te caraṇābjāya 
pādyaṃ śuddhāya kalpaye' iti(,) mūlañca paṭhan 
'idampādyandakṣiṇakālikāyainivedayāmi namaḥ' 
itipūrvoktapuṣpagandhośīrarocanaśyāmāka 
viṣṇukrāntābjadūrvyāyutañjalamanāmāṅguṣṭhayoryogena 
pādayordadyāt | 'oṃ vedānāmapi vedāya devānāndevatātmane | 
ācamaṅkalpayāmīśi śuddhānāṃ śuddhihetave' mūlañca paṭhan 
'idamācamanīyandakṣiṇakālikāyai nivedayāmi' 
ityācamanīyaṅkaniṣṭhāhīnonnatasa(/)yyuktacaturaṅgulīrūpācamanamudra
yācandanapuṣpajātīkarpūrakaṅkolalavaṅgatamālakādicūrṇasa(/)yyuktajal
ammukhe dadyāt | 'oṃ sarvakāluṣyahīnāyai paripūrṇasukhātmane | 
madhuparkamidandevi kalpayāmi prasīda me' mūlañca paṭhan 
sa(/)yyuktādhomukhyanāmikāspṛṣṭāṅguṣṭhātmikayāmadhughṛtaśarkara
adadhidugdhasaṅghātātmakammadhuparkammukhe dadyāt || 'oṃ 
ucchiṣṭopyaśucirvāpi yasyāḥ 

<p. 39> smaraṇamātrataḥ |
śuddhimāpnoti tasyai te punarācamanīyakam' iti mūlañca 
paṭhanpūrvavadācamanīyammukhe dadyāt || 'oṃ 
tāpatrayaharandivyamparamānandalakṣaṇam | 
tāpatrayavinirmuktantavārghyaṅkalpayāmyaham ||' iti mūlañca paṭhan 
'idamargghyandakṣiṇakālikāyai nivedayāmi(,) eṣorgghaḥ 
śrīmaddakṣiṇakālikāyai svāhā' ityanena paṭhitena 
kuśāgrākṣatatilavrīhiyavājyasiddhārthapuṣpamiśritajalātmakādyāñchi
rasi sarvāṅgulīsa(/)yyogena dadyāt | tato haridrādyudvarttanadravyantailañca 
dadyāt || 'oṃ snehaṃ gṛhāṇa snehena lokamātarmahāśaye | sarvalokeṣu 
śuddhātmandadāmi snehamuttamam |' mūlañcapaṭhan 
idaṃharidrādidravyantailañcadakṣiṇakālikāyai nivedayāmi 'namaḥ' 
ityuktvā udvarttayet || 'oṃ paramānandabodhābdhinimagnanijamūrttaye | 
sāṅgopāṅgamidaṃ snānaṅkalpayāmyahamīśvari' mūlañcapaṭhan 
'idaṃsnānīyandakṣiṇakālikāyai nivedayāmi(,) idaṃ 
snānīyandakṣiṇakālikāyainamaḥ' itipaṭhitvā 
kaniṣṭhāhīnadakṣahastamuṣṭyātmikayā mudrayāsnānīyandadyāt || 
śatakṛtvaḥ sahasrakṛtvo yathāśakti vā mūlampaṭhansnapayet | 'oṃ 
māyācitrapaṭacchannanijaguhyorutejase || nivāraṇāya vijñānavāsaste 
kalpayāmyaham' mūlañca paṭhan 'ida(/) vvāso dakṣiṇakālikāyai' 
ityādyuktavākyena 
uttānadakṣiṇahastāṅguṣṭhaspṛṣṭatanmadhyamātmikayā rakta(/) vvāso 
dadyāt || 'oṃ yāmāśritya mahādevo jagatsaṃhārakassadā | tasyai te 
parameśānyai kalpayāmyuttarīyakam idamuttarīyandakṣiṇakālikāyai 
ityādivākyena pūrvoktamudrayottarīyandadyāt || tato 
mūlenāṣṭottarasahasraśatadaśānyatamavāraṅgandhodakairdevīmabhiṣi~
ncet || ' oṃ svabhāvasundarāṅgāyai nānāśaktyāśrite śive || bhūṣaṇāni 
vicitrāṇi kalpayāmyamarārcite' 'etāni bhūṣaṇāni dakṣiṇakālikāyai 
nivedayāminamaḥ' iti 
vākyenadakṣahastāṅguṣṭhaspṛṣṭānāmikātmikayāmudrayābhūṣaṇān
idadyāt || 
mūlamantreṇasampuṭitampratyekamātṛkākṣarampaṭhandevatāṅgeṣu

<p. 40> vinyaset || 'oṃ paramānandasaubhāgyaparipūrṇadigantare | 
gṛhāṇaparamaṅgandhaṅkṛpayā parameśvari ||' mūlañca paṭhan 
'idañcandanaṃ śrīdakṣiṇakālikāyai namaḥ' itivākyena 
karpūramiśritaśrīkhaṇḍacandanambahucaṃdanañca 
kaniṣṭhāṅguṣṭhasa(/)yyogenadevyaṅge nivedayet || 'oṃ akṣatāndhavalān devi 
svarṇaraupyamayīkṛtān | gṛhāṇajagadīśāne prasīda parameśvari' || 
mūlañca paṭhan 'sāṅgāyaisāyudhāyaisabalavāhanāyai saparivārāyai 
śrīdakṣiṇakālikāyainivedayāminamaḥ' itivākyenasarvāṅgulībhirdadyāt 
|| tataḥ 'oṃturīyavanasambhūtannānāguṇamanoharam || 
amandasaurabhampuṣpaṅgṛhyatāmidamuttamam' 'etāni puṣpāṇi 
dakṣiṇakālikāyai vauṣaṭ' iti(,) mūlañca paṭhaṃstarjjanyaṅguṣṭhayogena 
dadyāt || yathotpannamaparyuṣitamacchidrannavaṃ śubhampuppandadyāt || 
añjalidāne tvadhomukhatā na doṣāya 
'śvetaraktajapāpuṣpakaravīratagarajātīsevantīyūyikādhattūrāśokabakul
aśvetakṛṣṇāparājitābakapuṣpabilvapattracampakanāgakeśaramallikājhiṇ
ikākāñcībarbarākaraktapadmapuṣpāmalakakokanadabandhūkaketakyādy
anyatamapuṣpannivedayet || arkamandārau atipraśastau tulasīmmālatī(/) 
vvarjjayet || dūrvayā nārccayet || dhūpabhājanaṃ 'phaṭ' iti samprokṣya 
'namaḥ' ityabhyarcya vāyubījena dvādaśavārajaptena saṃśoṣya 
vāmahastatale dakṣahastapṛṣṭhanniveśya 'ram' itibījena 
ṣoḍaśavārajaptena sandahya vāmahastapṛṣṭhe dakṣahastatalanniveśya(,) 
'vam' iti ṣoḍaśavārajaptena dhenumudrayā'mṛtīkṛtya(,) 
mūlenāṣṭaśo'bhimantrya 'jayadhvanimantramātaḥsvāhā' itighaṇṭāṃ 
sampūjya vāmatarjjanyā saṃspṛśya mūlampaṭhan 'oṃvanaspatirasopeto 
gandhāḍhyaḥ sumanoharaḥ || āghreyaḥ 
sarvadevānāndhūpo'yampratigṛhyatām' 'eṣa dhūpaḥ 
śrīdakṣiṇakālikāyai namaḥ' itiśaṅkhāmbu prakṣipedbhūmau tato 
vāmahastena ghaṇṭā(/)vvādayan dakṣatarjjanyaṅguṣṭhayogena 
dhūpamudrāndarśayan devatāguṇānkīrttayannābhideśato 

<p. 41> dhūpayet || puṣpāñjalitrayandadyāt || evandīpadānaprakāraḥ 'oṃ 
suprakāśo mahādīpaḥ sarvatastimirāpahaḥ || 
sabāhyābhyantarajyotirddipoyampratigṛhyatām' iti(,) mūlañcapaṭhan 
madhyamāṅguṣṭhayogena dīpamudrāmpradarśśya netrapradeśe 
dīpandarśśayet || ghṛtadīpo dakṣiṇe deyastailadīpo vāmataḥ || 
svarṇādibhājane sājyaśarkarapāyasādikampariviṣya caturasre nidhāya 
'phaṭ' iti mantreṇa cakramudrayā'bhirakṣya dvādaśavārajaptena 'yam' 
itivāyubījena saṃśoṣya vāmahastataledakṣahastapṛṣṭhe niveśya 'ram' 
itivahnibījena dvādaśavārajaptena sandahya(,) dakṣakarāgreṇa saṃspṛśya 
'vam' itisudhābījena dhenumudrayā'mṛtīkṛtya mūlamantreṇa 
karābhyāṃ saṃspṛśya aṣṭadhācābhimantrya 
dhenumudrāmpradarśśyagandhapuṣpaiḥ samabhyarcya 'tattvākhyamudrayā 
devyai naivedyaṃ hi nivedayet ||' 'oṃ satpātrasiddhaṃ 
sahavirvividhānekabhakṣaṇam || nivedayāmi deveśi kṛpayā tvaṅgṛhāṇa 
tat' || itipaṭhan grāsamudrāmpradarśśyaśaṅkhodakenanivedayet || tataḥ 'oṃ 
samastadevadeveśi sarvāvāptikaramparam || akhaṇḍānandasampūrṇe 
gṛhāṇajalamuttamam ||' itipānīyamācamanīyañca dattvā 
culuka(/)vvidhivaddadyāt | pañcamudrāḥ 
prāṇāpānasamānodānavyānākhyāḥ pradarśayet || tadyathā 
kaniṣṭhānāmikābhyāmprāṇamudrā | 
madhyamātarjjanībhyāmapānākhyā | anāmāmadhyamābhyāṃ 
samānākhyā | anāmātarjjanībhyāmudānākhyā | 
sarvāṅgulībhirvvyānākhyā | tato mūlena tāmbūlaṃ 
sādhakastattvamudrayā 
elālavaṅgakarppūrajātīphalādisa(/)yyutantamāladalakarpūrapūgeritammud
ānvitāndhyāyan 'phaṭ' itisamprokṣya 'namaḥ' ityabhyarcya vāyubījena 
dvādaśavārajaptena saṃśoṣya || vāmahastatalaṃ dakṣahastapṛṣṭhe 
niveśya 'ram' 
itibījenadvādaśavārajaptenasandahyavāmahastapṛṣṭhedakṣahastatalanniveś
ya 'vam' itisudhābījenadhenumudrayā amṛtīkṛtya 
mūlenāṣṭavāramabhimantrya 'oṃelālavaṅgakarpūranāgavallīdalairyutam 
|| pūgabhāgeritandevi tāmbūlaṅgṛhyatānnamaḥ

<p. 42> 'mūlampaṭhan 'idantāmbūlaṃ śrīdakṣiṇakālikāyai 
nivedayāminamaḥ' itimukhapradeśe tattvamudrayā dadyāt || tataḥ 
puṣpāñjaliṅgṛhītvā 'oṃ sa(/)vvinmaye pareśāni parāmṛte carupriye || 
anujñāndakṣiṇe dehi parivārārccanāya me' || tatra prathamaṃ 
ṣaḍaṅgapūjā | agnīśāsuravāyavyeṣu madhye dikṣu ca ṣaḍaṅgaśaktīḥ 
pūjayet || tāsāndhyānantu(-) 'tuṣārasphaṭika 
śyāmanīlakṛṣṇāruṇāstathā || varadābhayadhāriṇyaḥ pradhānatanavaḥ 
striyaḥ' itidhyātvā 'hṛdayadevate(-)ihāgaccha(-)
ihatiṣṭhakrāṃhṛdayāyanamaḥ śrīpādukāmpūjayāmi' itisampūjya 
tataḥ 'śirodevate(-)ihāgaccha(-)
ihatiṣṭhakrīṃśirasesvāhāśrīpādukāmpūjayāmi' 'śikhādevate(-)
ihāgaccha(-)ihatiṣṭhakrūṃśikhāyai vaṣaṭśrīpādukāmpūjayāmi' 
'kavacadevate(-)ihāgaccha(-)ihatiṣṭhakraiṃkavacāyahum || 
śrīpādukāmpūjayāmi' 'netratrayadevate ihāgaccha iha 
tiṣṭhakrauṃnetratrayāyavauṣaṭśrīpādukāmpūjayāmi' 'astradevate(-)
ihāgaccha(-)ihatiṣṭha kraḥ astrāyaphaṭśrīpādukāmpūjayāmi' tato 
vāyavyādīśānaparyantaṅgurupaṅktimpūjayet || tatra gurukramoyathā 
'mahādevī mahādevastripuraścaiva bhairavaḥ || divyaughā 
guravaḥproktāssiddhaughānkathayāmi te || brahmānandaḥ 
pūrṇadevaścalaccittaścalācalaḥ | kumāraḥkrodhanaścaiva 
varadassmaradīpanaḥ || māyāmāyāvatī caiva mānavaughāñchṛṇupriye || 
vimalaḥ kuśalaścaiva śrīmatsenassudhākaraḥ || prahlādassanakaścaiva 
vasiṣṭho bodha evaca || mīno gorakṣakaścaiva bhojadevaḥprajāpatiḥ || 
mūladevo rantidevo vighneśvarahutāśanau || 
samayānandasantoṣaukālikāguravastathā || ānandanāthaśabdānte 
guravassarvasiddhidāḥ || striyopi gururūpāścedambāntāḥ parikīrtitāḥ' || 
tataḥ pūjā 'mahādevyamba ihāgaccha 
ihatiṣṭhamahādevyambāśrīpādukāmpūjayāmi || mahādevānandanātha 
ihāgaccha iha tiṣṭha mahādevānandanātha śrīpādukāmpūjayāmi || 
tripurānandanātha ihāgaccha ihatiṣṭha 
tripurānandanāthaśrīpādukāmpūjayāmi || bhairavānandanātha

<p. 43> ihāgaccha ihatiṣṭha bhairavānandanāthaśrīpādukāmpūjayāmi | 
athasiddhaughā(-)ihāgacchata(-)ihatiṣṭhata 
brahmānandānandanāthaśrīpādukāmpūjayāmi | 
pūrṇadevānandanāthaśrīpādukāmpūjayāmi | calaccittānandanātha 
śrīpādukāmpūjayāmi | calācalānandanāthaśrīpādukāmpūjayāmi || 
kumārānandanāthaśrīpādukāmpūjayāmi | 
krodhānandanāthaśrīpādukāmpūjayāmi | 
varadānandanāthaśrīpādukāmpūjayāmi | 
smaradīpanānandanāthaśrīpādukāmpūjayāmi | 
māyāmbāśrīpādukāmpūjayāmi | 
māyāvatyambāśrīpādukāmpūjayāmi' || iti || atha mānavaughā 
ihāgacchata ihatiṣṭhata || 'vimalānandanāthaśrīpādukāmpūjayāmi | 
kuśalānandanāthaśrīpādukāmpūajayāmi || 
śrīmatsenānandanāthaśrīpādukāmpūjayāmi || 
sudhākarānandanāthaśrīpādukāmpūjayāmi | 
prahlādānandanāthaśrīpādukāmpūjayāmi | 
sanakānandanāthaśrīpādukāmpūjayāmi | 
vasiṣṭhānandanāthaśrīpādukāmpūjayāmi | 
bodhānandanāthaśrīpādukāmpūjayāmi | 
mīnānandanāthaśrīpādukāmpūjayāmi | 
gorakṣakānandanāthaśrīpādukāmpūjayāmi | 
bhojadevānandanāthaśrīpādukāmpūjayāmi | 
prajāpatyānandanāthaśrīpādukāmpūjayāmi | 
mūladevānandanāthaśrīpādukāmpūjayāmi | 
rantidevānandanāthaśrīpādukāmpūjayāmi | 
vighneśvarānandanāthaśrīpādukāmpūjayāmi | 
hutāśanānandanāthaśrīpādukāmpūjayāmi | 
samayānandanāthaśrīpādukāmpūjayāmi | 
santoṣānandanāthaśrīpādukāmpūjayāmi |' tato nijaguruṃpurodhyātvā 
pañcopacāraissampūjya(,) tataḥ 'oṃ abhīṣṭasiddhimmedehi 
śaraṇāgatapālike | bhaktyā samarpaye tubhyamidamāvaraṇārccanam' 
itimūlañca paṭhan puṣpacandanayutaśaṅkhodakena devyā vāmahaste 
āvaraṇapūjāṃ samarppayet  tatoraśmivṛndadevatāḥ pūjayet | 
tāsāndhyāna(/) yyathā 'sarvāḥ śyāmā asikarā 
muṇḍamālāvibhūṣitāḥ | tarjjanī(/) 
vvāmahastenadhārayantyaścasasmitāḥ' || 

<p. 44> bāhyatrikoṇasya sammukhakoṇe 
'oṃkālīśrīpādukāmpūjayāminamaḥ' itipādyādibhistriḥ kālīṃ 
sampūjayet || evandevyā vāme 'oṃ 
kapālinīśrīpādukāmpūjayāminamaḥ' iti || dakṣe 'oṃ 
kullāśrīpādukāmpūjayāmi' ityādi tadantastrikoṇesammukhe 'oṃ 
kurukullāśrīpādukāmpūjayāmi' ityādi || vāme 'oṃ 
virodhinīśrīpādukāmpūjayāmi' ityādi || dakṣe 'oṃ 
vipracittāśrīpādukāmpūjayāmi' ityādi || tadantastrikoṇesammukhe 
'oṃugrāśrīpādukāmpūjayāmi' ityādi || tato vāme 'oṃ 
ugraprabhāśrīpādukāmpūjayāmi' ityādi || dakṣe 'oṃ 
dīptāśrīpādukāmpūjayāmi' ityādi || tadantastrikoṇe sammukhe 'oṃ 
nīlāśrīpādukāmpūjayāmi' ityādi || vāme 
'ghanāśrīpādukāmpūjayāmi' ityādi || dakṣe 
'oṃbalākāśrīpādukāmpūjayāmi' ityādi | tadantastrikoṇe sammukhe 
'oṃmātrāśrīpādukāmpūjayāmi' ityādi || vāme 
'oṃmudrāśrīpādukāmpūjayāmi' ityādi || dakṣe 
oṃmitrāśrīpādukāmpūjayāmi ityādi | pūrvoktavākyaiḥ pādyādibhiḥ 
pūjayet || tato devyā dakṣe 'hsauṃmahākālāyahūṃphaṭ' 
itimantreṇamahākālampūjayet || kulārṇavetu oṃ 
hrīṃkṣmīṃhūṃmahākālāyahauṃmahādevāyakrīṃkālikāyai hau 
itimahākālamantraḥ || taddhyānantu 
'añjanādrinibhandevampiṅgakeśandvibāhukam || 
āśāmbaraṃsarpabhūṣābhūṣitampraṇamāmi tam' 
itidhyātvāpūrvoktamantradvayānyatareṇa mahākālampūjayet || tataḥ 'oṃ 
abhīṣṭisiddhimme dehi śaraṇāgatapālike | 
bhaktyāsamarppayetubhyamidamāvaraṇārccanam' itimantreṇa 
śaṅkhodakādinā devyā vāmahaste āvaraṇārccanaṃ samarpayet || 
tatoṣṭadale pūrvādikrameṇāṣṭaśaktīḥ pūjayet || tadyathā pūrve 'oṃ 
āṃbrahmāṇīśrīpādukāmpūjayāminamaḥ' 
ityādivākyenapādyādibhistrissampūjayet | agnikoṇe 'oṃ īṃ 
śrīnārāyaṇīśrīpādukāmpūjayāmi' ityādi || dakṣiṇe 'oṃ ūṃ 
māheśvarīśrīpādukāmpūjayāmi'

<p. 45> ityādi || nairṛte 'oṃ ṛṃ śrīcāmuṇḍāśrīpādukāmpūjayāmi' 
ityādi paścime 'oṃḹṃkaumārīśrīpādukāmpūjayāmi' ityādi || vāyavye 
'oṃ aiṃ aparājitāśrīpādukāmpūjayāmi' ityādi || uttare 'oṃ(-)
auṃvārāhīśrīpādukāmpūjayāmi' ityādi || īśāne 
oṃaḥnārasiṃhīśrīpādukāmpūjayāmi ityādi || āsāndhyānantu 
pūjanataḥ pūrvamevakarttavyam || tadyathā 
'daṇḍaṅkamaṇḍalumpaścādakṣasūtrammahābhayam || 
bibhratīkanakacchāyāmbrāhmī kṛṣṇājinojjvalā || (1) ||

śūlamparaśvadhaṅkṣudradundubhīnṛkaroṭikām |
vahantī himasaṅkāśā dhyeyā māheśvarī śubhā || (2) ||

aṅkuśandaṇḍakhaṭvāṅgau pāśañca dadhatī karaiḥ |
bandhūkapuṣpasaṅkāśā kumārī kāmadāyinī || (3) ||

cakraṅghaṇṭāṅkapālañca śaṅkhañcadadhatī karaiḥ |
tamālaśyāmalādhyeyāvaiṣṇavīvibhramojjvalā || (4) ||

muśalaṅkaravālañca kheṭakandadhatīhalam | 
karaiścaturbhirvārāhīdhyeyākālaghanacchaviḥ || (5) ||

aṅkuśantomara(/) vvidyutkuliśambibhratī karaiḥ |
indranīlanimendrāṇī dhyeyā sarvasamṛddhidā || (6) ||

śūlaṅkṛpāṇaṃ nṛśiraḥ kapālandadhatīkaraiḥ |
muṇḍasraṅmaṇḍitā dhyeyā cāmuṇḍā raktavigrahā || (7) ||

akṣasrajambījapūraṅkapālandadhatī karaiḥ |
vahantī hemasaṅkāśā mohalakṣmīssamīritā || (8) ||' 

iti || tataḥ 'abhīṣṭasiddhimme dehi śaraṇāgatapālike | bhaktyā samarpaye 
tubhyamidamāvaraṇārccanam' itimūlañca 
paṭhanpuṣpacandanayutaśaṅkhodakena devyā vāmahaste samarpayet || 
tataḥ yantrāgre bhairavānpūjayet || tatra prathamandhyānaṅkuryāt || 
tadyathā 'bhīṣaṇāsyantrinayanamarddhacandravibhūṣitam || 
sphaṭikābhaṅkaṅkaṇādibhūṣāśatasamāyutam || 
aṣṭavarṣavayaskañca kuntalollasitambhaje || 
dhārayantandaṇḍaśūlebhairavyādisamāyutam ||' iti dhyātvā pūjayet || 
pūjākramastu 'aiṃ hrīṃ aṃ 
asitāṅgabhairavaśrīpādukāmpūjayāminamaḥ || aiṃhrīm(-)iṃ 
rurubhairavaśrīpādukāmpūjayāminamaḥ || aiṃhrīṃ(-)
uṃcaṇḍabhairavaśrīpādukāmpūjayāminamaḥ || 
aiṃhrīṃṛṃkrodhabhairavaśrīpādukāmpūjayāminamaḥ ||

<p. 46> aiṃ hrīṃ ḷṃ unmattabhairavaśrīpādukānpūjayāminamaḥ || 
aiṃhrīṃeṃkapālibhairavaśrīpādukāmpūjayāminamaḥ || aiṃ hrīṃ oṃ 
bhīṣaṇabhairavaśrīpādukāmpūjayāminamaḥ || aiṃhrīṃ(-)
aṃsaṃhārabhairavaśrīpādukāmpūjayāminamaḥ ||' itivāmāvartena 
pūjayet || tatraiva pūrvādito vāmāvarttenāṣṭabhairavīḥ 
pratyekantattannāmākṣarastāstāḥ pūjayet || tatrāsāndhyānantu 'bhāvaye 
ca mahādevīñcandrakoṭiyutaprabhām || 
himakundendudhavalāmpañcavaktrāntrilocanām || 
aṣṭādaśabhujairyuktāṃ sarvānandakarodyatām || prahasantī(/) 
vviśālākṣīndevadevasya sammukhīm' iti dhyātvā pūjayet | yathā 
'śrībhairavīśrīpādukāmpūjayāminamaḥ | 
mahābhairavīśrīpādukāmpūjayāminamaḥ | 
siṃhabhairavīśrīpādukāmpūjayāminamaḥ | 
dhūmrabhairavīśrīpādukāmpūjayāminamaḥ | 
bhīmabhairavīśrīpādukāmpūjayāminamaḥ | 
unmattabhairavīśrīpādukāṃpūjayāminamaḥ | 
vaśīkaraṇabhairavīśrīpādukāṃpūjayāminamaḥ | 
mohanabhairavīśrīpādukāmpūjayāminamaḥ |' tataḥ 'oṃ amīṣṭasiddhimme 
dehi śaraṇāgatapālike | bhaktyā samarpaye tubhyamidamāvaraṇārccanam' 
itimantreṇa devyā vāmahaste āvaraṇārcanaṃ samarppayet | tato 
yantrabāhye indrādīnpūjayet || teṣāndhyāna(/) yyathā 'indraṃ 
nīlavarṇamairāvatavāhana(/) vvajrahastammukuṭadhāriṇam 
sahasrākṣandhyāyet || vahniṃ raktavarṇaṃ 
śaktihastantrinetrammeṣavāhanandhyāyet || 
yamammahiṣavāhanandaṇḍapāśadharaṃ śyāmandhyāyet || nirṛtiṃ 
śyāmavarṇaṅkhaḍgahastammṛtapuruṣavāhanandhyāyet || 
varuṇampāśahastammakaravāhanaṃ śuddhavarṇandhyāyet || 
vāyumaṅkuśahastammṛgavāhanannīlavarṇandhyāyet || 
kuberaṅgadāhastammarttyavāhanaṃ śyāmavarṇandhyāyet || īśānaṃ 
śūlahasta(/) vvṛṣabhavāhanantrinetraṅgauravarṇandhyāyet || 
haṃsamārūḍhaṃ svarṇañca 
caturvaktrandaṇḍatrayākṣasūtraṅkamaṇḍalundadhatañjaṭājūṭadharambr
ahmāṇandhyāyet || 
śyāmaṅgaruḍavāhanaṃśaṅkhacakragadāpadmadhāriṇañcaturhastannā
nālaṅkārasaṃyuktaṃvviṣṇundhyāyet ||'

<p. 47> itidhyātvā 'indrādaya ihāgacchata iha tiṣṭhata' ityāvāhya || 
pūrvādito vāmāvarttena pūjayedyathā 
'laṃindraśrīpādukāmpūjayāminamaḥ | 
raṃvahniśrīpādukāmpūjayāminamaḥ | 
yaṃyamaśrīpādukāmpūjayāminamaḥ | 
kṣaṃnirṛtiśrīpādukāmpūjayāminamaḥ |  
vaṃvaruṇaśrīpādukāmpūjayāminamaḥ | 
yaṃvāyuśrīpādukāmpūjayāminamaḥ | 
iṃkuberaśrīpādukāmpūjayāminamaḥ | 
hoṃīśānaśrīpādukāmpūjayāminamaḥ | 
hrīṃbrahmaśrīpādukāmpūjayāminamaḥ | tataḥ 
oṃviṣṇuśrīpādukāmpūjayāminamaḥ' |  

'abhīṣṭasiddhimme dehi śaraṇāgatapālike || bhaktyā samarpaye 
tubhyamidamāvaraṇārccanam |' itimantreṇa devyāḥ vāmahaste 
āvaraṇārccanaṃ samarpayet | tato vāmāvarttena tattatsthale astrāṇi 
pūjayedyathā | 

vaṃvajraśrīpādukāmpūjayāminamaḥ || 
śaṃśaktiśrīpādukāmpūjayāminamaḥ | 
daṃdaṇḍaśrīpādukāmpūjayāminamaḥ || 
khaṃkhaḍgaśrīpādukāmpūjayāminamaḥ || 
paṃpāśaśrīpādukāmpūjayāminamaḥ || 
aṃaṅkuśaśrīpādukāmpūjayāminamaḥ || 
gagadāśrīpādukāmpūjayāminamaḥ || 
śaṃśūlaśrīpādukāmpūjayāminamaḥ || 
paṃpadmaśrīpādukāmpūjayāminamaḥ || 
caṃcakraśrīpādukāmpūjayāminamaḥ || 

tataḥ 'abhīṣṭasiddhimme dehi śaraṇāgatapālike || bhaktyā samarppaye 
tubhyamidamāvaraṇārccanam ||' itimantreṇadevyāvāmakare 
āvaraṇārccanaṃsamarppayet | tataḥ devyā vāmordhvahaste 

khaṃkhaḍgaśrīpādukāmpūjayāminamaḥ | 
tadadhaḥ muṃmuṇḍaśrīpādukāmpūjayāminamaḥ | 
dakṣorddhve aṃ abhayaśrīpādukāmpūjayāminamaḥ | 
tadadhaḥvaṃvaraśrīpādukāmpūjayāminamaḥ | 
oṃ abhīṣṭasiddhimmedehiśaraṇāgatapālike || 
bhaktyāsamarppaye tubhyamidamāvaraṇārccanam |' itimantreṇa 
āvaraṇārccanaṃ devyāvāmakaresamarppayet || puṣpāñjali trayandevyāḥ 
pādayorddadyāt || tataṣṣaḍaṅganyāsampūrvoktaṅkuryāt || tadyathā 
krāṃhṛdayāyanamaḥ | krīṃśirasesvāhā | krūṃśikhāyai vaṣaṭ |

<p. 48> kraiṃkavacāyahum | krauṃnetratrayāyavauṣaṭ | kraḥastrāyaphaṭ | 
evannyāsa(/)vvidhāya(,) gandhapuṣpākṣatairdevīṃsampūjya(,) mūlampaṭhan 
'śrīmaddakṣiṇakālīndevīntarpayāminamaḥ' iti mantreṇa 
madhukarpūramiśritairjalairdvādaśadhā tarpayet | tato 
ghaṇṭā(/)vvādayaṃstatojapaṅkuryāt | tatra pūrvoktakrameṇa 
prāṇāyāmaṃ ṣaḍaṅganyāsañca vidadhyāt || tadyathā krīṃbījena (16) 
ṣoḍaśadhāpūraka (64) catuṣṣaṣṭikumbhaka (32) 
dvāśiṃdrecakaistrivāramprāṇānāyamya(,) tatonyāsaḥ 
'krāṃhṛdayāyanamaḥ krīśirasesvāhā krū(/)śikhāyai vaṣaṭ 
kraiṃkavacāyahum krauṃnetratrayāyavauṣaṭ kraḥastrāyaphaṭ' tataḥ oṃ 
māle mālemahāmālesarvatattvasvarūpiṇī || 
caturvargastvayinyastastasmānme siddhidābhava || 'oṃ hrīṃmālāyainamaḥ' 
ityanenamālāndakṣiṇakarenidhāya hṛtpradeśesamānīya(,) madhyabhāgena 
guṭikāṃ pratyekaṃ saṃspṛśanmerumalaṅghayan 
svaśarīrekāmakālā(/)vvibhāvya(,) śirasigurundhyātvā(,) 
hṛdidevīmbhāvayañjihvāyāṃmaṃtrandīparūpiṇa(/)vvibhāvyatatprabhāp
aṭalejihvāmapidīparūpā(/)vvibhāvya(,) manasā(,) upāṃśunā vā 
karamālayā varṇamālayā(,) vā 
saṃskṛtamahāśaṅkharudrākṣasphaṭikādyanyatamamālayā(,) vā 
aṣṭottarasahasramaṣṭottaraśata(/)vvādrutamavilambitamprajapya(,) mālāṃ 
śirasi 'oṃ tvammāle sarvabhūtānāṃ sarvalokapriyāmatā || 
śivaṅkuruṣvamebhadreyaśovīryañcasarvadā ||' itipaṭhannidhāya 
'hrīṃsiddhyainamaḥ' itisampūjya punaḥprāṇāyāmannyāsādikañca 
vidhāya(,) yathā krīṃbījena (16) pūraka (64) kumbhaka (32) 
recakaistrivāramprāṇānāyamya || tato nyāsaḥ || krāṃhṛdayāya namaḥ(,) 
krīṃśirasesvāhā | krū(/)śikhāyaivaṣaṭ | kraiṃkavacāyahūṃ | 
krauṃnetratrayāyavauṣaṭ(,) kraḥ astrāyaphaṭ(,) iti nyāsādikṛtvā(,) 
tatodevatāmpuṣpākṣatādibhiḥ sampūjya(,) 
puṣpacandanākṣatayutaśaṅkhodakena 
'oṃguhyātiguhyagoptrītvaṅgṛhāṇāsmatkṛtañjapam | siddhirbhavatu me devi 
tvatprasādānmaheśvari ||' itimantreṇa devyā vāmakare 
tejomayañjalandhyātvā japaṃ samarpayet ||

<p. 49> tato mālāṃ śirasa uttārya 'oṃ tvammāle sarvadevānāṃ 
sarvasiddhipradā matā || tena satyena me siddhindehi mātarnnamostu te ||' 
ityamummantrampaṭhansampūjya(,) yatnato gopayet || tato devyai 
puṣpāñjalyaṣṭakandattvā stotrakavacādikampaṭhet || 
karādbhraṃśettacchāntyarthamaṣṭottaraśatammūlañjapet || tato vāme 
caturasrammaṇḍala(/) vvidhāya(,) kiñcitpātre saṃsthāpya(,) 
tasminmāṃsamāṣānnaśākājyapāyasāpūpakādyanyatamabali(/)vvidhāy
a 'phaṭ' itisamprokṣya 'namaḥ' ityabhyarcya 'yam' itivāyubījena 
dvādaśavārajaptena saṃśodhya(,) vāmahastatale dakṣahastapṛṣṭhanniveśya 
'ram' itivahnibījena ṣoḍaśavārajaptena saṃdīpya 'vam' ityamṛtabījena 
viṃśativārajaptena dhenumudrayā'mṛtīkṛtya 'hūm' ityavaguṇṭhya 
yonidhenumudredarśayitvā(,) tattvamudrāñca pradarśya 'oṃ krīṃ śrīṃ 
dakṣiṇakālikāyai svāhā eṣa balinnamaḥ' ityutsṛjya nairṛtyāndiśi 
dhārayet | eṣa nityabalidānamantraḥ || rātrau kāmyabalirddeyaḥ || tatra 
mantrastu 'oṃ padmepadme mahāpadme padmāvati mahāyakṣādhipataye 
mayopanītamimaṃ baliṃ gṛhṇagṛhṇagṛhṇāpayagṛhṇāpaya mama 
sarvaśāntiṅkurukuru paravidyāñcākṛṣyākṛṣya chindhi hrīṃ hūṃ 
svāhā' itimantreṇa catuppathādisthāne pūrvoktaśodhana(/) vvidhāya 
tattvamudrāmpradarśya māṃsādyanyatamabalindadyāt || 
adhikabhaktyuttaraśaktikālādilābhe caturthyantaiḥ 
pratyekaissahasranāmastotrāntargatanāmabhiḥ puṣpādinā kālīmpūjayet || 
tadyathā || 

