hṛtpadmacakrandhyātvā tadupari vedīṅgandhapuṣpākṣataiḥ 
karakacchapamudrāmbaddhvā dhyāyet || sakuṅkumamityādi | 
bālārkamaṇḍalābhāsāñcaturbāhuntrilocanām | pāśāṅkuśau 
śarāṃścāpandhārayantīṃ śivāṃ śraye || śirasi puṣpandattvā(0) 
gurubhyonamaḥ paramagurubhyonamaḥ parātparagurubhyonamaḥ 
