<p. 166> ādhāramaṇḍalāyanama ityādhāraṃ sampūjya 
sauḥastrāyaphaṭnama ititripadīṃ sampūjya maṇḍale sthāpayitvā pūjayet | 
ma(/)vahnimaṇḍalāya daśakalātmane namaḥ | tataḥ sauḥ(-)astrāyaphaṭnama 
itiśaṅkhamprakṣālya sthāpayitvā aṃsūryamaṇḍalāya 
dvādaśakalātmanenamaḥ śrīmahātripurasundaryargghyapātrāyanama 
itiśaṅkhe sampūjya uṃsomamaṇḍalāya ṣoḍaśakalātmane 
śrīmahātripurasundaryārgghyamṛtāyanama itijalenāpūrya tatra jale 
dūrvākṣatādi dattvā oṃgaṅge ca yamune caivetyādinā 
sūryamaṇḍalādaṅkuśamudrayā tīrtthamāvāhya dhenumudrayāmṛtīkṛtya 
yonimudrāmpradarśśya tadupari mūlamaṣṭadhā japitvā dakṣāṅguṣṭhena 
jalaṃ spṛṣṭvā mūlaṃ smṛtvā argghyajalasya āgneyakoṇamārabhya 
vinyaset | hṛdayāyanamaḥ śirasesvāhā śikhāyaivauṣaṭ astrāyaphaṭ || 
iticaturddikṣu vinyasya 'hrīṃ' itimantreṇa sampūjya pañcaratnāni vinyaset | 
glūṃ ślūṃ plūṃ mlūṃ jlūmiti pañcaratnāni 
svargamartyapātālagamanaratnāni vinyaset | matsyamudrayācchādya 
saṃrakṣaṇamudrayā saṃrakṣya avaguṇṭhanamudrayā avaguṇṭhya 
amṛtīkaraṇamudrayā amṛtīkṛtya prabodhanamudrayā prabodhya mūlaṃ 
smṛtvā | akulasthāmṛtākare siddhijñānakare pare | amṛtatvanidhe tvasmin 
vastuni klinnarūpiṇi || itijalamabhimantrya 
tajjalenātmānampūjopakaraṇañcābhyukṣya pīṭhapūjāmārabhet | 
aiṃhrīṃnamaḥ itikuśajalena bhūmiṃ śodhayitvā tripadīmāropya pūjayet | 
aiṃ(-)ādhāraśaktikamalāsanāyanamaḥ kūrmāyanamaḥ anantāyanamaḥ 
pṛthivyai rasāmbudhayenamaḥ ratnadvīpāyanamaḥ nandanodyānāyanamaḥ 
ratnamaṇḍapāyanamaḥ ratnavedikāyainamaḥ ratnasiṃhāsanāyanamaḥ 
