<p. 194> atha yantroddhāraḥ

padmamaṣṭadalambāhye vṛttaṃ ṣoḍaśabhirddalaiḥ |
vilikhetkarṇikāmadhye ṣaṭkoṇamatisundaram ||
caturasrañcaturddvāramevammaṇḍalamālikhet ||

athamantroddhāraḥ

nakulīśognimārūḍho vāmanetrārddhacandravat |
bījantasyāḥ samākhyātaṃ sevitaṃ siddhikāṅkṣibhiḥ ||

atha mantraḥ | hrī(/)

atha pūjāprayogaḥ

prātaḥ kṛtyādipīṭhanyāsāntaṅkarma vidhāya kesareṣu madhye ca 
pīṭhaśaktīnnyaset || oṃjayāyainamaḥ eva(/) vvijayāyai namaḥ ajitāyai(0) 
aparājitāyai(0) nityāyai (0) vilāsinyai dogghryai(0) aghorāyai(0) maṅgalāyai(0) 
karṇikāyāṃ hrī(/)sarvaśaktikamalāsanāyanamaḥ | tataḥ ṛṣyādinyāsaḥ | 
asya bhuvaneśvarīmantrasya śakti ṛṣirgāyatrī chando bhuvaneśvarī devatā 
hakāro bījam īkāraḥ śaktiḥ rephaḥ kīlakaṃ caturvargasiddhyartthe 
viniyogaḥ | śirasi śaktayeṛṣayenamaḥ | mukhe gāyatrīchandasenamaḥ | hṛdi 
bhuvaneśvaryai devatāyainamaḥ | guhye hakārāya bījāyanamaḥ | pādayoḥ 
īkārāyaśaktayenamaḥ | sarvāṅge rakārāyakīlakāyanamaḥ | tato nyāsaḥ 
| śirasi oṃhṛllekhāyai namaḥ 

<p. 195> vadane e(/)gaganāyainamaḥ hṛdaye ū(/)raktāyainamaḥ guhye 
i(/)karālikāyainamaḥ pādayoḥ a(/)mahocchuṣmāyainamaḥ 
ūrddhvaprāgdakṣiṇodīcyapaścimeṣu mukheṣu tā vinyaset | 
hṛllekhāmmūrddhnivadane gaganāṃ hṛdayāmbuje || 
raktāṅkarālikāṅguhye mahocchuṣmāmpadadvaye | 
satyādipañcahrasvāḍhyā nyastavyā bhūtasaprabhāḥ || tataḥ 
karāṅganyāsau || hrāṃ(-)aṅguṣṭhābhyāṃnamaḥ hrīṃtarjjanībhyāṃ 
svā(0) hrūṃmadhyamābhyāṃ vaṣaṭ hraiṃ anāmikābhyāṃ hūm 
hrauṃkaniṣṭhikābhyā(/)vvauṣaṭ hraḥkaratalakarapṛṣṭhābhyāmphaṭ || eva(/) 
hṛdayādiṣu || ṣaḍdīrgghabhājā bījena kuryādaṅgakriyāmmanoḥ || 
svacchandasaṅgrahe || svara(/) vvihāya bījantu dīrgghaṣaṭkena yojayet | 
ṣaḍaṅgāni vidheyāni sarvatrāya(/) vvidhiḥ smṛtaḥ || aṅgulīniyamastu 
pūrva evoktaḥ | karāṅganyāse evaṅkramaḥ | tataḥ bhāle 
oṃgāyatrīsahitabrahmaṇenamaḥ | dakṣiṇakapole 
oṃsāvitrīsahitaviṣṇavenamaḥ | vāmakapole 
oṃvāgīśvarīsahitamaheśvarāyanamaḥ | vāmakarṇe 
oṃśrīsahitadhanapatayenamaḥ | mukhe oṃratisahitasmarāyanamaḥ | 
dakṣiṇakarṇopari oṃpuṣṭisahitagaṇapatayenamaḥ | iti nyaset | 
evaṅkaṇṭhamūle 
dakṣastanavāmāṃsahṛdayadakṣiṇāṃsadakṣiṇapārśvavāmapārśvanā
bhideśeṣu brāhmyādi nyaset || varṇābhinnanyāso viśvasāre || 
oṃkārādinamontañca vinyasettu yathāsthiti | vidhinā vinyasetsarvaṃ 
śaṅkarasya matena ca | evaṃ sarvatra | tato lalāṭe oṃbrāhmyainamaḥ | 
vāmāṃse oṃmāheśvaryainamaḥ | vāmapārśve oṃkaumāryainamaḥ | 
jaṭhare oṃvaiṣṇavyainamaḥ | dakṣiṇapārśve oṃvārāhyainamaḥ | 
dakṣiṇāṃse oṃ(-)indrāṇyainamaḥ | kakudi oṃcāmuṇḍāyainamaḥ | hṛdi 
oṃmahālakṣmyainamaḥ | iti vinyasya mūlena vyāpakatrayaṅkuryāt || tato 
dhyānam ||

