<p. 196> pūjāyantram || padmamaṣṭadalambāhye vṛttaṃ ṣoḍaśabhirddalaiḥ 
|| vilikhetkarṇikāmadhye ṣaṭkoṇamatisundaram || 
caturasrañcaturddvāramevammaṇḍalamālikhet || tato 
dīkṣāpaddhatyuktapīṭhapūjāṅkṛtvā pīṭhaśaktīḥ pūjayet | tadyathā | 
pūrvādikesareṣu jayāyai(0) vijayāyai(0) ajitāyai(0) aparājitāyai(0) nityāyai(0) 
vilāsinyai(0) dogghryai(0) aghorāyai(0) madhye maṅgalāyai(0) 
praṇavādinamontena pūjayet | tadupari hrīṃsarvaśaktikamalāsanāyanamaḥ 
|| nibandhe || tatassampūjayetpīṭhannānāśaktisamanvitam || jayākhyāṃ 
vijayāṃ paścādajitāṃ cāparājitām || nityā(/) 
vvilāsinīndogdhrīmaghorāmmaṅgalāmapi || bījādyamāsanandattvā 
mūrttintatraiva kalpayet || tataḥ pūrvavaddhyātvā'vāhanādi 
pañcapuṣpāñjalidānaparyanta(/) vvidhāya | kesareṣu aiśānyādikoṇe 
madhye dikṣu ca | tato hrīṃhṛdayāyanamaḥ ityādinā ṣaḍaṅgena 
pūjayitvā pañcapuṣpāñjalīndadyāt || tata āvaraṇapūjā | 
karṇikāmadhye oṃhṛllekhāyainamaḥ || pūrve aiṃgaganāyai(0) | dakṣiṇe 
ūṃraktāyai(0) | uttare īṃkarālikāyai(0) | paścime hū(/)mahocchuṣmāyai(0) | 
ṣaṭkoṇe pūrve oṃgāyatryainamaḥ oṃbrahmaṇenamaḥ | nairṛtye 
oṃsāvitryainamaḥ oṃviṣṇavenamaḥ || vāyavye oṃsarasvatyainamaḥ 
oṃrudrāyanamaḥ | vahnikoṇe oṃśriyainamaḥ oṃdhanapatayenamaḥ | paścime 
oṃratyainamaḥ oṃsmarāyanamaḥ | aiśānyām oṃpuṣṭyainamaḥ 
oṃgaṇapatayenamaḥ | ṣaṭkoṇasyobhayapārśvayoḥ oṃśaṅkhanidhayenamaḥ 
oṃpadmanidhayenamaḥ || kesareṣu agninairṛtivāyvīśānāgreṣu caturddikṣu 
ca hrā(/)hṛdayāyanama ityādinā ṣaḍaṅgena pūjayet || tathā ca nibandhe | 
kesareṣvagnikoṇādi hṛdayādīni pūjayet || 
netramagnidiśādyantandhyātavyāścāṅgadevatāḥ || evaṃ sarvatra || 
bhairavyādau tu viśeṣo vaktavyaḥ | aṣṭadaleṣu pūrvādikrameṇa | oṃ(-)
anaṅgakusumāyainamaḥ evamanaṅgakusumāturāyainamaḥ 

