atha stotram 

athānandamayīṃ sākṣācchabdabrahmasvarūpiṇīm |
īḍe sakalasampattyai jagatkāraṇamambikām || (1) ||

vidyāmaśeṣajananīmaravindayonerviṣṇoḥ śivasya ca vapuḥ 
pratipādayitrīm |
sṛṣṭisthitikṣayakarījjagatāntrayāṇāṃ stutvā gira(/) 
vvimalayāmyahamambike tvām || (2) ||

pṛthvyā jalena śikhinā marutāmbareṇa hotrendunā dinakareṇa ca 
mūrttibhājaḥ |
devasya manmathariporapi śaktimattāhetustvameva khalu parvatarājaputri || (3) ||

trisrotasaḥ sakaladevasamarccitāyā vaiśiṣṭyakāraṇamavaimi tadeva mātaḥ 
|
tvatpādapaṅkajaparāgapavitritāsu sambhorjaṭāsu satatamparivarttana(/) yyat || 
(4) ||

ānandayetkumudinīmadhipaḥ kalānānnānyāminaḥ kamalinīmathanetarā(/) 
vvā |
ekasya modanavidhau paramekamīṣṭe tvantu prapañcamabhinandayasi 
