evaṅkaranyāsaḥ ||

dhāṃ(-)aṅguṣṭhābhyānnamaḥ(,) dhīṃtarjjanībhyāṃsvāhā(,)
dhū(/)madhyamābhyāṃvvaṣaṭ(,) 

<p. 281> dhaiṃ(-)anāmikābhyāṃhūm(,) dhauṃkaniṣṭhikābhyā(/)vvauṣaṭ(,)
