prajāvantaḥ sacemahi || (93) ||

eṣa te rudra bhāgaḥ saha svasrā'mbikayā tañjuṣasva svāhaiṣa te rudra 
bhāga '(-)ākhuste paśuḥ || (94) ||

ava rudramadīmahyava devantryambakam |
yathā no vasyasaskaradyathā naḥ śreyasaskaradyathā no vyavasāyayāt || (95) ||

bheṣajamasi bheṣajaṅgave'śvāya puruṣāya bheṣajam |
sukhammeṣāya meṣyai || (96) ||

tryambaka(/) yyajāmahe sugandhimpuṣṭiṃvarddhanam |
urvārukamiva bandhanānnmṛtyormukṣīyamā'mṛtāt || 
tryambaka(/) yyajāmahe sugandhimpativedanam |
urvārukamiva bandhanādito mukṣīya māmutaḥ || (97) ||

etatte rudrā'vasantena paro mūjavato'tīhi || (98) ||

