suvīryāya || (100) ||

iti śuddhodakasnānam ||

atha vastram ||

vastrāṇi paṭṭakūlāni vicitrāṇi navāni ca |
mayānītāni deveśa prasanno bhava śaṅkara ||

iti vastram ||

athopavītam

sauvarṇaṃ rājatantāmraṅkārpāsasya tathaiva ca |
upavītammayā dattaṃ prītyartthampratigṛhyatām ||

ityupavītam

atha gandham ||

sarveśvara jagadvandya divyāsanasamāsthita |
gandhaṅgṛhāṇa deveśa candanampratigṛhyatām || iti gandham ||

athākṣatān |

gandhopari śuklākṣatān |

<p. 456> akṣatāśca suraśreṣṭhāḥ śubhrā dhūtāśca nirmmalāḥ |
mayā niveditā bhaktyā gṛhāṇa parameśvara || ityakṣatān |

atha puṣpāṇi

mālyādīni sugandhīni mālatyādīni vai prabho |
mayāhṛtāni pūjārtthampuṣpāṇi pratigṛhyatām || iti puṣpāṇi |

atha bilvapatrāṇi |

bilva patraṃ suvarṇena triśūlākārameva ca |
mayārpitammahādeva bilvapatraṅgṛhāṇa me ||

iti bilvapatrāṇi ||

atha dhūpam |

vanaspatirasotpanno gandhāḍhyo gandha uttamaḥ |
āghreyaḥ sarvadevānāndhūpo'yampratigṛhyatā || iti dhūpam |

atha dīpam 

ājyāktavarttisa(/)yyukta(/) vvahninā dīpitantu yat |
dīpaṅgṛhāṇa devaśa trailokyatimirāpaha || iti dīpam ||

atha naivedyam 

apūpāni ca pakvāni maṇḍakā vaṭakāni ca |
pāyasaṃ sūpamannañca naivedyampratigṛhyatām || iti naivedyam ||

athācamanīyam ||

pānīyaṃ śītalaṃ śuddhaṅgāṅgeyammahaduttamam |
gṛhāṇa pārvatīnātha tava prītyā prakalpitam || ityācamanīyam ||

atha karodvarttanam 

karpūrādīni dravyāṇi sugandhīni maheśvara |
gṛhāṇa jagatānnātha karodvarttanahetave || iti karodvarttanam |

atha phalāni |

kūṣmāṇḍammātuliṅgañca nārikelaphalāni ca |
gṛhāṇa pārvatīkānta somaśekhara śaṅkara | iti phalāni ||

atha spūgīphalatāmbūlādīni ||

pūgīphalammahaddivyannāgavallīdalairyutam |
gṛhāṇa devadeveśa drākṣādīni sureśvara || iti pūgīphalādīni ||

atha dravyam ||

hiraṇyagarbbhagarbbhasthaṃ hemabījasamanvitam |
pañcaratnammayā dattaṅgṛhyatāṃ vṛṣabhadhvaja || iti dravyam ||

atha nīrājanam ||

agnirjjyotī ravirjjyotirjjyotirnnārāyaṇo vibhuḥ |
nīrājayāmi deveśampañcadīpaiḥ sureśvara || iti nīrājanam ||

atha puṣpāñjaliḥ ||

hara viśvākhilādhāra nirādhāra nirāśraya |
puṣpāñjaliṅgṛhāṇeśa someśvara namo'stu te || iti puṣpāñjalim ||

<p. 457> atha praṇāmamantraḥ |

hetave jagatāmeva saṃsārārṇavasetave |
prabhave sarvavidyānāṃ śambhave gurave namaḥ ||

iti praṇāmamantraḥ |

sarvamantrānte sāṅgāya sāyudhāya savāhanāya saparivārāya 
sāvaraṇāya nama iti yojyam ||


