athārgghyapradānam

	adya pūrvoccarita evaṅguṇaviśeṣeṇa viśiṣṭāyāmpuṇyatithau 
mamātmanaḥ purāṇoktaphalaprāptyarthaṃ 
pūjāsāṅgatāsiddhyartthamargghyapradānaṅkariṣye ||

śivarātryargghyāṇi ||

namaḥ śivāya śarvāya sarvapāpaharāya ca |
śivarātrau mahāpuṇyaṅgṛhāṇārgghyannamo'stu te ||
śivāya(0) idam || (1) || 

vyomakeśa namastubhya(/) vyomātmanvyomarūpiṇe ||
nakṣatrarūpiṇe tubhyantārakārgghyannamo'stu te |
tārakāyanamaḥ idam(0) || (2) ||

ākāśādikcharīrāya grahanakṣatramāline ||
surasiddhanivāsāya dattamargghyaṃ sadāśiva || sadā(0) idam(0) || (3) ||

atha somavārārgghyāṇi || 

somavāravrataṅkarttuḥ kalyāṇammama sarvadā ||
prasīda pārvatīnātha sāyujyandehi me prabho ||
bhavānīśaṅkarāya namaḥ || idam(0) || (1) ||

naktena somavāreṇa somanātha jagatpate ||
anekakoṭisaubhāgyamanantaṃ kuru śaṅkara || śaṅkarāya(0) idam(0) || (2) ||

ākāśādikśarīrāya grahanakṣatramāline ||
sarvasiddhinivāsāya dattamargghyannamo'stu te || sadāśivā(0) idam || (3) ||

anenārgghyapradānena bhagavāñchrībhavānīśaṅkaramahārudraḥ 
prīyatām ||

ityargghyapradānam ||


atha mahimnastotram

śrīgaṇeśāyanamaḥ ||

mahimnaḥ pārante paramaviduṣo yadyasadṛśī 
stutirbrahmādīnāmapi tadavasannāstvayi giraḥ |
athāvācyaḥ sarvaḥ svamatipariṇāmāvadhi gṛṇanmamāpyeṣa stotre hara 
nirapavādaḥ parikaraḥ || (1) ||

atītaḥ panthānantava ca mahimā vāṅmanasayoratadvyāvṛttyā 
yañcakitamabhidhatte śrutirapi |
sa kasya stotavyaḥ katividhaguṇaḥ kasya viṣayaḥ
pade tvarvācīne patati na manaḥ kasya na vacaḥ || (2) ||

<p. 476> madhusphītā vācaḥ paramamamṛtannirmitavatastava
brahmanki(/) vvāgapi suragurorvismayapadam |
mama tvetā(/) vvāṇīṅguṇakathanapuṇyena bhavataḥ 
punāmītyartthe'sminpuramathana buddhirvyavasitā || (3) ||

tavaiśvarya(/) yyattajjagadudayarakṣāpralayakṛt(-)
trayīvastuvyastantisṛṣu guṇabhinnāsu tanuṣu |
abhavyānāmasminvarada ramaṇīyāmaramaṇīṃ
vihantuṃ vyākrośīṃ vidadhata ihaike jaḍadhiyaḥ || (4) ||

kimīhaḥ kiṅkāyaḥ sa khalu kimupāyastribhuvanaṅkimādhāro dhātā sṛjati 
kimupādāna iti ca |
atarkyaiśvarye tvayyanavasaraduḥstho hatadhiyaḥ 
kutarko'yaṅkāṃścinmukharayati mohāya jagataḥ || (5) ||

ajanmāno lokāḥ kimavayavavanto'pi 
jagatāmadhiṣṭhātāraṅkimbhavavidhiranādṛtya bhavati |
anīśo vā kuryādbhuvanajanane kaḥ parikaro 
yato mandāstvāmpratyamaravara saṃśerata ime || (6) ||

trayī sāṅkhya(/) yyogaḥ paśupatimata(/) vvaiṣṇavamiti 
prabhinne prasthāne paramidamadaḥ pathyamiti ca |
rucīnā(/) vvaicitryādṛjukuṭilanānāpathajuṣānnṛṇāmeko gamyastvamasi 
payasāmarṇava iva || (7) ||

mahokṣaḥ khaṭvāṅgamparaśurajinambhasma phaṇinaḥ 
kapālañcetīyattava varada tantropakaraṇam |
surāstāntāmṛddhindadhati tu  bhavadbhrūpraṇihitānnahi 
svātmārāmavviṣayamṛgatṛṣṇā bhramayati || (8) ||

dhruvaṅkaścitsarvaṃ sakalamaparastvadhruvamidamparo dhrauvyādhrauvye 
jagati gadati vyastaviṣaye |
samaste'pyetasminpuramathana tairvismita iva
stuvajjihvemi tvānna khalu nanu dhṛṣṭā mukharatā || (9) ||

tavaiśvarya(/) yyatnādyadupari viriñco hariradhaḥ 
paricchettuṃ yātāvanalamanalaskandhavapuṣaḥ |
tato bhaktiśraddhābharagurugṛṇadbhyāṅgiriśa
yatsvayantasthe tābhyāntava kimanuvṛttirnna phalati || (10) ||

ayatnādāpādya tribhuvanamavairavyatikarandaśāsyo yadbāhūnabhṛta 
raṇakaṇḍūparavaśān |
<p. 477> śiraḥ padmaśreṇīracitacaraṇāmbhoruhabaleḥ
sthirāyāstvadbhaktestripurahara visphūrjjitamidam || (11) ||

amuṣya tvatsevāsamadhigatasārambhuja(-)
anambalātkailāse'pi tvadadhivasatau vikramayataḥ |
alabhyā pātāle'pyalasacalitāṅguṣṭhaśirasi
pratiṣṭhā tvayyāsīddhruvamupacito muhyati khalaḥ || (12) ||

yadṛddhiṃ sutrāmṇo varada paramoccairapi satī(-)
madhaścakre bāṇaḥ parijanavidheyastribhuvanaḥ |
na taccitrantasminvarivasitari tvaccaraṇayornna
kasyāpyunnatyai bhavati śirasastvayyavanatiḥ || (13) ||

akāṇḍabrahmāṇḍakṣayacakitadevāsurakṛpā(-)
vidheyasyā'sīdyastrinayanaviṣaṃ saṃhṛtavataḥ |
sa kalmāṣaḥ kaṇṭhe tava na kurute na śriyamaho
vikāro'pi ślāghyo bhuvanabhayabhaṅgavyasaninaḥ || (14) ||

asiddhārtthā naiva kvacidapi sadevāsuranare
nivarttante nityañjagati jayino yasya viśikhāḥ |
sa paśyannīśa tvāmitarasurasādhāraṇamabhūtsmaraḥ smarttavyātmā nahi 
vaśiṣu pathyaḥ paribhavaḥ || (15) ||

mahī pādāghātādvrajati sahasā saṃśayapadampada(/) 
vviṣṇorbbhrāmyadbhujaparigharugṇagrahagaṇam |
muhurdyaurddausthya(/) yyātyanibhṛtajaṭātāḍitataṭā
jagadrakṣāyai tvannaṭasi nanu vāmaiva vibhutā || (16) ||

viyadvyāpī tārāgaṇaguṇitaphenodgamaruciḥ 
pravāho vārā(/) yyaḥ pṛṣatalaghudṛṣṭaḥ śirasi te |
jagaddvīpākārañjaladhivalayantena kṛtamityanenaivonneyandhṛtamahima 
divyantava vapuḥ || (17) ||

rathaḥ kṣoṇī yantā śatadhṛtiragendro dhanuratho
rathāṅge candrārkau rathacaraṇapāṇiḥ śara iti |
didhakṣoste ko'yantripuratṛṇamāḍambaravidhirvidheyaiḥ krīḍantyo na khalu 
paratantrāḥ prabhudhiyaḥ || (18) ||

hariste sāhasraṅkamalabalimādhāya padayoryadekone 
tasminnijamudaharannetrakamalam |
gato bhaktyudrekaḥ pariṇatimasau cakravapuṣā
trayāṇāṃ rakṣāyai tripurahara jāgartti jagatām || (19) ||

<p. 478> kratau supte jāgrattvamasi phalayoge kratumatāṅkvakarma 
pradhvastamphalati puruṣārādhanamṛte |
atastvāṃ samprekṣye kratuṣu phaladānapratibhuvaṃ 
śrutau śraddhāmbaddhvā dṛḍhaparikaraḥ karmasu janaḥ || (20) ||

kriyādakṣo dakṣaḥ kratupatiradhīśastanubhṛtāmṛṣīṇāmārttvijyaṃ 
saraṇada sadasyāḥ suragaṇāḥ |
kratubhreśastvattaḥ kratuphalavidhānavyasanino
dhruvaṅkarttuḥ śraddhāvidhuramabhicārāya hi makhāḥ || (21) ||

prajānāthannātha prasabhamabhikaṃ svānduhitaraṅgataṃ rohidbhūtāṃ 
riramayiṣumṛṣyasya vapuṣā |
dhanuṣpāṇeryātandivamapi sapatrākṛtamamuntrasantante'dyāpi tyajati na 
mṛgavyādharabhasaḥ || (22) ||

svalāvaṇyāśaṃsā dhṛtadhanuṣamahnāya tṛṇavatpuraḥ pluṣṭandṛṣṭvā 
puramathana puṣpāyudhamapi |
yadistraiṇandevī yamaniratadehārddhvaghaṭanādavaiti tvāmadhā vata varada 
mugdhā yuvatayaḥ || (23) ||

śmaśāneṣvākrīḍā smarahara piśācāḥ sahacarāścitābhasmālepaḥ 
sragapi nṛkaroṭī parikaraḥ |
amaṅgalyaṃ śīlantava bhavatu nāmaivamakhilantathāpi smartṝṇā(/) vvarada 
paramammaṅgalamasi || (24) ||

manaḥ pratyakcittesavidhamavadhāyāttamarutaḥ 
prahṛṣyadromāṇaḥ pramadasalilotsaṅgitadṛśaḥ |
yadālokyāhlādaṃ hrada iva nimajyāmṛtamaye
dadhatyantastattvaṅkimapi yaminastatkila bhavān || (25) ||

tvamarkkastvaṃ somastvamasi pavanastvaṃ hutavahastvamāpastva(/) vvyoma 
tvamu dharaṇirātmā tvamiti ca |
paricchinnāmevantvayi pariṇatā bibhrati giranna 
vidmastattattva(/) vvayamiha tu yattvanna bhavasi || (26) ||

trayīntisro vṛttīstribhuvanamatho trīnapi 
surānakārādyairvarṇaistribhirabhidadhattīrṇavikṛti |
turīyante dhāma dhvanibhiravarundhānamaṇubhiḥ
samastaṃ vyastaṃ vā śaraṇada gṛṇātyomiti padam || (27) ||

bhavaḥ śarvo rudraḥ paśupatirathograḥ saha mahā(/)stathā bhīmeśānāviti 
yadabhidhānāṣṭakamidam |
<p. 479> amuṣminpratyekampravicarati deva śrutirapi 
priyāyāsmai dhāmne praṇihitanamasyo'smi bhavate || (28) ||

namo nediṣṭhāya priyadava daviṣṭhāya ca namo
namaḥ kṣodiṣṭhāya smarahara mahiṣṭhāya ca namaḥ |
namo varṣiṣṭhāya trinayana yaviṣṭhāya ca namo namaḥ
sarvasmai te tadidamiti sarvāya ca namaḥ || (29) ||

bahalarajase viśvotpattau bhavāya namo namaḥ 
prabalatamase tatsaṃhāre harāya namo namaḥ |
janasukhakṛte sattvodriktau mṛḍāya namo namaḥ 
pramahasi pade nistraiguṇye śivāya namo namaḥ || (30) ||

kṛśapariṇati cetaḥ kleśavaśyankva cedaṅ kva ca tava
guṇasīmollaṅghinī śaśvadṛddhiḥ ||
iti cakitamamandīkṛtya māmbhaktirādhādvarada
caraṇayoste vākyapuṣpopahāram || (31) ||

asitagirisamaṃ syātkajjalaṃ sindhupātre 
surataruvaraśākhā lekhanī patramurvī |
likhati yadi gṛhītvā śāradā sarvakālantadapi 
tava guṇānāmīśa pāranna yāti || (32) ||

asurasuramunīndrairarccitasyendumaulergrathitaguṇamahimno 
nirguṇasyeśvarasya |
sakalagaṇavariṣṭhaḥ puṣpadantābhidhāno
ruciramalaghuvṛttaiḥ stotrametaccakāra || (33) ||

aharaharanavadyandhūrjjaṭeḥ stotrametatpaṭhati 
paramabhaktyā śuddhacittaḥ pumānyaḥ |
sa bhavati śivaloke rudratulyastathātra 
pracurataradhanāyuḥ putravānkīrtimāṃśca || (34) ||

maheśānnāparo devo mahimno nāparā stutiḥ |
aghorānnāparo mantro nāsti tattvaṅguroḥ param || (35) ||

dīkṣā dānantapastīrtthaṃ jñāna(/) yyāgādikāḥ kriyāḥ |
mahimnaḥ stavapāṭhasya kalānārhanti ṣoḍaśīm || (36) ||

āsamāptimidaṃ stotraṃ sarvamīśvaravarṇanam |
anaupamyammanohāri puṇyaṅgandharvabhāṣitam || (37) ||

kusumadaśananāmā sarvagandharvarājaḥ 
śaśidharavaramaulerdevadevasya dāsaḥ 
sa khalu nijamahimno bhraṣṭa evāsya 
roṣātstavanamidamakārṣīddivyadivyammahimnaḥ || (38) ||

<p. 480> suravaramunipūjyaṃ svargamokṣaikahetumpaṭhati 
yadi manuṣyaḥ prāñjalirnnānyacetāḥ |
vrajati śivasamīpaṅkinnaraiḥ stūyamānaḥ
stavanamidamamoghampuṣpadantapraṇītam || (39) ||

śrīpuṣpadantamukhapaṅkajanirgatena 
stotreṇa kilbiṣahareṇa harapriyeṇa |
kaṇṭhasthitena paṭhitena samāhitena suprīṇito 
bhavati bhūtapatirmmaheśaḥ || (40) ||

iti śrīpuṣpadantaviracitaṃ śivamahimākhyastotraṃ sampūrṇam ||


atha rāvaṇakṛtaśivastotram

jaṭākaṭāhasambhramabhramannilimpanirjharī(-)
vilolavīcivallarīvirājamānamūrddhani |
dhagaddhagaddhagajjvalallalāṭapaṭṭapāvake
kiśoracandraśekhare ratiḥ pratikṣaṇammama || (1) ||

dharādharendranandinī(-)vilāsabandhuvandhuras(-)
phuradṛgantasantatipramodamānamānase |
kṛpākaṭākṣaghoraṇīniruddhadurddharāpadi
kvaciddigambare mano vinodamastu vastuni || (2) ||

jaṭābhujaṅgapiṅgalasphuratphaṇāmaṇiprabhā(-)
kadambakuṅkumadravapraliptadigvadhūmukhe |
madāndhasindhurasphurattvaguttarīyamedure
mano vinodamadbhutambibharttu bhūtabharttari || (3) ||

lalāṭacatvarajvaladdhanañjayasphuliṅgabhā(-)
nipītapañcasāyakannamannilimpanāyakam |
sudhāmayūkharekhayā virājamānaśekharam(-)
mahākapālisampade sarijjaṭālamastu naḥ || (4) ||

sahasralocanaprabhṛtyaśeṣalekhaśekhara(-)
prasūnadhūlidhoraṇīvidhūsarāṅghripīṭhabhūḥ |
bhujaṅgarājamālayā nibaddhajāṭajūṭakaḥ 
śriyai cirāya jāyatāñcakorabandhuśekharaḥ || (5) ||

karālabhālapaṭṭikādhagaddhagaddhagajjvalad(-)
dhanañjayāhutīkṛtapracaṇḍapañcasāyake |
dharādharendranandinīkucāgracitrapatraka(-)
prakalpanaikaśilpini trilocane ratirmmama || (6) ||

navīnameghamaṇḍalīniruddhadurddharasphurat(-)
kuhūniśīthinītamaḥprabandhabaddhakandharaḥ |
nilimpanirjjharīdharastanotu kṛttisundaraḥ 
kalānidhānabandhuraḥ śriyañjagaddhurandharaḥ || (7) ||

<p. 481> praphullanīlapaṅkajaprapañcakālimaprabhā(-)
valambikaṇṭhakandalīruciprabadhakandharam |
smaracchidampuracchidambhavacchidaṅgajacchidam(-)
makhacchidāndhakacchidantamantakacchidambhaje || (8) ||

akharvasarvamaṅgalākalākadambamañjarī(-)
rasappravāhamādhurīvijṛmbhaṇāmadhuvvratam |
smarāntakampurāntakammakhāntakambhavāntakaṅ(-)
gajāntakāndhakāntakantamantakāntakambhaje || (9) ||

jayatyadabhravibhramadbhramadbhujaṅgamaśvasad(-)
vinirgamakramasphuratkarālabhālahavyavāṭ |
dhimindhimindhimindhvananmṛdaṅgatuṅgamaṅgala(-)
dhvanikramapravarttitapracaṇḍatāṇḍavaḥ śivaḥ || (10) ||

dṛṣadvicitratalpayorbbhujaṅgamauktikasrajor(-)
gariṣṭharatnaloṣṭayoḥ suhṛdvipakṣapakṣayoḥ |
tṛṇāravindacakṣuṣoḥ prajāmahīmahendrayoḥ
samapravṛttikaḥ kadā sadāśivambhajāmyaham || (11) ||

kadā nilimpanirjjharīnikuñjakoṭare vasan(-)
vimuktadurmmatissadā śiraḥsthamañjali(/) vvahan |
vilolalolalocanālalāmabhālalagnakaṃ 
śiveti mantramuccaransadā sukhī bhavāmyaham || (12) ||

nilimpanāthanāgarī(-)kadambamaulimallikā(-)
nigumphanirbbharakṣaranmadhūlikāmanoharaḥ |
tanotu no mano muda(/) vvinodanīmaharnniśam(-)
paraśriyaḥ parampadantadaṅgajatviṣāñcayaḥ || (13) ||

pracaṇḍavāḍavānalaprabhāśubhapracāriṇī 
mahāṣṭasiddhikāminījanāvahūtajalpanā |
vimuktavāmalocanā vivāhakālikadhvaniḥ 
śivetimantrabhūṣaṇā jagajjayāya jāyatām || (14) ||

iti rāvaṇakṛtaṃ śivastotraṃ sampūrṇam ||


atha śivakavacam

	asya śrīśivakavacastotramantrasya brahmāṛṣiḥ(,) anuṣṭupchandaḥ(,) 
śrīsadāśivarudro devatā(,) hrīṃśaktiḥ(,) raṃkīlakam(,) 
śrīṃhrīṃklīṃbījam(,) śrīsadāśivaprītyartthe śivakavacastotrajape 
viniyogaḥ ||

atha karanyāsaḥ 

oṃ namo bhagavate jvalajjvālāmāline oṃ rāṃsarvaśaktidhāmne īśānātmane 
aṅguṣṭhābhyānnamaḥ(,) 

<p. 482> oṃ namo bhagavate jvalajjvālāmāline oṃ na(/)rīṃnityatṛptidhāmne 
tatpuruṣātmane tarjjanībhyānnamaḥ(,) oṃ namo bhagavate jvalajjvālāmāline oṃ 
ma(/)rū(/-)anādiśaktidhāmne aghorātmane madhyamābhyānnamaḥ(,) oṃ namo 
bhagavate jvalajjvālāmāline oṃ śiṃraiṃ svatantraśaktidhāmne 
vāmadevātmane anāmikābhyānnamaḥ(,) oṃ namo bhagavate 
jvalajjvālāmāline oṃ vā(/)rauṃ atulyaśaktidhāmne sadyojātātmane 
kaniṣṭhābhyānnamaḥ(,) oṃ namo bhagavate jvalajjvālāmāline oṃ ya(/)raḥ 
anādiśaktidhāmne sarvātmane karatalakarapṛṣṭhābhyānnamaḥ(,) evaṃ 
hṛdayādi ||

atha dhyānam

vajradaṃṣṭrantrinayanaṅkālakaṇṭhamarindamam |
sahasrakaramatyugra(/) vvande śambhumumāpatim || (1) ||

athāparaṃ sarvapurāṇaguhyanniḥśeṣapāpaughaharampavitram |
jayapradaṃ sarvavipatpramocana(/) vvakṣyāmi śaivaṅkavacaṃ hitāya te || (2) ||

ṛṣabha uvāca

namaskṛtvā mahādeva(/) vviśvavyāpinamīśvaram |
vakṣye śivamaya(/) vvarma sarvarakṣākarannṛṇām || (3) ||

śucau deśe samāsīno yathāvatkalpitāsanaḥ |
jitendriyo jitaprāṇaścintayecchivamavyayam || (4) ||

hṛtpuṇḍarīkāntarasanniviṣṭaṃ svatejasā vyāptanabhovakāśam |
atīndriyaṃ sūkṣmamanantamādyandhyāyetparānandamayammaheśam || (5) ||

dhyānāvadhūtākhilakarmabandhaścirañcidānandanimagnacetāḥ |
ṣaḍakṣaranyāsasamāhitātmā śaivena kuryātkavacena rakṣām || (6) ||

māmpātu devo'khiladevatātmāsaṃsārakūpe patitaṅgabhīre |
tannāma divya(/) vvaramantramūlandhunotu me sarvamaghaṃ hṛdistham || (7) ||

sarvatra māṃ rakṣatu viśvamūrttirjjyotirmmayānandaghanaścidātmā |
aṇoraṇīyānuruśaktirekaḥ sa īśvaraḥ pātu bhayādaśeṣāt || (8) ||

yo bhūsvarūpeṇa bibharttiviśvampāyāt sa bhūmerggiriśo'ṣṭamūrttiḥ |
yo'pāṃsvarūpeṇa nṛṇāṅkaroti sañjīvanaṃ so'vatu māñjalebhyaḥ || (9) ||

<p. 483> kalpāvasāne bhuvanāni dagdhvā sarvāṇi yo nṛtyati bhūrilīlaḥ |
sa kālarudro'vatu māndavāgnervātyādibhīterakhilācca tāpāt || (10) ||

pradīptavidyutkanakāvabhāso vidyāvarābhītikuṭhārapāṇiḥ |
caturmukhastatpuruṣastrinetraḥ prācyāṃ sthitaṃ rakṣatu māmajasram || (11) ||

kuṭhārakheṭāṅkuśapāśaśūlakapālaḍhakkākṣaguṇāndadhānaḥ |
caturmukho nīlarucistrinetraḥ pāyādaghoro diśi dakṣiṇasyām || (12) ||

kundenduśaṅkhasphaṭikāvabhāso vedākṣamālāvaradābhayāṅkaḥ |
tryakṣaścaturvaktra uruprabhāvaḥ sadyodhijāto'vatu māmpratīcyām || (13) ||

varākṣamālābhayaṭaṅkahastaḥ sarojakiñjalkasamānavarṇaḥ |
trilocanaścārucaturmukho māmpāyādudīcyāndiśi vāmadevaḥ || (14) ||

vedābhayeṣṭāṅkuśapāśaṭaṅkakapālaḍhakkākṣakaśūlapāṇiḥ |
sitadyutiḥ pañcamukho'vatānmāmīśāna ūrddhvamparamaprakāśaḥ || (15) 
||

mūrddhānamavyānmama candramaulirbbhālammamāvyādatha bhālanetraḥ |
netre mamāvyādbhaganetrahārī nāsāṃ sadā rakṣatu viśvanāthaḥ || (16) ||

pāyācchrutī me śrutigītakīrttiḥ kapolamavyātsatataṅkapālī |
vaktraṃ sadā rakṣatu pañcavaktro jihvāṃ sadā rakṣatu vedajihvaḥ || (17) ||

kaṇṭhaṅgirīśo'vatu nīlakaṇṭhaḥ pāṇidvayampātu pinākapāṇiḥ |
dormmūlamavyānmama dharmabāhurvakṣasthalandakṣamakhāntako'vyāt || 
(18) ||

mamodarampātu girīndradhanvā madhyammamāvyānmadanāntakārī |
herambatāto mama pātu nābhimpāyātkaṭindhūrjjaṭirīśvaro me || (19) ||

ūrudvayampātu kuberamitro jānudvayamme jagadīśvaro'vyāt |
jaṅghāyugampuṅgavaketuravyātpādau mamāvyātsuravandyapādaḥ || (20) ||

maheśvaraḥ pātu dinādiyāme māmmadhyayāme'vatu vāmadevaḥ |
triyambakaḥ pātu tṛtīyayāme vṛṣadhvajaḥ pātu dināntyayāme || (21) ||

pāyānniśādau śaśiśekharo māṅgaṅgādharo rakṣatu mānniśīthe |
<p. 484> gaurīpatiḥ pātu niśāvasāne mṛtyuñjayo rakṣatu sarvakālam || (22) ||

antaḥsthitaṃ rakṣatu śaṅkaro māṃ sthāṇuḥ sadā pātu bahiḥsthitammām 
|
tadantare pātu patiḥ paśūnāṃ sadāśivo rakṣatu māṃ samantāt || (23) ||

tiṣṭhantamavyādbhuvanaikanāthaḥ pāyādvrajantampramathādhināthaḥ |
vedāntavedyo'vatu mānniṣaṇṇammāmavyayaḥ pātu śivaḥ śayānam || (24) 
||

mārgeṣu māṃ rakṣatu nīlakaṇṭhaḥ śailādidurggeṣu puratrayāriḥ |
araṇyavāsādimahāpravāse pāyānmṛgavyādha udāraśaktiḥ || (25) ||

kalpāntakāṭopapaṭuprakopasphuṭāṭṭahāsoccalitāṇḍakośaḥ |
ghorarisenārṇavadurnnivāramahābhayādrakṣatu vīrabhadraḥ || (26) ||

pattyaśvamātaṅgarathāvarūthasahasralakṣāyutakoṭibhīṣaṇam |
akṣauhiṇīnāṃ śatamātatāyināścchindyānmṛḍo ghorakuṭhāradhārayā || 
(27) ||

nihantudasyūnpralayānalārccirjjvalantriśūlantripurāntakasya |
śārdūlasiṃharkṣavṛkādihiṃsrān santrāsayatvīśa dhanuḥ pinākaḥ || (28) ||

duḥsvapnaduḥśakunadurgatidaurmanasyadurbbhikṣadurvyasanaduḥsahaduryaś
āṃsi |
utpātatāpaviṣabhītimasadgrahārttivyādhīṃśca nāśayatu me 
jagatāmadhīśaḥ || (29) ||

oṃ namo bhagavate sadāśivāya sakalatattvātmakāya sarvamantrarūpāya 
sarvayantrādhiṣṭhitāya sarvatantrarūpāya sarvatattvavidūrāya 
brahmarudrāvatāriṇe nīlakaṇṭhāya pārvatīmanoharapriyāya 
somasūryāgnilocanāya bhasmoddhūlitavigrahāya 
mahāmaṇimukuṭadhāraṇāya māṇikyabhūṣaṇāya 
sṛṣṭisthitipralayakālaraudrāvatārāya dakṣādhvaradhvaṃsakāya 
mahākālabhedanāya mūladhāraikanilayāna tattvātītāya gaṅgādharāya 
sarvadevādhidevāya ṣaḍāśrayāya vedāntasārāya ||

trivargasādhanāyānantakoṭibrahmāṇḍanāyakāyā'nanta(-)vāsuki(-)takṣaka(-)
karkkoṭakaśaṅkhakulikapadma(-)
mahāpadmetyaṣṭamahānāgakulabhūṣaṇāya praṇavasvarūpāya 
cidākāśāyākāśadiksvarūpāya 

<p. 485> grahanakṣatramāline sakalāya kalaṅkarahitāya sakalalokaikakarttre 
sakalalokaikasaṃhartre sakalalokaikagurave sakalalokaikasākṣiṇe 
sakalanigamaguhyāya sakalavedāntapāragāya sakalalokaikavarapradāya 
sakalalokaikaśaṅkarāya śaśāṅkaśekharāya śāśvatanijāvāsāya 
nirābhāsāya nirāmayāya nirmalāya nirllobhāya nirmadāya niścintāya 
nirahaṅkārāya niraṅkuśāya niṣkalaṅkāya nirguṇāya niṣkāmāya 
nirupaplavāya niravadyāya nirantarāya niṣkāraṇāya nirātaṅkāya 
niṣprapañcāyanissaṅgāya nirdvandvāya nirādhārāya nīrāgāya 
niṣkrodhāya nirmalāya niṣpāpāya nirbbhayāya nirvikalpāya nirbbhedāya 
niṣkriyāya nistulāya niḥsaṃśayāya nirañjanāya nirupamavibhavāya 
nityaśuddhabuddhiparipūrṇasaccidānandādvayāya paramaśāntasvarūpāya 
tejorūpāya tejomayāya jaya jaya rudra mahāraudra mahāvatāra 
mahābhairava kālabhairava kalpāntabhairava kapālamālādhara 
khaṭvāṅgakhaḍgacarmapāśāṅkuśaḍamaruśūlacāpabāṇagadāśaktibhi
ndipālatomaramusalamudgarapāśaparighabhuśuṇḍīśataghnīcakrādyāyudh
abhīṣaṇakarasahasramukhadaṃṣṭrākarālavadana 
vikaṭāṭṭahāsavisphāritabrahmāṇḍamaṇḍala nāgendrakuṇḍala 
nāgendrahāra nāgendravalaya nāgendracarmadhara mṛtyuñjaya tryambaka 
tripurāntaka viśvarūpa virūpākṣa viśveśvara vṛṣabhavāhana 
viśvatomukha sarvato rakṣa rakṣa mā jvala jvala 
mahāmṛtyumapamṛtyubhayannāśaya nāśaya(,) corabhayamutsādayotsādaya 
viṣasarpabhayaṃ śamaya śamaya(,) corānmāraya māraya(,) mama 
śatrūnuccāṭayoccāṭaya(,) triśūlena vidāraya vidāraya(,) kuṭhāreṇa bhindhi 
bhindhi(,) khaḍgena chindhi chindhi(,) khaṭvāṅgena vipothaya vipothaya(,) musalena 
niṣpeṣaya niṣpeṣaya(,) bāṇaiḥ santāḍaya santāḍaya(,) rakṣāṃsi bhīṣaya 
bhīṣaya(,) aśeṣabhūtāni vidrāvaya vidrāvaya(,) 
kūṣmāṇḍavetālamārīgaṇabrahmarākṣasagaṇān santrāsaya santrāsaya(,) 
mamābhayaṅkuru kuru(,)

<p. 486> vitrastammāmāśvāsayāśvāsaya(,) 
narakamahābhayānmāmuddharoddhara sañjīvaya sañjīvaya(,) 
kṣuttṛḍbhyāmmāmāpyāyayāpyāyaya(,) 
duḥkhāturammāmānandayānandaya(,) śivakavacena 
māmācchādayācchādaya(,) mṛtyuñjaya tryambaka sadāśiva namaste ||

ṛṣabha uvāca 

ityetatkavacaṃ śaiva(/) vvarada(/) vyāhṛtammayā |
sarvabādhāpraśamanaṃ rahasyaṃ sarvadehinām || (30) ||

yaḥ sadā dhārayenmarttyaḥ śaivaṅkavacamuttamam |
na tasya jāyate kvāpi bhayaṃ śambhoranugrahāt || (31) ||

kṣīṇāyuḥ prāptamṛtyurvā mahārogahato'pi vā |
sadyaḥ sukhamavāpnoti dīrgghamāyuśca vindati || (32) ||

sarvadāridryaśamanaṃ saumaṅgalyavivarddhanam |
yo dhatte kavacaṃ śaivaṃ sa devairapi pūjyate || (33) ||

mahāpātakasaṅghātairmucyate copapātakaiḥ |
dehānte muktimāpnoti śivavarmānubhāvataḥ || (34) ||

tvamapi śraddhayā vatsa śaivaṅkavacamuttamam |
dhārayasva mayā dattaṃ sadyaḥ śreyo hyavāpsyasi || (35) ||

sūta uvāca

ityuktvā ṛṣabho yogī tasmai pārtthivasūnave |
dadau śaṅkhammahārāvaṅkhaḍgañcāriniṣūdanam || (36) ||

punaśca bhasma sammantrya tadaṅgamparito'spṛśat |
gajānāṃ ṣaṭsahasrasya dviguṇasya balandadau || (37) ||

bhammaprabhāvātsamprāptabalaiśvaryadhṛtismṛtiḥ |
sa rājaputraḥ śuśubhe śaradarka iva śriyā || (38) ||

tamāha prāñjalimbhūyaḥ sa yogī nṛpanandanam |
eṣa khaḍgo mayā dattastapo mantrānubhāvitaḥ || (39) ||

śitadhāramima(/) khaḍga(/) yyasmai darśayase sphuṭam |
sa sadyo mriyate śatruḥ sākṣānmṛtyurapi svayam || (40) ||

asya śaṅkhasya nirhrāda(/) yye śṛṇvanti tavāhitāḥ |
te mūrcchitāḥ patiṣyanti nyastaśastrā vicetanāḥ || (41) ||

khaḍgaśaṅkhāvimau divyau parasainyavināśinau |
ātmasainyasvapakṣāṇāṃ śauryatejovivarddhanau || (42) ||

etayośca prabhāveṇa śaivena kavacena ca |
dviṣaṭsahasranāgānāmbalena mahatāpi ca || (43) ||

<p. 487> bhasmadhāraṇasāmartthyācchatrusainya(/) vvijeṣyasi |
prāpya siṃhāsanampitryaṅgoptā'si pṛthivīmimām || (44) ||

iti bhadrāyuṣaṃ samyaganuśāsya samātṛkam |
tābhyāṃ sampūjitaḥ so'tha yogī svairagatiryayau || (45) ||

iti śivakavacaṃ sampūrṇam ||


athopaniṣat 

	oṃ namaśśivāya oṃ namostu sarva śambho trinetra cārugātra 
trailokyanātha umāpathe dakṣayajñavidhvaṃsakāraka sakāmāṅganāśana 
ghorapāpapraṇāśana mahāpuruṣa mahogramūrtte sarvasattvakṣayaṅkara 
śubhaṅkara maheśvara triśūladhara smarāre guhādhāman digvāsaḥ 
mahāśaṅkhaśekharajaṭādhara kapālamālāvibhūṣitaśarīra 
vāmacakṣuḥkṣubhitadevaprajādhyakṣa bhagākṣnoḥkṣayaṅkara 
bhīmasenanātha paśupate kāmāṅgadahana catvaravāsin śiva mahādevaṃ 
īśāna śaṅkara bhīmabhava vṛṣadhvaja kaiṭabha prauḍha mahānātheśvara 
bhūtirata avimuktaka rudrarudreśvara sthāṇo ekaliṅga kālindīpriya 
śrīkaṇṭha nīlakaṇṭha aparājita ripubhayaṅkara santoṣapate vāmadeva 
aghora tatpuruṣa mahāghora aghoramūrtte śānta sarasvatīkānta  
sahasramūrtte mahodbhava vibho kālāgne rudra raudra hara mahīdharapriya 
sarvatīrtthādhivāsa haṃsa kāmeśvara kedāra adhipate paripūrṇa 
mucukunda madhunivāsa kṛpāṇapāṇe bhayaṅkara vidyārāja somarāja 
kāmarāja mahīdhararājakanyāhṛdabjavasate samudraśāyin 
gayāmukhagokarṇabrahmayone sahasravaktrākṣicaraṇahāṭakeśvara namaste 
namaste || ityupaniṣat ||


atha śatanāma

śivo maheśvaraḥ śambhuḥ pinākī śaśiśekharaḥ |
vāmadevo virūpākṣaḥ kapardī nīlalohitaḥ || (1) ||

śaṅkaraḥ śūlapāṇiśca khaṭvāṅgī viṣṇuvallabhaḥ |
śipiviṣṭombikānāthaḥ śrīkaṇṭho bhaktavatsalaḥ || (2) ||

<p. 488> bhavaḥ sarvastrilokeśaḥ śitikaṇṭhaḥ śivāpriyaḥ |
ugraḥ kapāli kāmārirandhakāsurasūdanaḥ || (3) ||

gaṅgādharo lalāṭākṣaḥ kālakālaḥ kṛpānidhiḥ |
bhīmaḥ paraśuhastaśca mṛgapāṇirjaṭādharaḥ || (4) ||

kailāsavāsī kavacī kaṭhorastripurāntakaḥ |
vṛṣāṅko vṛṣabhārūḍho bhasmodvalitavigrahaḥ || (5) ||

sāmapriyaḥ svaramayastrayīmūrtiranīśvaraḥ |
sarvajñaḥ paramātmā ca somasūryāgnilocanaḥ || (6) ||

haviryajñamayaḥ somaḥ pañcavaktraḥ sadāśivaḥ |
viśveśvaro vīrabhadro gaṇanāthaḥ prajāpatiḥ || (7) ||

hiraṇyaretā durddharṣo girīśo giriśonaghaḥ |
bhujaṅgabhūṣaṇo bhargo giridhanvā giripriyaḥ || (8) ||

kṛttivāsāḥ purārātirbbhagavānpramathādhipaḥ |
mṛtyuñjayaḥ sūkṣmatanurjjagadvyāpī jagadguruḥ || (9) ||

vyomakeśo mahāsenajanakaścāruvikramaḥ |
rudro bhūtapatiḥ sthāṇurahirbudhnyo digambaraḥ || (10) ||

aṣṭamūrttiranekātmā sāttvikaḥ śuddhavigrahaḥ |
śāśvataḥ khaṇḍaparaśurajaḥ pāśavimocakaḥ || (11) ||

mṛḍaḥ paśupatirddevo mahādevo'vyayaḥ prabhuḥ |
pūṣadantabhidavyagro dakṣādhvaraharo haraḥ || (12) ||

bhaganetrabhidavyaktaḥ sahasrākṣaḥ sahasrapāt |
apavargaprado'nantastārakaḥ parameśvaraḥ || (13) ||

imāni divyanāmāni japyante sarvadā mayā |
nāma kalpalateyamme sarvābhīṣṭapradāyinī || (14) ||

nāmānyetāni subhage śivadāni na saṃśayaḥ |
vedasarvasvabhūtāni nāmānyetāni vastutaḥ || (15) ||

etāni yāni nāmāni tāni sarvārtthadānyataḥ |
japyante sādarannityammayā niyamapūrvakam || (16) ||

vedeṣu śivanāmāni śreṣṭhānyaghaharāṇi ca |
santyanantāni subhage vedeṣu vividheṣvapi || (17) ||

tebhyo nāmāni saṅgṛhya kumārāya maheśvaraḥ |
aṣṭottarasahasrantu nāmnāmupadiśatpurā || (18) ||

iti śivāṣṭottaraśatanāmastotraṃ sampūrṇam ||


<p. 489> atha sahasranāma

sūta uvāca

śrūyatāmṛṣayaḥ śreṣṭhāḥ kathayāmi yathāśrutam |
viṣṇunā prārthito yena santuṣṭaḥ parameśvaraḥ || (1) ||

tadahaṅkathayāmyadya puṇyaṃ nāma sahasrakam |

śrīviṣṇuruvāca

śivo haro mṛḍo rudraḥ puṣkaraḥ puṣpalocanaḥ || (2) ||

arthigamyaḥ sadācāraḥ sarvaḥ śaṃbhurmaheśvaraḥ |
candrāpīḍaścandramaulirviśvādiścāmareśvaraḥ || (3) ||

vedāntasārasandohaḥ kapālī nīlalohitaḥ |
dhyānādhāroparicchedyo gaurībharttā gaṇeśvaraḥ || (4) ||

aṣṭamūrttirviśvamūrttistrivargaḥ svargasādhanaḥ |
jñānagamyo dṛḍhaprajño devadevastrilocanaḥ || (5) ||

vāmadevo mahādevaḥ paṭuḥ parivṛḍho dṛḍhaḥ |
viśvarūpī virūpākṣo vāgīśaḥ śucimattaraḥ || (6) ||

sarvaḥ pramāṇasa(/)vvādī vṛṣāṅko vṛṣavāhanaḥ |
īśaḥ pinākī khaṭvāṅgī citraveṣaścirantanaḥ || (7) ||

tamoharo mahāyogī goptā brahmāṇḍahṛjjaṭī |
kālakālaḥ kṛttivāsāḥ subhagaḥ praṇatātmakaḥ || (8) ||

tripuṇḍradhārī cākṣuṣyo durvāsāḥ puraśāsanaḥ |
divyāyudhaḥ skandaguruḥ parameṣṭhī parātparaḥ || (9) ||

anādimadhyanidhano girīśo giribāndhavaḥ |
kuberabandhuḥ śrīkaṇṭho lokavarṇottamo mṛduḥ || (10) ||

samādhivedyaḥ kodaṇḍī nīlakaṇṭhaḥ paraśvadhī |
viśālākṣo mṛgavyādhaḥ sureśaḥ sūryatāpanaḥ || (11) ||

dharmadhāmā kṣamākṣetrambhagavānbhaganetrabhit |
ugraḥ paśupatistārkṣyaḥ priyabhaktaḥ priya(/)vvadaḥ || (12) ||

dātā dayākaro dakṣaḥ kapardī kāmaśāsanaḥ |
śmaśānanilayaḥ sūkṣmaḥ śmaśānastho maheśvaraḥ || (13) ||

lokakarttā mṛgapatirmahākarttā mahauṣadhīḥ |
uttaro gopatirgoptā jñānagamyaḥ purātanaḥ || (14) ||

nītiḥ sunītiḥ śuddhātmā somaḥ somarataḥ sukhī |
somapo'mṛtapaḥ saumyo mahājyotirmahādyutiḥ || (15) ||

tejomayo'mṛtamayo'nnamayaśca sudhāpatiḥ |
<p. 490> ajātaśatrurālokasambhāvyo havyavāhanaḥ || (16) ||

lokakaro vedakaraḥ sūtrakāraḥ sanātanaḥ |
maharṣiḥ kapilācāryo viśvadīptirvilocanaḥ || (17) ||

pinākapāṇirbbhūdevavaśagaḥ svastikṛtsudhīḥ |
dhātṛdhāmā dhāmakaraḥ sarvadaḥ sarvagocaraḥ || (18) ||

brahmasṛgviśvasṛksarvaḥ karṇikārapriyaḥ kaviḥ |
śākho viśākho gośākhaḥ śivo bhiṣaganuttamaḥ || (19) ||

gaṅgāpplavodako bhavyaḥ puṣkalaḥ sthapatiḥ sthiraḥ |
vijitātmā vidheyātmā bhūtavāhanasārathiḥ || (20) ||

sagaṇo gaṇavaryaśca sukīrttiścchinnasaṃśayaḥ |
kāmadevaḥ kāmapālo bhasmoddhūlitavigrahaḥ || (21) ||

bhasmapriyo bhasmaśāyī kāmī kāntaḥ kṛtāgamaḥ |
samāvartto nivṛttātmā dharmapuñjaḥ sadāśivaḥ || (22) ||

akalmaṣaścaturbāhurdurāvāso durāsadaḥ |
durllabho durgamo durgaḥ sarvāyudhaviśāradaḥ || (23) ||

adhyātmayoganilayaḥ sutantustantuvarddhanaḥ |
śubhāṅgo lokasāraṅgo jagadīśo janārdanaḥ || (24) ||

bhasmaśuddhikaro merurojasvī śuddhavigrahaḥ |
asādhyasādhusādhyaśca bhṛtyamarkaṭarūpadhṛk || (25) ||

hiraṇyaretāḥ paurāṇo ripujīvaharocalaḥ |
mahāhṛdo mahāgarttaḥ siddhavṛndārakeḍitaḥ || (26) ||

vyāghracarmāmbaro vyālī mahābhūto mahānidhiḥ |
amṛtānubhavaḥ śrīmānpāñcajanyaḥ prabhañjanaḥ || (27) ||

pañcaviṃśatitattvasthaḥ pārijātaḥ parātparaḥ |
sulabhaḥ suvrataḥ śūro vāṅmayīkanidhirnnidhiḥ || (28) ||

varṇāśramagururvarṇī śatrujicchatrutāpanaḥ |
āśramaḥ kṣapaṇaḥ kṣāmo jñānavānacaleśvaraḥ || (29) ||

pramāṇabhūto durjñeyaḥ suparṇo vāyuvāhanaḥ |
dhanurddharo dhanurvedo guṇaḥ śaśiguṇākaraḥ || (30) ||

satyaḥ satyaparo dīno dharmāṅgo dharmasādhanaḥ |
anantadṛṣṭirānando daṇḍo damayitā damaḥ || (31) ||

abhicāryo mahāmāyo viśvakarmā viśāradaḥ |
vītarāgo vinītātmā tapasvī bhūtavāhanaḥ || (32) ||

<p. 491> unmattaveṣaḥ pracchatro jitakāmorcitapriyaḥ |
kalpāntaprakṛtiḥ kalpaḥ sarvalokaprajāpatiḥ || (33) ||

tarasvī tārako dhīmānpradhānaḥ prabhuravyayaḥ |
lokapālontarhitātmā kalpādiḥ kamalekṣaṇaḥ || (34) ||

vedaśāstrārtthatattvajño niyamo niyamāśrayaḥ |
candraḥ sūryaḥ śaniḥ keturvirāgo vidrumacchaviḥ || (35) ||

bhaktivaśyaḥ parambrahma mṛgabāṇārpaṇo nayaḥ |
adriradryālayaḥ kāntaḥ paramātmā jagadguruḥ || (36) ||

sarvakāmālayastuṣṭo māṅgalyo maṅgalāvṛtaḥ |
mahātapā dīrgghatapāḥ sthaviṣṭhaḥ sthaviro drumaḥ || (37) ||

ahaḥ sa(/)vvatsaro vyāptiḥ pramāṇamparamantapaḥ |
sa(/)vvatsarakaro mantraḥ pratyayaḥ sarvadarśanaḥ || (38) ||

ajaḥ sarveśvaraḥ siddho mahāretā mahābalaḥ |
yogo yogyo mahātejāḥ siddhasarvādivigrahaḥ || (39) ||

vasurvasumanāḥ satyaḥ sarvapāpaharo haraḥ |
sukīrttiḥ śobhitaḥ śrāvī hyavāṅmanasagocaraḥ || (40) ||

amṛtaḥ śāśvataḥ śānto droṇahastaḥ pratāpavān |
kamaṇḍaludharo dhanvī vedāṅgo vedavinmuniḥ || (41) ||

bhrājiṣṇurbbhojanambhoktā lokanātho durāvaraḥ |
atīndriyo mahāmāyaḥ sarvāvāsaścatuṣpathaḥ || (42) ||

kālayogī mahānādo mahotsāho mahābalaḥ |
mahābuddhirmahāvīryo bhūtacārī purandaraḥ || (43) ||

niśācaraḥ pratacārī mahāśaktirmahādyutiḥ |
anirddeśyavapuḥ śrīmānsarvācāryamanogatiḥ || (44) ||

bahuśruto mahāmāyo niyatātmā dhruvo'dhruvaḥ |
tejastejodyutidharo narakaḥ sarvaśāsakaḥ || (45) ||

nṛtyapriyo nityanṛtyaḥ prakāśātmāprakāśakaḥ |
spaṣṭaḥ krūro budho mantraḥ samānaḥ sārasamplavaḥ || (46) ||

yugādikṛdyugāvarto gambhīro vṛṣavāhanaḥ |
iṣṭo viśiṣṭaḥ śiṣṭeṣṭaḥ śarabhaḥ śarabhodhanuḥ || (47) ||

tīrttharūpastīrtthanāmā tīrtthādṛśyaḥ sutīrtthadaḥ |
<p. 492> apānnidhiradhiṣṭhāna(/) vvijayo jayakālavit || (48) ||

pratiṣṭhitaḥ pramāṇajño hiraṇyakavaco hariḥ |
vimocanaḥ suragaṇo vidyeśo bindusaṃśrayaḥ || (49) ||

bālarūpo balonmatto vikarttā gahano guhaḥ |
karaṇaṅkāraṇaṅkarttā sarvabandhavimocanaḥ || (50) ||

vyavasāyo vyavasthānaḥ sthānado jagadādijaḥ |
gurudo lalito bhedo nivāsātmani saṃsthitaḥ || (51) ||

vīreśvaro vīrabhadro viśvarūpo vidhirvirāṭ |
vīracandro maṇirddharttā tīvrānando nadīśvaraḥ || (52) ||

agnyādhārastriśūlī ca śipiviṣṭaḥ śivālayaḥ |
vālakhilyo mahāvīryastigmāṃśurbbadhiraḥ khagaḥ || (53) ||

abhirāmaḥ suśaraṇaḥ subrahmaṇyaḥ sudhānidhiḥ |
maghavā kauśiko gomān virāmaḥ sarvasādhanaḥ || (54) ||

lalāṭajo viśvadehaḥ sārasaṃsāracakrabhṛt |
amogho daṇḍimadhyastho hariṇobrahmavarccasaḥ || (55) ||

paramārtthaḥ paromāyī sa(/)vvaro vyāghrakonalaḥ |
rucirvararucirvandyo vācaspatiraharpatiḥ || (56) ||

ravirvirocanaḥ skandaḥ śāstā vaivasvato'maraḥ |
yuktikṛnmattakīrttiśca sānugaśca purañjayaḥ || (57) ||

kailāsādhipatiḥ kāntaḥ savitāravilocanaḥ |
viśvottamo vītabhayo viśvabharttānivāritaḥ || (58) ||

nityo niyatakalyāṇaḥ puṇyaśravaṇakīrttanaḥ |
dūraśravā  viśvasaho dhyeyo duḥkhapraṇāśanaḥ || (59) ||

uttāraṇo duṣkṛtihā vijñeyo duḥsaho bhavaḥ |
anādirbhūrbbhuvolakṣmīḥ kirīṭī tridaśādhipaḥ || (60) ||

viśvagoptā viśvakarttā suvīro rucirāṅgadaḥ |
janano janajanmādiḥ prītimānnītimāndhavaḥ || (61) ||

vasiṣṭhaḥ kaśyapo bhānurbbhīmo bhīmaparākramaḥ |
praṇavaḥ satpathācāro mahākāśo mahādhanaḥ || (62) ||

janmādhipo mahādevaḥ sakalāgamapāragaḥ |
tattvantattvavidekātmā vibhurviṣṇurvibhūṣaṇaḥ || (63) ||

ṛṣirbrāhmaṇa aiśvaryo janmamṛtyujarātigaḥ |
<p. 493> pañcayajñasamutpattirviśveśo vimalodayaḥ || (64) ||

anādyanta ātmayonirvatsalo bhaktalokadhṛk |
gāyatrīvallabhaḥ prāṃśurviśvāsaḥ prabhākaraḥ || (65) ||

śiśurgirirataḥ samrāṭsuṣeṇaḥ suraśatruhā |
anemiriṣṭanemiśca muktido vigatajvaraḥ || (66) ||

svayañjyotistapañjyotiratijyotiracañcalaḥ |
piṅgalaḥ kapilaḥ śmaśrurbbhālanetrastrayītanuḥ || (67) ||

jñānaskando mahānītirviśvotpattirupaplavaḥ |
bhogī vivasvatastattvo yogapāro divaspatiḥ || (68) ||

kalyāṇaguṇanāmā ca pāpahā puṇyadarśanaḥ |
udārakīrttirudyogī mahanmānyaśca sattvapaḥ || (69) ||

nakṣo malinakeśaśca svādhiṣṭhānamadāśrayaḥ |
pavitraḥ pāpanāśaśca maṇipūro nabhogatiḥ || (70) ||

hṛtpuṇḍarīkamāsīnaḥ śakraḥ śānto vṛṣākapiḥ |
kṛṣṇo grahapatiḥ kṛṣṇaḥ samarttho'nartthanāśanaḥ || (71) ||

adharmaśatrurajñeyaḥ puruhūtaḥ puruśrutaḥ |
brahmagarbbho bṛhadgarbbho dharmadhenurddhanāgamaḥ || (72) ||

jagaddhitaiṣī sugataḥ kumāraḥ kuśalāgamaḥ |
hiraṇyavarṇo jyotiṣmānnānābhūtarato dhvaniḥ || (73) ||

ārogyo nayanādhyakṣo viśvāmitro dhaneśvaraḥ |
brahmajyotirvasurddhāmā mahājyotiranuttamaḥ || (74) ||

mātāmaho mātariśvā nabhasvānnāgahāradhṛk |
pulastyaḥ pulaho'gastyo jātūkarṇyaḥ parāśaraḥ || (75) ||

nirāvaraṇanirvāro vairañcayo viṣṭaraśravāḥ |
ātmabhūraniruddho'trirjñānamūrttirmahāyaśāḥ || (76) ||

lokavīrāgraṇīrvīraścandraḥ satyaparākramaḥ |
vyālakalpo mahākalpaḥ kalpavṛkṣaḥ kalādharaḥ || (77) ||

alaṅkariṣṇuracalo rociṣṇurvikramo'mbaraḥ |
āśuḥ śabdapatirvaṅgī plavanaḥ śikhisārathiḥ || (78) ||

asaṃsṛtipatiḥ śakraḥ pramādaḥ pādapāsanaḥ |
vasuśravāḥ kavyavāhaḥ pratapto viśvabhojanaḥ || (79) ||

japyo jarāriḥ śamano lohitāśvastanūnapāt |
<p. 494> nabhayoniḥ suniṣpannaḥ surabhiḥ śiśirātmakaḥ || (80) ||

vasanto mādhavo grīṣmo nabhastho bījavāhanaḥ |
aṅgirāgururātreyo vimalo viśvavāhanaḥ || (81) ||

pāvanaḥ purujicchakrastraividyo naravāraṇaḥ |
manobuddhirahaṅkāraḥ kṣetrajñaḥ kṣetrapālakaḥ || (82) ||

jamadagnirjjalanidhirvigolo viśvagolakaḥ |
aghoro'nuttaro yajñaḥ śreṣṭho niḥśreyasālayaḥ || (83) ||

śailo gaganakundābho dānavārirarindamaḥ |
cāmuṇḍājīvakaścāruniḥśalyo lokakalpadhṛk || (84) ||

caturvvedaścaturbbhāvaścaturaścaturapriyaḥ |
āmnāyo'tha samāmnāyastīrtthavedaśivālayaḥ || (85) ||

bahurūpo mahārūpaḥ sarvarūpaścarācaraḥ |
nayanirmāyako nyāyo nyāyagamyo nirañjanaḥ || (86) ||

sahasramūrddhā devendraḥ sarvaśāstraprabhañjanaḥ |
muṇḍo virūpo vikrāṃto daṇḍī tāṇḍaguṇottamaḥ || (87) ||

piṅgalākṣo hayagrīvo nīlagrīvo nirāmayaḥ |
sahasrabāhuḥ sarveśaḥ śaraṇyaḥ sarvalokadhṛk || (88) ||

padmāsanaḥ parañjyotiḥ parampāramparamphalam |
padmagarbbho mahāgarbbho viśvagarbbho vicakṣaṇaḥ || (89) ||

carācarajño varado vareśastu mahāsvanaḥ |
devāsuragururddevo devāsuranamaskṛtaḥ || (90) ||

devāsuramahāmitro devāsuramahāśramaḥ |
devādidevo devognirdevāsuravarapradaḥ || (91) ||

devāsureśvaro divyo devāsuramaheśvaraḥ |
devadevo mahācintyo devatātmātmasambhavaḥ || (92) ||

sadyonaṣṭāsuravyāghro devasiṃho divākaraḥ |
vibudhāgracaraḥ śreṣṭhaḥ sarvadevottamottamaḥ || (93) ||

śivajñānapradaḥ śrīmāñchikhī śrīparvatapriyaḥ |
vajrahastaḥ siddhakhaḍgī narasiṃhanipātanaḥ || (94) ||

brahmacārī lokacārī dharmacārī dhanādhipaḥ |
nandī nandīśvaro nando lagnavṛttidharaḥ śuciḥ || (95) ||

liṅgādhyakṣaḥ surādhyakṣo yogādhyakṣo yugāvahaḥ |
svarddhāmā svargataḥ svāmī svaraḥ svaratamasvanaḥ || (96) ||

<p. 495> bodhādhyakṣo bījakarttā dharmakṛddharmasambhavaḥ |
dambho lobho'tha vai śambhussarvabhūtamaheśvaraḥ || (97) ||

śmaśānanilayastryakṣaḥ seturapratimākṛtiḥ |
lokottaraḥ sphuṭālokastryambako nāgabhūṣaṇaḥ || (98) ||

andhakārirmayadveṣī viṣṇoḥ skandharatātmakaḥ |
hitadaśca kṣayaguṇo dakṣāriḥ pūṣadantabhit || (99) ||

pūrjjaniḥ khaṇḍaparaśuḥ sakalo niṣkalo muniḥ |
akālaḥ sakalādhāraḥ pāṇḍurogo mṛgo nagaḥ || (100) ||

pūrṇaḥ pūrayitā puṇyaḥ sukumāraḥ sulocanaḥ |
sāṅgo goyaḥ priyākrūraḥ puṇyakīrttiranāmayaḥ || (101) ||

manojavastīrtthakaro jaṭilo jīviteśvaraḥ |
jīvitāntakaro nityo vasuretā vasupradaḥ || (102) ||

sujātiḥ satkṛtiḥ siddhiḥ sajātiḥ kālakaṇṭakaḥ |
kalādharo mahākālabhūtaḥ satyaparāyaṇaḥ || (103) ||

lokalāvaṇyakarttā ca lokottarasukhālayaḥ |
tejomayo dyutidharo lokamānāgraṇīraṇuḥ || (104) ||

śucismitaḥ prasannātmā ajeyo duratikramaḥ |
jyotirmmayo nirujāṅgo gaṅgāpreṣṭho jaleśvaraḥ || (105) ||

tumbavīṇo mahākāyo viśokaḥ śokanāśanaḥ |
trilokapā trilokeśaḥ sarvaśuddhiradhokṣajaḥ || (106) ||

avyaktalakṣaṇo devo vyakto'vyakto viśāmpatiḥ |
paraḥ śivo vasurnnāsā sāromā nandanomayaḥ || (107) ||

brahmā viṣṇuḥ prajāpālo haṃso haṃsagatirvayaḥ |
vedhā vidhātā sraṣṭā ca saṃharttā ca caturmukhaḥ || (108) ||

kailāsaśikharāvāsī sarvāvāsī sadāgatiḥ |
hiraṇyagarbbho druhiṇo bhūtanātho'tha bhūpatiḥ || (109) ||

sadyogī yogavidyogī varado brāhmaṇapriyaḥ |
devapriyo devanātho devako devacintakaḥ || (110) ||

viṣamākṣo  virūpākṣo vṛṣabho vṛṣavarddhanaḥ |
nirmmamo nirahaṅkāro nirmoho nirupadravaḥ || (111) ||

darpahā darpadodṛptaḥ sarvārtthaparivarttakaḥ |
sahasrajitsahasrārciḥ snigdhaprakṛtidakṣiṇaḥ || (112) ||

<p. 496> bhūtabhavyabhavonāthaḥ prabhavo bhūtināśanaḥ |
arttho'narttho mahākośaḥ parakāryaikapaṇḍitaḥ || (113) ||

niṣkaṇṭakaḥ kṛtānando nirvyājo vyājamarddanaḥ |
sattvavāna sātyakiḥ satyaḥ kīrttisnehaḥ kṛtāgataḥ || (114) ||

akampito guṇagrāhī naikātmā naikakarmakṛt |
suprītaḥ sumukhaḥ sūkṣmaḥ sukaro dakṣiṇānilaḥ || (115) ||

nandiskandadharo dhuryaḥ prakaṭaprītivarddhanaḥ |
aparājitaḥ sarvasattvo govindaḥ sattvavāhanaḥ || (116) ||

adhṛtaḥ svadhṛtaḥ siddhaḥ pūtamūrtiryaśodhanaḥ |
vārāhaśṛṅgadhṛkchūro balavānekanāthakaḥ || (117) ||

śrutiprakāśaḥ śrutimānekabandhuranekakṛt |
śrīvatsalaḥ śivārambhaḥ śāntabhadraḥ samoyaśaḥ || (118) ||

bhūyaśobhūṣaṇo bhūtirbbhūtakṛdbhūtibhāvanaḥ |
akampo bhaktikāyastu kālahā niṣkaleśvaraḥ || (119) ||

satyavrato mahātyāgī nityaśāntiḥ parāyaṇaḥ |
parārtthavṛttirvarado vivikṣustu viśāradaḥ || (120) ||

śubhadaḥ śubhakarttā ca śubhanāmā śubhaḥ svayam |
anartthito guṇagrāhī akarttā kanakaprabhaḥ || (121) ||

svabhāvabhadro madhyasthaḥ śatrughno vighnanāśanaḥ |
śikhaṇḍī kavacī śūlī jaṭī muṇḍī ca kuṇḍalī || (122) ||

amṛtyuḥ sarvadṛksiṃhastejorāśirmahāmaṇiḥ |
asaṅkhyeyo'prameyātmā vīryavānvīryakovidaḥ || (123) ||

vaidyaścaiva viyogī ca saptavīro munīśvaraḥ |
anukramo durādharṣo madhuraḥ priyadarśanaḥ || (124) ||

sureśastāraṇaḥ sarvaśabdaḥ pratapatāṅgatiḥ |
kālakṣayaḥ kālakārī sukṛtiḥ kṛtavāsukiḥ || (125) ||

maheṣvāso mahībharttā niṣkalaṅko viśṛṅkhalaḥ |
dyumaṇistaraṇirddhanyaḥ siddhidaḥ siddhisādhanaḥ || (126) ||

vivṛtaḥ sa(/)vvṛtastutyo vyūḍhorasko mahābhujaḥ |
sarvayonirnnirātaṅko naranārāyaṇapriyaḥ || (127) ||

nirlepo niḥprasaṅgātmā nirvyaṅgo vyaṅganāśanaḥ |
<p. 497> stavyaḥ stavapriyaḥ stotā vyāptamūrttirnnirākulaḥ || (128) ||

niravadyapadopāyo vidyārāśirasatkṛtaḥ |
praśāntabuddhirakṣuṇṇaḥ samprahā nityasundaraḥ || (129) ||

pāpahā darmadhāstrīśaḥ sākalpaḥ śarvarīpatiḥ |
paramārtthaguruddṛṣṭiḥ surairāśritavatsalaḥ || (130) ||

somo rasajño rasadaḥ sarvasattvāvalambanaḥ |
evannāmnāṃ sahasreṇa tuṣṭāva vṛṣabhadhvajam || (131) ||

prārthayāmāsa śambhu(/) vvai pūjayāmāsa śaṅkaram |
parīkṣārtthaṃ harerīśaḥ kamaleṣu maheśvaraḥ || (132) ||

gopayāmāsa kamalantadekambhuvaneśvaraḥ |
hṛdi vicāritantena kuto vai kamalaṅgatam || (133) ||

yātu yātu sukhenaiva netraṅkiṅkamalanna hi |
tadeva kamalaṅkṛtvā yajāmi candraśekharam || (134) ||

ityevaṃ hṛdayaṃ jñātvā viṣṇoramitatejasaḥ |
mā meti vyāharanneva prādurāsījjagadguruḥ || (135) ||

yatraiva ca kṛtā pūjā kṛṣṇena paramātmanā |
tasmādavatatārāśu maṇḍalātpārthivasya saḥ || (136) ||

yathoktarūpiṇaṃ śambhuntejorāśisamutthitam |
namaskṛtya puraḥ sthitvā stutiṅkṛtvā viśeṣataḥ || (137) ||

prasannavadano bhūtvā śambhośca sammukhaḥ sthitaḥ |
itthambhūtaṃ harirddṛṣṭvā koṭibhāskarabhūṣitam || (138) ||

praṇanāmīśvaraṃ śambhundevadevañjanārddanaḥ |
tadā prāha mahādevaḥ prahasanniva śaṅkaraḥ |
samprekṣyamāṇayā viśvaṅkṛtāñjalipuṭasthitam || (139) ||

śaṅkara uvāca

jñātammayedaṃ sakalandevakāryañjanārdana |
sudarśanākhyañcakrañca dadāmi tava śobhanam || (140) ||

yadrūpambhavatā dṛṣṭaṃ sarvalokasukhāvaham |
hitāya sarvadeveśakṛtambhāvaya suvrata || (141) ||

raṇājāvapi saṃsmṛtya devānānduḥkhanāśanam |
iṣṭañcakramidaṃ rūpamidannāma sahasrakam || (142) ||

ye śṛṇvanti sadā bhaktyā siddhi syādanapāyinī |
evamuktvā dadau cakraṃ sūryāyutasamaprabham || (145) ||

<p. 498> viṣṇurapi ca saṃsnātvā jagrāhodaṅmukhastadā |
namaskṛtya tadā devampunarvacanamabravīt || (144) ||

śṛṇu deva mayā dhyeyampaṭhanīyañca kimprabho |
lokānānduḥkhanāśārttha(/) vvada tva(/) llokaśaṅkara || (145) ||

iti pṛṣṭastadā tena santuṣṭastu śivo'bravīt |
rūpandhyeyammadīya(/) vvai sarvānartthavināśanam || (146) ||

anekaduḥkhanāśārtthampāṭhyannāma sahasrakam |
dhāryañcakraṃ sadā me'dya sarvānartthapraśāntaye || (147) ||

anye ca ye paṭhiṣyanti pāṭhayiṣyanti nityaśaḥ |
teṣāṃ duḥkhanna svapne'pi jāyate nātra saṃśayaḥ || (148) ||

rājñāñca saṅkaṭe prāpte śatavārampaṭhedyadi |
sāṅgañca vidhiyuktañca kalyāṇa(/) llabhate naraḥ || (149) ||

roganāśakarañcaitadvidyānāyakamuttamam |
yamuddiśya phalaśreṣṭhampaṭhiṣyanti narāstviha || (150) ||

labhante nātra sandehaḥ phalaṃ satyamanuttamam |
mama prātaḥ samutthāya pūjāṅkṛtvā madīyakam || (151) ||

paṭhate matsamakṣa(/) vai nityaṃ siddhirnna dūrataḥ |
aihikāṃ siddhimāsādya paralokasamudbhavām || (152) ||

prāpnoti pāṭhako nityammatprasādātsureśvara |
sāyujyāṃ muktimāyāti nātra kāryā vicāraṇā || (153) ||

evamuktvā tadā viṣṇuṃ śaṅkaraḥ prītamānasaḥ |
upaspṛśya karābhyāṃ hi uvāca śaṅkaraḥ punaḥ || (154) ||

varado'smi suraśreṣṭha varānvṛṇu yathepsitān |
bhaktyā vaśīkṛto nūnaṃ stavenānena te sadā || (155) ||

ityukto devadevena devadevampraṇamya tam |
yathedānīṅkṛpā deva kriyate cāpyataḥ param || (156) ||

kāryā caiva viśeṣeṇa kṛpālutvāttvayā prabho |
tvayi bhaktirmahādeva prasīda varamuttamam || (147) ||

nānyadicchāmi bhaktānāmārttirnaiva bhavetprabho |
tacchrutvā vacanantasya dayāvānsutarāmbhavaḥ || (148) ||

pasparśa ca tadā tasmai śraddhāṃ śītāṃśulakṣaṇaḥ |
prāha tvainammahādevaḥ paramānandamacyutam || (159) ||

<p. 499> mayi bhaktiśca vandyaśca pūjyaścaiva surairapi |
viśvambharastvadīya(/) vvai nāma pāpaharamparam || (160) ||

bhaviṣyati na sandeho matprasādātsurottama |
ityuktvāntardadhe rudro bhagavānnīlalohitaḥ || (161) ||

janārddano'pi bhagavānvacanācchaṅkarasya ca |
prāpya cakraṃ śubhandhyānaṃ stotrametannirantaram || (162) ||

papāṭhādhyāpayāmāsa bhaktaistadupapāditam |
anye'pi ye paṭhiṣyanti te vindantu tathā phalam || (163) ||

iti pṛṣṭaṃ samāyātaṃ śṛṇvatāmpāpahārakam |
ataḥ parañca kiṃ śreṣṭhāḥ kathayāmi vacaḥ punaḥ || (164) ||

iti śivasahasranāmastotraṃ sampūrṇam ||

iti śāktapramode śivatantraṃ samāptam ||




śrīḥ 

[śivahararājadhānīpatiśrīrājādevanandanasiṃha(-)
bāhāduranarādhipasaṃgṛhītaviracita(-)

śāktapramodāntargataṃ 

pañcadaśaṃ 


gaṇeśatantram ]


uktarājaguruvaṃśyapaṇḍitaśrīraghurājadubejīdvārā 

saṃśodhitam 

tadetat

śrīkṛṣṇadāsātmaja(-)khemarājena

svakīye 'śrīveṃkaṭeśvara' yantrālaye 

mudrayitvā prakāśitam 

mumba(-)ī



śrīgaṇeśāya namaḥ

atha śāktapramodaḥ

atha gaṇeśatantram

atha gaṇeśadhyānam 


navaratnamayandvīpaṃ smaredikṣurasāmbudhau |
tadvīcidhautaparyantammandamārutasevitam || (1) ||

mandārapārijātādikalpavṛkṣalatākulam |
udbhūtaratnacchāyābhiraruṇīkṛtabhūtalam || (2) ||

udyaddinakarendubhyāmudbhāsitadigantaram |
tasya madhye pārijātannavaratnamayaṃ smaret || (3) ||

ṛtubhiḥ sevitaṃ ṣaḍbhiraniśamprītivarddhanaiḥ |
tasyādhastānmahāpīṭhe racite mātṛkāmbuje || (4) ||

ṣaṭkoṇāntastrikoṇāḍhyammahāgaṇapatiṃ smaret || (5) ||

hastīndrānanaminducūḍamaruṇacchāyantrinetraṃ rasā(-)
śliṣṭampriyayā sapadmakarayā svāṅkasthayā santatam |
bījāpūragadādhanustriśikhiyukcakrābjapāśotpala(-)
ṅkañjābhaiḥ svaviṣāṇaratnakalaśau hastairvahantambhaje || (6) ||

gaṇḍapālīgaladdānapūralālasamānasān |
dvirephānkarṇatālābhyā(/) vvārayantammuhurmuhuḥ || (7) ||

karāgradhṛtamāṇikyakumbhavaktravinissṛtaiḥ |
ratnavarṣaiḥ prīṇayantaṃ sādhakammadavihvalam ||
māṇikyamukuṭopetaṃ ratnābharaṇabhūṣitam || (8) ||

<p. 504> atha yantroddhāraḥ

ṣaṭkoṇañca trikoṇañca tadbahiḥ anyatsarvammātṛkāyantravat ||


atha mantroddhāraḥ

śrīśaktismarabhūvighnabījāni prabhama(/) vvadet |
ṅentaṅgaṇapatimpaścādvarānte varadamparam || 
<p. 505> uktvā sarvajanammente vaśamānaya ṭhadvayam |
aṣṭāviṃśatyakṣaroyantārādyo manurīritaḥ ||

atha mantraḥ

oṃ śrīṃ hrīṃ klīṃ glauṃ gaṃgaṇapataye varavarada sarvajanamme 
vaśamānaya ṭhaḥ ṭhaḥ ||

atha pūjāprayogaḥ 

prātaḥ kṛtyādi pīṭhanyāsānta(/) vvidhāya pūrvoktapīṭhaśaktīrvinyasya || 
tadyathā || keśareṣu madhye ca || tīvrāyai(0) jvālinyai(0) nandāyai(0) bhogadāyai(0) 
kāmarūpiṇyai(0) ugrāyai(0) tejovatyai(0) satyāyai(0) vighnanāśinyai(0) tadupari 
madhye sarvaśaktikamalāsanāya namaḥ || sarvatra praṇavādi namo'ntena 
pūjayet || tata ṛṣyādinyāsamācaret || śirasi gaṇakaṛṣayenamaḥ || mukhe 
nicṛdgāyatrīcchandase namaḥ || hṛdi gaṇapatayedevatāyainamaḥ || tataḥ 
karāṅganyāsau || oṃ śrīṃhrīṃklīṃglauṃgaṃgāṃ 
aṅguṣṭhābhyānnamaḥ || oṃ śrīṃhrīṃklīṃglauṃgaṃgīṃ 
tarjjanībhyāṃsvāhā || (6) || evaṃ gūṃmadhyamābhyā(/) vvaṣaṭ || (6) || gaiṃ 
anāmikābhyāṃ hūm || gauṃ kaniṣṭhābhyāṃvvaṣaṭ || (6) || gaḥ 
karatalakarapṛṣṭhābhyāmphaṭ || evaṃ hṛdayādiṣu || kecittu oṃ 
gāṃhṛdayāyanamaḥ śrīṃgīṃśirasesvāheti tattvaṣaḍbījasthasvabījena 
dīrgghabhājā prakalpayet || iti vacanādviśiṣṭasyaiva grahaṇāt ||

atha ṣoḍaśopacārakrameṇa pūjāvidhiḥ 

atha dhyānam ||

ekadantaṃ śūrpakarṇaṅgajavaktrañcaturbbhujam |
pāśāṅkuśadharandevammodakānvibhrataṅkaraiḥ ||
raktapuṣpamayīmmālāṅkaṇṭhe haste parāṃ śubhām |
bhaktānā(/) vvaradaṃ siddhibuddhibhyāṃ sevitaṃ sadā ||
siddhibuddhipradaṃ nṝṇāndharmārtthakāmamokṣadam |
brahmarudraharīndrādyaissaṃstutamparamarṣibhiḥ || iti dhyānam ||

<p. 506> athāvāhanam

āgaccha jagadādhāra surāsuravarārccita |
anāthanātha sarvajña gīrvāṇaparipūjita || ityāvāhanam ||

athāsanam 

svarṇasiṃhāsanandivyannānāratnasamanvitam |
samarpitammayā deva tatra tvaṃ samupāviśa || ityāsanam ||

atha pādyam 

devadeveśa sarveśa sarvatīrtthāhṛtañjalam |
pādyaṅgṛhāṇa gaṇapate gandhapuṣpākṣatairyutam || iti pādyam |||

athārgghyam 

pravālamuktāphalapūgaratnantāmbūlajāmbūnadamaṣṭagandham |
puṣpākṣatāyuktamamoghaśakte dattammayārgghyaṃ saphalīkuruṣva || 
ityargghyam ||

athācamanīyam

gaṅgādisarvatīrtthebhyaḥ prārthitantoyamuttamam |
karpūrailālavaṅgādivāsitaṃ svīkuru prabho || ityācamanīyam ||

campakāśokabakulamālatīmallikādibhiḥ |
vāsitaṃ snigdhatāhetuntailañcāru pragṛhyatām || iti tailam ||

atha dugdhasnānam

kāmadhenusamudbhūtaṃ sarveṣāñjīvanamparam |
pāvanaṃ yajñahetunte payaḥ snānārtthamarpitam ||| iti dugdhasnānam ||

atha dadhisnānam 

dhenudugdhasamudbhūtaṃ śuddhaṃ sarvagataṃ priyam |
mayānītandadhi varaṃ snānārtthampratigṛhyatām || iti dadhisnānam ||

atha ghṛtasnānam 

navanītasamutpannaṃ sarvasantoṣakāraṇam |
yathāṅgandevatāhāraṅghṛtaṃ snātuṃ samarppitam || iti ghṛtasnānam ||

atha madhusnānam 

raktasāraghasambhūtaṃ sarvatejovivarddhanam |
sarvapuṣṭikarandeva madhu snānārtthamarpitam || iti madhusnānam ||

atha śarkkarāsnānam

ikṣusārasamudbhūtāṃ śarkkarāṃ sumanoharām |
malāpahāriṇīṃ snātuṅgṛhāṇa tvammayārpitām || iti śarkkarāsnānam ||

atha guḍasnānam 

sarvamādhuryatāhetussvādussarvapriyaṅkaraḥ |
puṣṭikṛtsnātumānīta ikṣusārabhavo guḍaḥ || iti guḍasnānam ||

atha madhuparkkaḥ 

<p. 507> kāṃsye kāṃsyena pihito dadhimadhvājyapūritaḥ |
madhuparkko mayānītaḥ pūjārtthampratigṛhyatām || iti madhuparkkaḥ ||

atha śuddhodakasnānam 

sarvatīrtthāhṛtantoyammayā prārtthanayā vibho |
suvāsitaṅgṛhāṇedaṃ samyak snātuṃ sureśvara || iti śuddhodakasnānam ||

atha vastram 

raktavastrayugandeva lokalajjānivāraṇam |
anargghyamatisūkṣmañca gṛhāṇedammayārpitam || iti vastram ||

athopavītam 

rājatambrahmasūtrañca kāñcanaṃ raktasa(/)yyutam |
bhaktyopapāditandeva gṛhāṇa parameśvara || iti yajñopavītam || 

atha bhūṣaṇam 

anekaratnayuktāni bhūṣaṇāni bahūni ca |
tattadaṅge kāñcanāni yojayāmi tavājñayā || iti bhūṣaṇāni ||

atha candanam 

aṣṭagandhasamāyuktaṃ raktacandanamuttamam |
dvādaśāṅgeṣu te deva lepayāmi kṛpāṅkuru || iti candanam ||

athākṣatāḥ 

raktacandanasaṃmiśrāṃstandulāṃstilakopari |
śobhāyai sampradāsyāmi gṛhāṇa parameśvara || ityakṣatāḥ ||

atha puṣpāṇi 

pāṭalaṅkarṇikārañca bandhūkaṃ raktapaṅkajam |
mogarammālatīpuṣpaṅgṛhāṇa sumanoharam || iti puṣpāṇi ||

atha dhūpaḥ 

daśāṅgaṅguggulandhūpaṃ sarvasaugandhyakārakam |
sarvapāpakṣayakarantvaṅgṛhāṇa mayārpitam || iti dhūpaḥ ||

atha dīpaḥ 

sarvajña sarvalokeśa tamonāśanamuttamam |
gṛhāṇa maṅgalandīpandevadeva namo'stu te || iti dīpaḥ ||

atha naivedyāni 

nānāpakvānnasa(/)yyuktampāyasaṃ śarkarānvitam |
nānāvyañjanaśobhāḍhyaṃ śālyodanamanuttamam ||
dadhidugdhaghṛtairyuktaṃ llavaṅgailāsamanvitam |
marīcicūrṇasahitakvathikāvaṭakānvitam ||
rājikādhānyasa(/)yyuktammethīpiṣṭaṃ sa(-)takrakam |
hiṅgu(-)jīraka(-)kūṣmāṇḍa(-)mmarīci(-)māṣa(-)piṣṭakaiḥ ||
sampāditaiḥ supakvaiśca bharjjitairvaṭakairyutam |
modakāpūpa(-)laḍḍūka(-)śaṣkulī(-)maṇḍakādibhiḥ || 
<p. 508> parpaṭairapi sa(/)yyuktannaivedyamamṛtānvitam |
haridrā(-)hiṅgulavaṇasahitaṃ sūpamuttamam ||
sa(-)sāmudraṅgṛhāṇedambhojanaṅkuru sādaram || iti naivedyāni ||

athācamanīyam

sutṛptikārakantoyaṃ sugandhañca pibecchayā |
tvayi tṛpte jagattṛptannityatṛpte mahātmani ||

uttarāpośanārtthante dadmi toyaṃ suvāsitam |
mukhapāṇiviśuddhyartthampunastoyandadāmi te || ityācamanīyam ||

atha phalāni

dāḍimammadhurannimbu(-)jambvāmra(-)panasādikam |
drākṣā(-)rambhāphalampakvaṅkarkandhūḥ khārjuramphalam ||
nārikelañca nāriṅgamañjirañjambirantathā |
urvārukañca deveśa phalānyetāni gṛhyatām || iti phalāni ||

atha sācamanīyaṅkarodvarttanādikam ||

mukhapāṇiviśuddhyartthampunastoyandadāmi te |
gṛhāṇa candanañcāru karāṅgodvarttanaṃ śubham ||
nānāparimaladravyairnirmmitañcūrṇamuttamam |
sugandhināmakampuṇyaṃ gandhi cāru pragṛhyatām || iti karodvarttanam ||

atha sindūram

cāruśālūrasambhūta(/) vvaṃśasārasamudbhavam |
sīmantabhūṣaṇañcūrṇa(/) llākṣārañjitamastu te || iti sindūram ||

atha tāmbūlam

sacandrapūgacūrṇāḍhyaṅkhādyakhādirasa(/)yyutam |
elālavaṅgasaṃmiśrantāmbūlaṅkesarānvitam | iti tāmbūlam ||

atha dravyam

nyūnātiriktāpūjāyāḥ sampūrṇaphalahetave |
dakṣiṇāṅkāñcanīndeva sthāpayāmi tavāgrataḥ || iti dakṣiṇā ||

atha mālā 

sitapītaistathā raktairjjalajaiḥ kusumaiḥ śubhaiḥ |
grathitāṃ sundarāmmālāṅgṛhāṇa parameśvara || iti mālā ||

atha dūrvāḥ 

haritāśśvetavarṇā vā pañcatripatrasa(/)yyutāḥ |
dūrvāṅkurā mayā dattā ekaviṃsatisammitāḥ || iti dūrvāḥ ||

atha pradakṣiṇā

ekaviṃśatisaṅkhyākāḥ kuryāṃ deva pradakṣiṇāḥ |
pade pade te deveśa naśyantu pātakāni me || iti pradakṣiṇā ||

athārārttikam 

audumbare rājate vā kāṃsye kāñcanasambhave |
<p. 509> pātre prakalpitāndīpāngṛhāṇa cakṣurarpakān ||
pañcārārttimpañcadīparddīpitāmparameśvaraḥ |
cāru candranibhaṃ dīpaṅgṛhāṇa vīcivāraṇam ||
yathāsyanekṣyate bhasma tathā pāpa(/) vvināśaya | ityārārttikam ||

iti pūjāvidhiḥ


atha gaṇeśastavarājaḥ

oṃ tatpuruṣāya vidmahe vakratuṇḍāya dhīmahi |
tanno dantiḥ pracodayāt ||

oṃkāramādyampravahanti santo vācaḥ śrutīnāmapi yaṅgṛṇanti |
gajānanandevagaṇānatāṅghrimbhaje'hamarddhendukṛtāvataṃsam ||

pādāravindārccanatatparāṇāṃ saṃsāradāvānalabhaṅgadakṣam |
nirantarannirggatadānatoyaistannaumi vighneśvaramambudābham ||

kṛtāṅgarāgannavakuṅkumena mattālijālammadapaṅkalagnam |
nivārayantannijakarṇatālaiḥ ko vismaretputramanaṅgaśatroḥ |

śambhorjjaṭājūṭanivāsigaṅgājalaṃ samānīya karāmbujena |
līlābhirārācchivamarccayantaṅgajānanambhaktiyutā bhajanti |

kumārabhuktau punarātmahetoḥ payodharau parvatarājaputryāḥ |
prakṣālayantaṅkaraśīkareṇa maugdhyena tannāgamukhambhajāmi ||

tayā samuddhṛtya gajasya hasta(/) yye śīkarāḥ puṣkararandhramuktāḥ |
vyomāṅgaṇe te vicaranti tārāḥ kālātmanā mauktikatulyabhāsaḥ ||

krīḍārate vārinidhau gajasthe velāmatikrāmati vāripūre |
kalpāvasānamparicintya devāḥ kailāsanāthaṃ śrutibhiḥ stuvanti ||

nāgānane nāgakṛtottarīye  krīḍārate devakumārasaṅghaiḥ |
tvayi kṣaṇaṅkālagatiṃ vvihāya tau prāpatuḥ kandukatāminendū || 

madollasatpañcamukhairajasramadhyāpayantaṃ sakalāgamārttham |
devānṛṣīnbhaktajanaikamittraṃ herambamarkkāruṇamāśrayāmi ||

pādāmbujābhyāmati vāmanābhyāṅkṛtārtthayantaṅkṛpayā dharitrīm |
<p. 510> akāraṇaṅkāraṇamāptavācāntannāgavaktranna jahāti cetaḥ ||

yenārpitaṃ satyavatīsutāya purāṇamālikhya viṣāṇakoṭyā |
tañcandramaulestanayantapobhirārādhyamānandaghanambhajāmi ||

padaṃ śrutīnāma padaṃ stutīnā(/) llīlāvatāramparamātmamūrtteḥ |
nāgātmaka(/) vvā puruṣātmaka(/) vvā tvabhedamādyambhaja vighnarājam ||

pāśāṅkuśau bhagnaradantvabhīṣṭaṅkarairddadhānaṅkararandhramuktaiḥ |
muktāphalābhaiḥ pṛthuśīkaraughaiḥ siñcantamaṅgaṃ śivayorbbhajāmi ||

anekamekaṅgajamekadantañcaitanyarūpañjagadādibījam |
brahmeti ya(/) vvedavido vadanti taṃ śaṃbhusūnuṃ satatambhajāmi ||

svāṅkasthitāyā nijavallabhāyā mukhāmbujālokanalolanetram |
smerānanābjammadavaibhavena ruddhambhaje viśvavimohanantam || 

ye pūrvamārādhya gajānanantvāṃ sarvāṇi śāstrāṇi paṭhanti teṣām |
tvatto na cānyatpratipādyametaistadasti cetsarvamasatyakalpam ||

hiraṇyavarṇāñjagadīśitāraṅkavimpurāṇaṃ ravimaṇḍalastham |
gajānana(/) yyampraviśanti santastatkālayogaistamahamprapadye ||

vedāntagītampuruṣambhaje'hamātmānamānandaghanaṃ hṛdistham |
gajānana(/) yyanmahasā janānā(/) vvighnāndhakāro vilayamprayāti ||

śambhossamālokya jaṭākalāpe śaśāṅkakhaṇḍannijapuṣkareṇa |
subhagnadantampravicintya maugdhyādākraṣṭukāmaḥ śriyamātanotu ||

vighnārgalānā(/) vvinipātanārttha(/) yyannārikelaiḥ kadalīphalādyaiḥ |
prasārayantammadavāraṇāsyamprabhuṃ sadābhīṣṭamahambhaje yam ||

yajñairanekairbahubhistapobhirārādhyamādyaṅgajarājavaktram |
stutyā'nayā ye vidhivatstuvanti te sarvalakṣmīnilayā bhavanti ||

iti gaṇeśastavarājaḥ samāptaḥ ||


atha kavacam 

īśvara uvāca

śṛṇu vakṣyāmi kavacaṃ sarvasiddhikarampriye |
<p. 511> paṭhitvā pāṭhayitvā ca mucyate sarvasaṅkaṭāt ||

ajñātvā kavacandevi gaṇeśasya manuñjapet |
siddhirnna jāyate tasya kalpakoṭiśatairai ||
oṃ āmodaśca śiraḥ pātu pramodaśca śokhopari |
sammodo bhrūyuge pātu bhrūmadhye ca gaṇādhipaḥ ||

gaṇakrīḍaścakṣuryugannāsāyāṅgaṇanāyakaḥ |
gaṇakrīḍācitaḥ pātu vadane sarvasiddhaye ||

jihvāyāṃ sumukhaḥ pātu grīvāyāndurmukhaḥ sadā |
vighneśo hṛdaye pātu vighnanāśaśca vakṣasi |

gaṇānānnāyakaḥ pātu bāhuyugme sadā mama |
vighnakarttā ca udare vighnaharttā ca liṅgake ||
gajavaktraḥ kaṭīdeśe ekadanto nitambake |
lambodaraḥ sadā pātu guhyadeśe mamāruṇaḥ ||

vyālayajñopavītī māmpātu pādayuge sadā |
jāpakaḥ sarvadā pātu jānujaṅghe gaṇādhipaḥ ||

hāridraḥ sarvadā pātu sarvāṅge gaṇanāyakaḥ |
ya idamprapaṭhennityaṅgaṇeśasya maheśvari ||

kavacaṃ sarvasiddhākhyaṃ sarvavighnavināśanam |
sarvasiddhikaraṃ sākṣāt sarvapāpavimocanam ||

sarvasampatpradaṃ sākṣātsarvaśatrukṣayaṅkaram |
grahapīḍā jvarā rogā ye cānye guhyakādayaḥ ||

paṭhanāddhāraṇādeva nāśamāyānti tatkṣaṇāt |
dhanadhānyakarandevi kavacaṃ surapūjitam ||

samo nāsti maheśāni trailokye kavacasya ca |
hāridrasya maheśāni kavacasya ca bhūtale ||

kimanyairasadālāpairyatrāyurvyayatāmiyāt |
iti viśvasāratantre gaṇeśakavacaṃ samāptam || 


athopaniṣat 

oṃ laṃsvāhā nāvavatu svāhā nau bhunaktu svāhā vīryaṃ karavāvahai |
tejasvināvadhītamastu mā vidviṣāvahai |
oṃ śāntiḥ śāntiḥ śāntiḥ ||

oṃ laṃnamaste gaṇapataye | tvameva pratyakṣaṃ tattvamasi ||

tvameva kevalaṃ karttāsi | tvameva kevalandharttāsi ||

tvameva kevalaṃ harttāsi | 

<p. 512> tvameva sarvaṃ khalvidambrahmāsi |

tvaṃ sākṣādātmāsi nityaṃ ||

ṛtaṃ vacmi || satyaṃ vacmi || ava tvaṃ mām || ava vaktāram || ava śrotāram || 
ava dātāram || ava dhātāram || avānūcānamava śiṣyam || ava paścāttāt || 
ava purastāt || 
avottarāttāt | ava dakṣiṇāttāt || ava corddhvāttāt || avādharāttāt ||
sarvato māmpāhi pāhi samantāt || tvaṃ vāṅmayastvañcinmayaḥ ||
tvamānandamayastvaṃ brahmamayastvaṃ saccidānandādvitīyosi ||
tvampratyakṣambrahmāsi || tvaṃ jñānamayo vijñānamayo'si ||
sarvaṃ jagadidantvatto jāyate || sarvaṃ jagadidaṃ tvattastiṣṭhati || sarvaṃ 
jagadidantvayi layameṣyati || tvambhūmirāpo'nalo'nilo nabhaḥ || tvaṃ 
catvāri vākpadāni || tvaṅguṇatrayātītaḥ ||
tvandehatrayātītaḥ || tvaṅkālatrayātītaḥ || tvaṃ mūlādhārasthito'si nityam 
||
tvaṃ śaktitrayātmakaḥ || tvāṃ yogino dhyāyanti nityam || tvaṃ brahmā 
tvaṃ viṣṇustvaṃ rudrastvamindrastvamagnistvaṃ vāyustvaṃ sūryastvaṃ 
candramāstvaṃ brahma bhūbhuvaḥsvarom ||

gaṇādīn pūrvamuccārya varṇādīṃstadanantaram ||

anusvāraḥ parataraḥ || arddhendulasitantāreṇa ruddham ||

etattava manusvarūpam || gakāraḥ pūrvarūpam ||

akāro madhyamarūpam || anusvāraścāntyarūpam ||

binduruttararūpam || nādaḥ sandhānam || saṃhitā sandhiḥ || 

saiṣā gaṇeśavidyā || gaṇaṛṣirnicṛdgāyatrī cchandaḥ ||

gaṇapatirdevatā || oṃ gaṃgaṇapatayenamaḥ ||

ekadantāya vidmahe vakratuṇḍāya dhīmahi || tanno dantiḥ pracodayāt ||

ekadantañcaturhastampāśamaṅkuśadhāriṇam ||

radaṃ ca varadaṃ hastairbibhrāṇammūṣakadhvajam ||
raktalambodaraṃ śūrpakarṇakaṃ raktavāsasam ||

raktagandhānuliptāṅgaṃ raktapuṣpaissupūjitam |
bhaktānukampinandevañjagatkāraṇamacyutam ||

āvirbhūtañca sṛṣṭyādau prakṛteḥ puruṣātparam |
<p. 513> evandhyāyati yo nityaṃ sa yogī yoginā(/) vvaraḥ ||

oṃ namo vrātapataye namo gaṇapataye namaḥ prathamapataye namaste'stu 
lambodarāyaikadantāya vighnanāśine śivasutāya varadamūrttaye namaḥ ||

etadatharvaśīrṣaṃ yo'dhīte || sa brahmabhūyāya kalpate || sa sarvavighnairna 
bādhyate || sa sarvataḥ sukhameghate ||  sa pañcamahāpāpātpramucyate ||

sāyamadhīyāno divasakṛtaṃ pāpannāśayati || prātaradhīyāno rātrikṛtaṃ 
pāpaṃ nāśayati || sāyamprātaḥ prayuñjāno apāpo bhavati || 
sarvatrādhīyāno'pavighno bhavati || dharmamarthaṃ kāmaṃ mokṣañca 
vindati || idamatharvaśīrṣamaśiṣyāya na deyam || yo yadi mohāddāsyati  || sa 
pāpīyān bhavati || sahasrāvarttanādyaṃ yaṃ kāmamadhīte || tantamanena 
sādhayet || anena gaṇapatimabhiṣiñcati | sa vāgmī bhavati || 
caturthyāmanaśnañjapati sa vidyāvān bhavati || ityatharvaṇavākyam || 
brahmādyācaraṇaṃ vidyānna bibheti kadācaneti || yo dūrvāṅkurairyajati || 
sa  vaiśravaṇopamo bhavati || yo lājairyajati || sa yaśovān bhavati || sa 
medhāvān bhavati || yo modakasahasreṇa yajati || sa vāñchitaphalamavāpnoti 
|| yaḥ sājyasamidbhiryajati || sa sarvaṃ labhate sa sarvaṃ labhate || aṣṭau 
brāhmaṇān samyaggrāhayitvā sūryavarcasvī bhavati || sūryagrahe 
mahānadyāṃ pratimāsannidhau vā japtvā siddhamantro bhavati || 
mahāvighnātpramucyate || mahādoṣātpramucyate || 
mahāpratyavāyātpramucyate || sa sarvavidbhavati sa sarvavidbhavati || ya evaṃ 
veda || ityupaniṣat || saha nāvavatu || saha nau bhunaktu || saha vīryaṃ 
karavāvahai || tejasvināvadhītamastu mā vidviṣāvahai || oṃ śāntiḥ śāntiḥ 
śāntiḥ || iti gaṇapatyupaniṣat ||


atha śatanāma

oṃ gaṇeśvaro gaṇakrīḍo mahāgaṇapatistathā ||
viśvakarttā viśvamukho durjjayo dhūrjjayo jayaḥ || (1) ||

<p. 514> surūpaḥ sarvanetrādhivāso vīrāsanāśrayaḥ |
yogādhipastārakasthaḥ puruṣo gajakarṇakaḥ || (2) ||

citrāṅkaḥ śyāmadaśano bhālacandraścaturbbhujaḥ |
śambhutejā yajñakāyaḥ sarvātmā sāmabṛṃhitaḥ || (3) ||

kulācalāṃso vyomanābhiḥ kalpadrumavanālayaḥ |
nimnanābhiḥ sthūlakukṣiḥ pīnavakṣā bṛhadbhajaḥ || (4) ||

pīnaskandhaḥ kambukaṇṭho lamboṣṭho lambanāsikaḥ |
sarvāvayavasampūrṇaḥ sarvalakṣaṇalakṣitaḥ || (5) ||

ikṣucāpadharaḥ śūlī kāntikandalitāśrayaḥ |
akṣamālādharo jñānamudrāvān vijayāvahaḥ || (6) ||

kāminīkāmanaḥ kāmamālinīkelilālitaḥ |
amoghasiddhirādhāra ādhārādheyavarjitaḥ || (7) ||

indīvaradalaśyāma indumaṇḍalanirmalaḥ |
karmasākṣī karmakarttā karmākarmaphalapradaḥ || (8) ||

kamaṇḍaludharaḥ kalpaḥ kaparddī kaṭisūtrabhṛt |
kāruṇyadehaḥ kapilo guhyāgamanirūpitaḥ || (9) ||

guhāśayo guhābdhistho ghaṭakumbho ghaṭodaraḥ |
pūrṇānandaḥ parānando dhanado dharaṇīdharaḥ || (10) ||

bṛhattamo brahmapuro brahmaṇyo brahmavitpriyaḥ |
bhavyo bhūtālayo bhogadātā caiva mahāmanāḥ || (11) ||

vareṇyo vāmadevaśca vandyo vajranivāraṇaḥ |
viśvakarttā viśvacakṣurhavanaṃ havyakavyabhuk || (12) ||

svatantrassatyasaṅkalpastathā saubhāgyavarddhanaḥ |
kīrttidaḥ śokahārī ca trivargaphaladāyakaḥ || (13) ||

caturbāhuścaturddantaścaturthītithisambhavaḥ |
sahasraśīrṣā puruṣaḥ sahasrākṣassahasrapāt || (14) ||

kāmarūpaḥ kāmagatirddvirado dvīparakṣakaḥ |
kṣetrādhipaḥ kṣamābharttā layastho laḍḍukapriyaḥ || (15) ||

prativādimukhastambho duṣṭacittaprasādanaḥ |
bhagavān bhaktisulabho yājñiko yājakapriyaḥ || (16) ||

ityevandevadevasya gaṇarājasya dhīmataḥ |
śatamaṣṭottarannāmnāṃ sārabhūtamprakīrttitam || (17) ||

sahasranāmnāmākṛṣya mayā proktammanoharam |
<p. 515> brāhme muhūrtte cotthāya smṛtvā devaṅgaṇeśvaram || 
paṭhetstotramidambhaktyā gaṇarājaḥ prasīdati || (18) ||

iti śrīgaṇeśasyāṣṭottaraśatanāmastotraṃ samāptam ||


atha sahasranāma

vyāsa uvāca

kathannāmnāṃ sahasraṃ svaṅgaṇeśa upadiṣṭavān |
śivāya tanmamācakṣva lokānugrahatatpara || (1) ||

brahmovāca

devadevampurārātiḥ puratrayajayodyame |
anarccanādgaṇeśasya jāto vighnākulaḥ kila || (2) ||

manasā sa vinirddhārya tatastadvighnakāraṇam |
mahāgaṇapatimbhaktyā samabhyarccya yathāvidhi || (3) ||

vighnapraśamanopāyamapṛcchadaparājitaḥ |
santuṣṭaḥ pūjayā śambhormmahāgaṇapatiḥ svayam || (4) ||

sarvavighnaikaharaṇaṃ sarvakāmaphalapradam |
tatastasmai svakannāmnāṃ sahasramidamabravīt || (5) ||

asya śrīmahāgaṇapatisahasranāmamālāmantrasya gaṇeśa ṛṣiḥ 
mahāgaṇapatirddevatā nānāvidhāni chandāṃsi gamiti bīnantuṇḍamiti 
śaktiḥ svāheti kīlakam sakalavighnanāśanadvārā mahāgaṇapatiprītyartthe 
jape viniyogaḥ ||

mahāgaṇapatiruvāca

oṃ gaṇeśvaro gaṇakrīḍo gaṇanātho gaṇādhipaḥ |
ekadaṃṣṭro vakratuṇḍo gajavaktro mahodaraḥ || (6) ||

lambodaro dhūmravarṇo vikaṭo vighnanāyakaḥ |
sumukho durmukho buddho vighnarājo gajānanaḥ || (7) ||

bhīmaḥ pramoda āmodaḥ surānando madotkaṭaḥ |
herambaḥ śambaraḥ śambhurllambakarṇo mahābalaḥ || (8) ||

nandano lampaṭo bhīrurmeghanādo gaṇañjayaḥ |
vināyako virūpākṣo dhīraḥ śūro varapradaḥ || (9) ||

mahāgaṇapatirbuddhipriyaḥ kṣipraprasādanaḥ |
rudrapriyo gaṇādhyakṣa umāputro'ghanāśanaḥ || (10) ||

kumāragururīśānaputro mūṣakavāhanaḥ |
siddhipriyaḥ siddhipatiḥ siddhaḥ siddhivināyakaḥ || (11) ||

avighnastumbaruḥ siṃhavāhano mohinīpriyaḥ |
<p. 516> kaṭaṅkaṭo rājaputraḥ śālakaḥ sammito'mitaḥ || (12) ||

kūṣmāṇḍasāmasambhūtirddurjjayo dhūrjayo jayaḥ |
bhūpatirbbhuvanapatirbbhūtānāmpatiravyayaḥ || (13) ||

viśvakarttā viśvamukho viśvarūpo nidhirgghṛṇiḥ |
kaviḥ kavīnāmṛṣabho brahmaṇyo brahmaṇaspatiḥ || (14) ||

jyeṣṭharājo nidhipatirnidhipriyapatipriyaḥ |
hiraṇmayapurāntasthassūryamaṇḍalamadhyagaḥ || (15) ||

karāhatidhvastasindhusalilaḥ pūṣadantabhit |
umāṅkakelikutukī muktidaḥ kulapālanaḥ || (16) ||

kirīṭī kuṇḍalī hārī vanamālī manomayaḥ |
vaimukhyahatadaityaśrīḥ pādāhatajitakṣitiḥ || (17) ||

sadyojātaḥ svarṇamuñjamekhalī durnnimittahṛt |
dussvapnahṛtprasahano guṇinādapratiṣṭhitaḥ || (18) ||

surūpaḥ sarvanetrādhivāso vīrāsanāśrayaḥ |
pītāmbaraḥ khaṇḍaradaḥ khaṇḍendukṛtaśekharaḥ || (19) ||

citrāṅkaḥ śyāmadaśano bhālacandraścaturbbhujaḥ |
yogādhipastārakasthaḥ puruṣo gajakarṇakaḥ || (20) ||

gaṇādhirājo vijayaḥ sthiro gajapatirddhvajī |
devadevaḥ smaraprāṇo dīpako vāyukīlakaḥ || (21) ||

vipaścidvarado nādo nādabhinnabalāhakaḥ |
varāharadano mṛtyuñjayo vyāghrājināmbaraḥ || (22) ||

icchāśaktidharo devatrātā daityavimarddanaḥ |
śambhuvaktrodbhavaḥ śambhukopahā śambhuhāsyabhūḥ || (23) ||

śambhutejāḥ śivāśokahārī gaurīsukhāvahaḥ |
umāṅgamalajo gaurītejobhūḥ svarddhunībhavaḥ || (24) ||

yajñakāyo mahānādo girivarṣmā śubhānanaḥ |
sarvātmā sarvadevātmā brahmamūrddhā kakupśrutiḥ || (25) ||

brahmāṇḍakumbhaścidvyomabhālaḥ satyaśiroruhaḥ |
jagajjanmalayonmeṣanimiṣonyarkkasomadṛk || (26) ||

girindraikarado dharmo dharmiṣṭhaḥ sāmabṛṃhitaḥ |
graharkṣkṣadaśano vāṇījihvo vāsavanāsikaḥ || (27) ||

bhrūmadhye saṃsthitakaro brahmavidyā madotkaṭaḥ |
kulācalāṃsaḥ somārkaghaṇṭo rudraśirodharaḥ || (28) ||

<p. 517> nadīnadabhujaḥ sarpāṅgulīkastārakānakhaḥ |
vyomanābhiḥ śrīhṛdayo merupṛṣṭho'rṇavodaraḥ || (29) ||

kukṣisthayakṣagandharvarakṣaḥkinnaramānuṣaḥ |
pṛthvīkaṭiḥ sṛṣṭiliṅgaḥ śailorurddasrajānukaḥ || (30) ||

pātālajaṃgho munipātkālāṅguṣṭhastrayītanuḥ |
jyotirmaṇḍalalāṃgūlo hṛdayālātaniścalaḥ || (31) ||

hṛtpadmakarṇikāśālī viyatkelisarovaraḥ |
sadbhaktadhyānanigaḍaḥ pūjāvārinivāritaḥ || (32) ||

pratāpī kaśyapasuto gaṇapo viṣṭapī balī |
yaśasvī dhārmikaḥ svojāḥ prathamaḥ pramatheśvaraḥ || (33) ||

cintāmaṇirdvīpapatiḥ kalpadrumavanālayaḥ |
ratnamaṇḍapamadhyastho ratnasiṃhāsanāśrayaḥ || (34) ||

tīvrāśirodhṛtapado jvālinīmaulilālitaḥ |
nandānanditapīṭhaśrībhogadābhūṣitāsanaḥ || (35) ||

sakāmadāyinīpīṭhaḥ sphuraduggrāsanāśrayaḥ |
tejovatīśiroratnaṃ satyānityāvataṃsitaḥ || (36) ||

savighnanāśinīpīṭhaḥ sarvaśaktyambujāśrayaḥ |
lipipadmāsanādhāro vahnidhāmatrayāśrayaḥ || (37) ||

unnataprapadāgūḍhagulphasa(/)vvṛtapārṣṇikaḥ |
pīnajaṅghaḥ śliṣṭajānuḥ sthūloruḥ pronnamatkaṭiḥ || (38) ||

nimnanābhiḥ sthūlakukṣiḥ pīnavakṣā bṛhadbhujaḥ |
pīnaskandhaḥ kambukaṇṭho lamboṣṭho lambanāsikaḥ || (39) ||

bhagnacāmaradastuṅgasavyadanto mahāhanuḥ |
hrasvanetratrayaḥ śūrpakarṇo nibiḍamastakaḥ || (40) ||

stambakākārakumbhāgro ratnamaulirnniraṃkuśaḥ |
sarpahārakaṭīsūtraḥ sarpayajñopavītavān || (41) ||

sarpakoṭīrakaṭakaḥ sarpagraiveyakāṅgadaḥ |
sarpakakṣyodarābandhaḥ sarparājottarīyakaḥ || (42) ||

rakto raktāmbaradharo raktamālyavibhūṣaṇaḥ |
raktekṣaṇo raktakaro raktatālvoṣṭhapallavaḥ || (43) ||

śvetaḥ śvetāmbaradharaḥ śvetamālyavibhūṣaṇaḥ |
śvetātapatraruciraḥ śvetacāmaravījitaḥ || (44) ||

sarvāvayavasampūrṇaḥ sarvalakṣaṇalakṣitaḥ |
sarvābharaṇaśobhāḍhyaḥ sarvaśobhāsamanvitaḥ || (45) ||

<p. 518> sarvamaṅgalamāṅgalyassarvakāraṇakāraṇam |
sarvadaikakaraḥ śārṅgī bījapūrī gadādharaḥ || (46) ||

ikṣucāpadharaśśūlī cakrapāṇissarojabhṛt |
pāśī dhṛtotpalaśśālīmañjarībhṛtsvadantabhṛt || (47) ||

kalpavallidharo viśvabhayadaikakaro vaśī |
akṣamālādharo jñānamudrāvānmudgarāyudhaḥ || (48) ||

pūrṇapātrī kambudharo vidhṛtālisamūhakaḥ |
mātuliṅgadharaścūtakalikābhṛtkuṭhāravān || (49) ||

puṣkarasthasvarṇaghaṭī(-)pūrṇaratnābhivarṣakaḥ |
bhāratīsundarīnātho vināyakaratipriyaḥ || (50) ||

mahālakṣmīpriyatamassiddhalakṣmīmanoramaḥ |
ramārameśapūrvāṅgo dakṣiṇomāmaheśvaraḥ || (51) ||

mahīvarāhavāmāṅgo ratikandarpapaścimaḥ |
āmodamodajananaḥ sapramodapramodanaḥ || (52) ||

sāmedhitāsamṛddhiśrīrṛddhisiddhipravarttakaḥ |
dattasaumukhyasumukhaḥ kāntikandalitāśrayaḥ || (53) ||

madanāvatyaśritāṅghriḥ kṛtadaurmukhyadurmukhaḥ |
vighnasampallavopaghnassevonnidramaddravaḥ || (54) ||

vighnakṛnnighnacaraṇo drāviṇīśaktisatkṛtaḥ |
tīvrāprasannanayano jvālinīpālitaikadṛk || (55) ||

mohinīmohano bhogadāyinīkāntimaṇḍitaḥ |
kāminīkāntavaktraśrī(-)radhiṣṭhitavasundharaḥ || (56) ||

vasundharāmadonnaddhamahāśaṅkhanidhiḥ prabhuḥ |
namadvasumatī maulī mahāpadmanidhiprabhuḥ || (57) ||

sarvasadgurusaṃsevyaḥ śociṣkeśahṛdāśrayaḥ |
īśānamūrddhā devendraśikhaḥ pavananandanaḥ || (58) ||

agrapratyagranayano divyāstrāṇāmprayogavit |
airāvatādisarvāśāvāraṇāvaraṇapriyaḥ || (59) ||

vajrādyastraparīvāro gaṇacaṇḍasamāśrayaḥ |
jayājayaparīvāro vijayāvijayāvahaḥ || (60) ||

ajitājitapādābjo nityānityāvataṃsitaḥ |
vilāsinīkṛtollāsaḥ śauṇḍisaundaryamaṇḍitaḥ || (61) ||

anantānantasukhadaḥ sumaṅgalasumaṅgalaḥ |
icchāśakti(-)jñānaśakti(-)kriyāśakti(-)niṣevitaḥ || (62) ||

<p. 519> subhagāsaṃśritapado lālitālalitāśrayaḥ |
kāminīkāmanaḥ kāmamālinīkelilālitaḥ || (63) ||

sarasvatyāśrayo gaurīnandanaḥ śrīniketanaḥ |
guruguptapado vācāsiddho vāgīśvarīpatiḥ || (64) ||

nalinīkāmuko vāmārāmo jyeṣṭhāmanoramaḥ |
raudrīmudritapādābjo hū(/)bījastuṅgaśaktikaḥ || (65) ||

viśvādijananatrāṇaḥ svāhāśaktiḥ sakīlakaḥ |
amṛtābdhikṛtāvāso madaghūrṇitalocanaḥ || (66) ||

ucchiṣṭagaṇa ucchiṣṭagaṇeśo gaṇanāyakaḥ |
sārvakālikasaṃsiddhirnityaśaivo digambaraḥ || (67) ||

anapāyonantardṛṣṭiraprameyo'jarāmaraḥ |
anāvilo pratiratho hyacyuto'mṛtamakṣaram || (68) ||

apratarkyo'kṣayo'jayyo'nādhāro'nāmayo'malaḥ |
amoghasiddhiradvaitamaghoro'pramitānanaḥ || (69) ||

anākāro 'dhibhūmyagnibalaghno'vyaktalakṣaṇaḥ |
ādhārapīṭha ādhāra ādhārādheyavarjjitaḥ || (70) ||

ākhuketana āśāpūraka ākhumahārathaḥ |
ikṣusāgaramadhyastha ikṣubhakṣaṇalālasaḥ || (71) ||

ikṣucāpātirekaśrī(-)rikṣucāpaniṣevitaḥ || (72) ||

indragopasamānaśrī(-)rindranīlasamadyutiḥ |
indīvaradalaśyāma indumaṇḍalanirmmalaḥ || (73) ||

idhmapriya iḍābhāga iḍādhāmendirāpriyaḥ |
ikṣvākuvighnavidhvaṃśī itikarttavyatepsitaḥ || (74) ||

īśānamaulirīśāna īśānasuta ītihā |
īṣaṇātrayakalpānta īhāmātravivarjjitaḥ || (75) ||

upendra uḍubhṛnmauliruṇḍerakabalipriyaḥ |
unnatānana uttuṅga udāratridaśāgraṇīḥ || (76) ||

ūrjjasvānūṣmalamada ūhāpohadurāsadaḥ |
ṛgyayuḥsāmasaṃbhūtirṛddhisiddhipravarttakaḥ || (77) ||

ṛjucittaikasulabha ṛṇatrayavimocakaḥ |
luptavighnaḥ svabhaktānāṃ luptaśaktiḥ suradviṣām || (78) ||

luptaśrīrvimukhārccānā(/) llūtāvisphoṭanāśanaḥ |
ekārapīṭhamadhyastha ekapādakṛtāsanaḥ || (79) ||

eśitākhiladaityaśrīrejitākhilasaṃśrayaḥ |
<p. 520> aiśvaryanidhiraiśvaryamaihikāmuṣmikapradaḥ || (80) ||

airammadasamonmeṣa airāvatanibhānanaḥ |
oṅkāravācya oṅkāra ojasvānoṣadhīpatiḥ || (81) ||

audāryanidhirauddhatyadhurya aunnatyaniḥsvanaḥ |
aṅkuśassuranāgānāmaṅkuśaḥ suravidviṣām || (82) ||

asamastavisargāṇāmpadeṣu parikīrttitaḥ |
kamaṇḍaludharaḥ kalpaḥ kapardī kalabhānanaḥ || (83) ||

karmasākṣī karmakarttā karmākarmaphalapradaḥ |
kadambagolakākāraḥ kuṣmāṇḍagaṇanāyakaḥ || (84) ||

kāruṇyadevaḥ kapilaḥ kathakaḥ kaṭisūtrabhṛt |
kharvaḥ khaḍgapriyaḥ khaḍgakhātāntasthaḥ khanirmmalaḥ || (85) ||

khalvāṭaśṛṅganilayaḥ khaṭvāṅgī khadurāsadaḥ |
guṇāḍhyo gahano gastho gadyapadyasudhārṇavaḥ || (86) ||

gadyagānapriyo garjjo gītagīrvāṇapūrvajaḥ |
guhyācārarato guhyo guhyāgamanirūpitaḥ || (87) ||

guhyāśayo guhābdhistho gurugamyo gurorgguruḥ |
ghaṇṭāgharggharikāmālī ghaṭakumbho ghaṭodaraḥ || (88) ||

caṇḍaścaṇḍeśvarasuhṛccaṇḍeśaścaṇḍavikramaḥ || (89) ||

carācarapatiścintāmaṇiścarvaṇalālasaḥ |
chandaśchandovapuśchando durllakṣyachandavigrahaḥ || (90) ||

jagadyonirjjagatsākṣī jagadīśo jaganmayaḥ |
japo japaparo japyo jihvāsiṃhāsanaprabhuḥ || (91) ||

jhalajhjhallollasaddānajhaṅkāribhramarākulaḥ |
ṭaṅkārasphārasaṃrāva(-)ṣṭaṅkārimaṇinūpuraḥ || (92) ||

ṭhadvayīpallavāntasthaḥ sarvamantraikasiddhidaḥ |
ḍiṇḍimuṇḍo ḍākinīśo ḍāmaro ḍiṇḍimapriyaḥ || (93) ||

ḍhakkāninādamudito ḍhauṅko ḍhuṇḍhivināyakaḥ || (94) ||

tattvānāmpramantattvantattvampadanirūpitaḥ |
tārakāntarasaṃsthānastārakastārakāntakaḥ || (95) ||

sthāṇuḥ sthāṇupriyaḥ sthātā sthāvarañjaṅgamañjagat |
dakṣayajñapramathano dātā dānavamohanaḥ || (96) ||

dayāvāndivyavibhavo daṇḍabhṛddaṇḍanāyakaḥ |
dantaprabhinnābhramālo daityavāraṇadāraṇaḥ || (97) ||

daṃṣṭrālagnadvipaghaṭo devārtthanṛgajākṛtiḥ |
<p. 521> dhanadhānyapatirddhanyo dhanado dharaṇīdharaḥ || (98) ||

dhyānaikaprakaṭo dhyeyo dhyānandhyānaparāyaṇaḥ || (99) ||

nandyo nandipriyo nādo nādamadhyapratiṣṭhitaḥ |
niṣkalo nirmmalo nityo nityānityo nirāmayaḥ || (100) ||

para(/) vyoma parandhāma paramātmā parampadam |
parātparaḥ paśupatiḥ paśupāśavimocakaḥ || (101) ||

pūrṇānandaḥ parānandaḥ purāṇapuruṣottamaḥ |
padmaprasannanayanaḥ praṇatājñānamocanaḥ || (102) ||

praṇāmapratyayātītaḥ praṇatārttinivāraṇaḥ |
phalahastaḥ phaṇipatiḥ phetkāraḥ phāṇitapriyaḥ || (103) ||

bāṇārccitāṅghriyugalo bālakelikutūhalī |
brahmabrahmārccitapado brahmacārī bṛhaspatiḥ || (104) ||

bṛhattamo brahmaparo brahmaṇyo brahmavitpriyaḥ |
bṛhannādāgrayacitkāro brahmāṇḍavalimekhalaḥ || (105) ||

bhrūkṣepadattalakṣmīko bharggo bhadro bhayāpahaḥ |
bhagavān bhaktisulabho bhūtido bhūtibhūṣaṇaḥ || (106) ||

bhavyo bhūtālayo bhogadātā bhrūmadhyagocaraḥ |
mantrī mantrapatirmantrī madamattamanoramaḥ || (107) ||

mekhalāvānmandagatirmatimatkamalekṣaṇaḥ |
mahābalo mahāvīryo mahāprāṇo mahāmanāḥ || (108) ||

yajño yajñapatiryajñagoptā yajñaphalapradaḥ |
yaśaskaro yogagamyo yājñiko yājakapriyaḥ || (109) ||

raso rasapriyo rasyo rañjako rāvaṇārccitaḥ |
rakṣorakṣākaro ratnagarbbho rājyasukhapradaḥ || (110) ||

lakṣyālakṣaprado lakṣyo layastho laḍḍukapriyaḥ |
lānapriyo lāsyaparo lābhakṛllokaviśrutaḥ || (111) ||

vareṇyo vahnivadano vandyo vedāntagocaraḥ |
vikarttā viśvataścakṣurvidhātā viśvatomukhaḥ || (112) ||

vāmadevo viśvanetā vajrī vajranivāraṇaḥ |
viśvabandhanaviṣkambhādhāro viśveśvaraḥ prabhuḥ || (113) ||

śabdabrahma śamaprāpyaḥ śambhuśaktigaṇeśvaraḥ |
śāstā śikhāgranilayaḥ  śaraṇyaḥ śikharīśvaraḥ || (114) ||

<p. 522> ṣaḍṛtukusumasragva ṣaḍādhāraḥ ṣaḍakṣaraḥ |
saṃsāravaidyaḥ sarvajñassarvameṣajameṣajam || (115) ||

sṛṣṭisthitilayakrīḍaḥ surakuñjarabhedanaḥ |
sindūritamahākumbhassadasadvyaktidāyakaḥ || (116) ||

sākṣīsamudramathanaḥ svasa(/)vvedyaḥ svadakṣiṇaḥ |
svatantraḥ satyasaṅkalpassāmagānaratassukhī || (117) ||

haṃso hasti piśācīśo havanaṃ havyakavyabhuk |
havyaṃ hutapriyo harṣo hṛllekhāmantramadhyagaḥ || (118) ||

kṣetrādhipaḥ kṣamābharttā kṣamāparaparāyaṇaḥ |
kṣiprakṣemakaraḥ kṣemānandaḥ kṣoṇīsuradrumaḥ || (119) ||

dharmapradortthadaḥ kāmadātā saubhāgyavarddhanaḥ |
vidyāprado vibhavado bhuktimuktipradāyakaḥ || (120) ||

ābhirūpyakaro vīraḥ śrīpado vijayapradaḥ |
sarvavaśyakaro garbbhadoṣahā putrapautradaḥ || (121) ||

medhādaḥ kīrttidaḥ śokahārī daurbbhāgyanāśanaḥ |
śrīśokahārī daurbbhāgyanāśanassarvaśaktibhṛt || (122) ||

prativādimukhastambho hṛṣṭacittaprasādanaḥ |
parābhicāraśamano duḥkhabhañjanakārakaḥ || (123) ||

lavastruṭiḥ kalākāṣṭhānimeṣastatparaḥ kṣaṇaḥ |
ghaṭīmuhūrttaḥ praharo divānaktamaharniśam || (124) ||

pakṣo māso'yana(/) vvarṣaṃ yyugaṅkalpo mahālayaḥ |
rāśistārā tithiryogo vāraḥ karaṇamaṃśakam || (125) ||

lagnaṃ horā kālacakrammerussaptarṣayo dhruvaḥ |
rāhurmmandaḥ kavirjjīvo budho bhaumaśśaśī raviḥ || (126) ||

kālassṛṣṭiḥ sthitirviśvaṃ sthāvarañjaṅgamañca yat |
bhūrāpognirmarudvyomāhaṅkṛtiḥ prakṛtiḥ pumān || (127) ||

brahmā viṣṇuśśivo rudra īśaśśaktissadāśivaḥ |
tridaśāḥ pitaraḥ siddhā yakṣarakṣāṃsi kinnarāḥ || (128) ||

sādhyā vidyādharā bhūtā manuṣyāḥ paśavaḥ khagāḥ |
samudrāssaritaśśailā bhūtabhavyambhavodbhavaḥ || (129) ||

sāṅkhyampātañjala(/) yyogaḥ purāṇāni śrutiḥ smṛtiḥ |
vedāṅgāni sadācāro mīmāṃsā nyāyavistaraḥ || (130) ||

<p. 523> āyurvedo dhanurvedo gāndharvaṅkāvyanāṭakam |
vaikhānasaṃ bhāgavataṃ sāttvatampāñcarātrakam || (131) ||

śaivampāśupataṅkālamukhambhairavaśāsanam |
śākta(/) vvaināyakaṃ saurañjainamārhatasaṃhitā || (132) ||

sadadadvyaktamavyaktaṃ sacetanamacetanam |
bandho mokṣaḥ sukhambhogo'yogassatyamaṇurmahān || (133) ||

svasti humphaṭ svadhā svāhā śrauṣaṭ vauṣaṭ vaṣaṇnamaḥ |
jñānavijñānamānando bodhassa(/)vvicchamo yamaḥ || (134) ||

eka ekākṣarādhāra ekākṣaraparāyaṇaḥ |
ekāgradhīrekavīra ekānekasvarūpadhṛk || (135) ||

dvirūpo dvibhujo dvyakṣo dvirado dvīparakṣakaḥ |
dvaimāturo dvivadano dvandvātīto dvayātigaḥ || (136) ||

tridhāmā trikarastretā trivargaphaladāyakaḥ |
triguṇātmā trilokādistriśaktīśastrilocanaḥ || (137) ||

caturbāhuścaturddantaścaturātmā caturmukhaḥ |
caturvidhopāyamayaścaturvarṇāśramāśrayaḥ || (138) ||

caturvidhavacovṛttiparivarttapravarttakaḥ |
caturtthīpūjanaprītaścaturtthītithisambhavaḥ || (139) ||

pañcākṣarātmā pañcātmā pañcāsyaḥ pañcakṛtyakṛt |
pañcādhāraḥ pañcavarṇaḥ pañcākṣaraparāyaṇaḥ || (140) ||

pañcatālaḥ pañcakaraḥ pañcapraṇavabhāvitaḥ |
pañcabrahmamayasphūrttiḥ pañcavāraṇavāritaḥ || (141) ||

pañcabhakṣyapriyaḥ pañcabāṇaḥ pañcaśivātmakaḥ |
ṣaṭkoṇapīṭhaḥ ṣaṭcakradhāmā ṣaḍgranthibhedakaḥ || (142) ||

ṣaḍadhvadhvāntavidhvaṃsī ṣaḍaṅgulamahāhṛdaḥ |
ṣaṇmukhaḥ ṣaṇmukhabhrātā ṣaṭśaktiparivāritaḥ || (143) ||

ṣaḍvairivargavidhvaṃsī ṣaḍūrmibhayabhañjanaḥ |
ṣaṭtarkadūraḥ ṣaṭkarmanirataḥ ṣaḍrasāśrayaḥ || (144) ||

saptapātālacaraṇaḥ saptadvīporumaṇḍalaḥ |
saptasvarlokamukuṭaḥ saptasaptivarapradaḥ || (145) ||

saptāṅgarājyasukhadaḥ saptarṣigaṇamaṇḍitaḥ |
saptacchandonidhissaptahotā saptasvarāśrayaḥ || (146) ||

saptābdhikelikāsāraḥ saptamātṛniṣevitaḥ |
<p. 524> saptacchandomodamadassaptacchandomakhaprabhuḥ || (147) ||

aṣṭamūrttirddhyeyamūrttiraṣṭaprakṛtikāraṇam |
aṣṭāṅgayogaphalabhūraṣṭapatrāmbujāsanaḥ || (148) ||

aṣṭaśaktisamṛddhaśrīraṣṭaiśvaryapradāyakaḥ |
aṣṭapīṭhopapīṭhaśrī(-)raṣṭamātṛsamāvṛtaḥ || (149) ||

aṣṭabhairavasevyo'ṣṭavasuvandyo'ṣṭamūrttibhṛt |
aṣṭacakrasphuranmūrttiraṣṭadravyahaviḥ priyaḥ || (150) ||

navanāgāsanādhyāsī navanidhyanuśāsitā |
navadvārapurādhāro navadvāraniketanaḥ || (151) ||

navanārāyaṇastutyo navadurgāniṣevitaḥ |
navanāthamahānātho navanāgavibhūṣaṇaḥ || (152) ||

navaratnavicitrāṅgo navaśaktiśirodhṛtaḥ |
daśātmako daśabhujo daśadikpativanditaḥ || (153) ||

daśādhyāyo daśaprāṇo daśendriyaniyāmakaḥ |
daśākṣaramahāmantro daśāśāvyādhivigrahaḥ || (154) ||

ekādaśādibhī rudraiḥstuta ekādaśākṣaraḥ |
dvādaśoddaṇḍadordaṇḍo dvādaśāntaniketanaḥ || (155) ||

trayodaśabhidābhinnaviśvedevādhidaivatam |
caturddaśendravaradaścaturddaśamanuprabhuḥ || (156) ||

caturddaśādividyāḍhyaścaturddaśajagatprabhuḥ |
sāmapañcadaśaḥ pañcadaśīśītāṃśunirmmalaḥ || (157) ||

ṣoḍaśādhāranilayaḥ ṣoḍaśasvaramātṛkaḥ |
ṣoḍaśāntapadāvāsaḥ ṣoḍaśendukalātmakaḥ || (158) ||

kalāsaptadaśīsaptadaśaḥ saptadaśākṣaraḥ |
aṣṭādaśadvīpapatiraṣṭādaśapurāṇakṛt || (159) ||

aṣṭādaśauṣadhīsṛṣṭiraṣṭādaśavidhissmṛtaḥ |
aṣṭādaśalipivyaṣṭisamaṣṭijñānakovidaḥ || (160) ||

ekaviṃśaḥpumānekaviṃśatyaṅgulipallavaḥ |
caturviśatitattvātmā pañcaviṃśākhyapūruṣaḥ || (161) ||

saptaviṃśatitāreśaḥ saptaviṃśatiyogakṛt |
dvātriṃśadbhairavādhīśaścatustriṃśanmahāhradaḥ || (162) ||

ṣaṭtriṃśattattvasambhūtiraṣṭatriṃśatkalātanuḥ |
namadekonapañcāśanmarudvarganirarggalaḥ || (163) ||

pañcāśadakṣaraśreṇīḥ pañcāśadrudravigrahaḥ |
pañcāśadviṣṇuśaktīśaḥ pañcāśanmātṛkālayaḥ || (164) ||

<p. 525> dvipañcāśadvapuśśreṇīstriṣaṣṭyakṣarasaṃśrayaḥ |
catuṣṣaṣṭyarṇanirṇetā catuḥṣaṣṭikalānidhiḥ || (165) ||

catuḥṣaṣṭimahāsiddhi(-)yoginīvṛndavanditaḥ |
aṣṭaṣaṣṭimahātīrttha(-)kṣetrabhairavabhāvanaḥ || (166) ||

caturnnavatimantrātmā ṣaṇṇavatyadhikaḥ prabhuḥ |
śatānandaḥ śatadhṛtiśśatapatrāyatekṣaṇaḥ || (167) ||

śatānīkaḥ śatamakhaśśatadhāravarāyudhaḥ |
sahasrapatranilayassahasraphaṇabhūṣaṇaḥ || (168) ||

sahasraśīrṣāpuruṣaḥ sahasrākṣassahasrapāt |
sahasranāmasaṃstuttyaḥ sahasrākṣabalāpahaḥ || (169) ||

daśasāhasraphaṇibhṛtphaṇirājakṛtāsanaḥ |
aṣṭāśītisahasraugha(-)maharṣistotrayantritaḥ || (170) ||

lakṣādhīśapriyādhāro lakṣādhīśamanomayaḥ |
caturllakṣajapaprītaścaturllakṣaprakāśitaḥ || (171) ||

caturāśītilakṣāṇāñjīvānāndehasaṃsthitaḥ |
koṭisūryapratīkāśaḥ koṭicandrāṃśunirmmalaḥ || (172) ||

śivābhavādhyuṣṭakoṭivināyakadhurandharaḥ |
saptakoṭimahāmantramantritāvayavadyutiḥ || (173) ||

trayastriṃśatkoṭisura(-)śreṇīpraṇatapādukaḥ |
anantadevatāsevyo hyanantamunisaṃstutaḥ || (174) ||

anantanāmānantaśrīranantānantasaukhyadaḥ |
iti vaināyakannāmnāṃ sahasramidamīritam || (175) ||

idambrāhme muhūrtte vai yaḥ paṭhetpratyahannaraḥ |
karasthantasya sakalamaihikāmuṣmikaṃ sukham || (176) ||

āyurārogyamaiśvaryandharmaḥ śauryambala(/) yyaśaḥ |
medhā prajñā dhṛtiḥ kāntissaubhāgyamatirūpatā || (177) ||

satyandayā kṣamā śāntirddākṣiṇyandharmaśīlatā |
jagatsa(/)yyamana(/) viśvasa(/)vvādo vādapāṭavam || (178) ||

sabhāpāṇḍityamaudāryaṅgāmbhīryambrahmavarccasam |
aunnatyañca kulaṃ śīlampratāpo vīryamāryatā || (179) ||

jñāna(/) vvijñānamāstikyandhairya vviśvātiśāyitā |
dhanadhānyābhivṛddhiśca sakṛdasya japādbhavet || (180) ||

vaśyañcaturvidhannṛṇāñjapādasya prajāyate |
<p. 526> rājño rājakalatrasya rājaputrasya mantriṇaḥ || (181) ||

japyate yasya vaśyārtthe sa dāsastasya jāyate |
dharmārtthakāmamokṣāṇāmanāyāsena sādhanam || (182) ||

śākinī(-)ḍākinī(-)rakṣoyakṣo(-)rogabhayāpaham |
sāmrājyasukhadañcaiva samastaripumarddanam || (183) ||

samastakalahadhvaṃsi dagdhabījaprarohaṇam |
duḥsvapnaśamanaṅkruddhasvāmicittaprasādanam || (184) ||

ṣaṭkarmāṣṭamahāsiddhi trikālajñānasādhanam |
parakṛtyopaśamanamparacakravimarddanam || (185) ||

saṅgrāmaraṅge sarveṣāmidamekañjayāvaham |
sarvavandhyātvadoṣaghnaṅgarbbharakṣaikakāraṇam || (186) ||

paṭhyate pratyaha(/) yyatra stotraṅgaṇapateridam |
deśe tatra na durbbhikṣamītayo duritāni ca || (187) ||

na tadgehañjahāti śrīryatrāyañjapyate stavaḥ |
kṣaya(-)kuṣṭha(-)pramehārśśo(-)bhagandaraviṣūcikāḥ || (188) ||

gulmamplīhānamādhmānamatisārammahodaram |
kāsaṃ śvāsamudāvarttaṃ śūlaṃ śokādisambhavam || (189) ||

śiroroga(/) vvamiṃ hikkāṅgaṇḍamālāmarocakam |
vātapittakaphadvandvatridoṣajanitajvaram || (190) ||

āgantuviṣamaṃ śītamuṣṇañcaikāhikādikam |
ityādyuktamanukta(/) vvā rogandoṣādisambhavam || (191) ||

sarvampraśamayatyāśu stotrasyāsya sakṛjjapāt |
sakṛtpāṭhena saṃsiddhiḥ strī(-)śūdra(-)patitairapi || (192) ||

sahasranāmamantro'yañjaptavyastu śubhāptaye |
mahāgaṇapatesstotraṃ sakāmaḥ prajapannidam || (193) ||

icchayā sakalānbhogānupabhujyeha pārtthivān |
manorathaphalairddivyairvyomayānairmanoramaiḥ || (194) ||

candrendrabhāskaropendrabrahmarudrādisadmasu |
kāmarūpaḥ kāmagatiḥ kāmato vicaranniha || (195) ||

bhuktvā yathepsitānbhogānabhīṣṭaissaha bandhubhiḥ |
gaṇeśānucaro bhūtvā mahāgaṇapateḥ priyaḥ || (196) ||

nandīśvarādisānandī nanditaḥ sakalairgaṇaiḥ |
śivābhyāṅkṛpayā putranirviśeṣañca lālitaḥ || (197) ||

<p. 527> śivabhaktaḥ pūrṇakāmo gaṇeśvaravarātpunaḥ |
jātismaro dharmaparaḥ sārvabhaumo'bhijāyate || (198) ||

niṣkāmastu japannityambhaktyā vighneśatatparaḥ |
yogasiddhimparāmprāpya jñānavairāgyasaṃsthitaḥ || (199) ||

nirantaroditānande paramānandasa(/)vvidi |
viśvottīrṇe pare pāre punarāvṛttivarjite || (200) ||

līno vaināyake dhāmni ramate nityanirvṛtaḥ |
yo nāmabhirhunedetairarccayetpūjayennaraḥ || (201) ||

rājāno vaśyatā(/) yyānti ripavo yānti dāsatām |
mantrāḥ siddhyanti sarvepi sulabhāstasya siddhayaḥ || (202) ||

mūlamantrādapi stotramidampriyatarammama |
nabhasye māsi śuklāyāñcaturtthyāmmama janmani || (203) ||

dūrvābhirnnāmabhiḥ pūjāntarpaṇa(/) vvidhivaccaret |
aṣṣṭadravyairviśeṣeṇa juhuyādbhaktisa(/)yyutaḥ || (204) ||

tasyepsitāni sarvāṇi siddhyantyatra na saṃśayaḥ |
idamprajaptampaṭhitampāṭhitaṃ śrāvitaṃ śrutam || (205) ||

vyākṛtañcarccitandhyāta(/) vvimṛṣṭamabhinanditam |
ihāmutra ca sarveṣā(/) vviśvaiśvaryapradāyakam || (206) ||

svacchandacāriṇāpyeṣa yena sandhāryate stavaḥ |
saṃrakṣyate śivodbhūtairgaṇairaghyuṣṭakoṭibhiḥ || (207) ||

pustake likhitaṃ stotrammantrabhūtamprapūjayet |
tatra sarvottamā lakṣīḥ sannidhatte nirantaram || (208) ||

dānairaśeṣairakhilairvrataiśca tīrtthairaśeṣaissakalairmmakhaiśca |
na tatphala(/) vvindati yadgaṇeśasahasranāmnaḥ smaraṇena sadyaḥ || (209) ||

etannāmnāṃ sahasrampaṭhati dinamaṇau pratyahamprojjihāne 
sāyammadhyandine vā triṣavaṇamathavā santata(/) vvā jano yaḥ ||
sa syādaiśvaryadhuryaḥ prabhavati vacasāṅkīrtimuccaistanoti pratyūhaṃ 
hanti viśva(/) vvaśayati sucira(/) vvarddhate putrapautraiḥ || (210) ||

akiñcano'pyekacitto niyato niyatāśanaḥ |
japettu caturo māsāngaṇeśārccanatatparaḥ || (211) ||

<p. 528> daridratāṃ samunmūlya saptajanmānugāmapi |
labhate mahatīṃ llakṣmīmityājñā pārameśvarī || (212) ||

āyuṣya(/) vvītarogaṅkulamativimalaṃ sampadaścārttadānāḥ 
kīrttirnnityāvadātā maṇitirabhinavā kāntiravyājabhavyā ||
putrāssantaḥ kalatraṅguṇavadabhimata(/) yyadyadetacca satyannitya(/) yyaḥ 
stotrametatpaṭhati gaṇapatestasya haste samastam || (213) ||

oṃ gaṇañjayo gaṇapatirherambo dharaṇīdharaḥ |
mahāgaṇapatirllakṣapradaḥ kṣipraprasādanaḥ || (214) ||

amoghasiddhiramito mantraścintāmaṇirnnidhiḥ |
sumaṅgalo bījamāśāpūrako varadaḥ śivaḥ || (215) ||

kāśyapo nandano vācāsiddho ḍhuṇḍhirvināyakaḥ |
modakairebhiratraikaviṃśatyā nāmabhiḥ pumān || (216) ||

yaḥ stauti madgatamanā mamārādhanatatparaḥ |
stuto nāmnāṃ sahasreṇa tenāhaṃ nātra saṃśayaḥ || (217) ||

namo namassuravarapūjitāṅghraye namo namo nirupamamaṅgalātmane |
namo namo vipulakaraikasiddhaye namo namaḥ karikalamānanāya te || (218) ||

kiṅkiṇīgaṇaraṇitastava caraṇaḥ prakaṭitagurumiticāritragaṇaḥ |
madajalalaharikalitakapolaḥ śamayatu duritaṅgaṇapatinṛpanāmā || (219) ||

iti śrīgaṇeśasahasranāmastotraṃ sampūrṇam ||

iti gaṇeśatantram samāptam ||



