atha sūryatantram 

atha śrīsūryadhyānam 


bhāsvadratnāḍhyamauliḥ sphuradadhararucārañjitaścārukeśo
bhāsvānyo divyatejāḥ karakamalayutaḥ svarṇavarṇaḥ prabhābhiḥ |
viśvākāśāvakāśo grahagahaṇasahito bhāti yaścodayādrau
sarvānandapradātā hariharanamitaḥ pātu mā(/) vviśvacakṣuḥ || (1) ||

atha yantroddhāraḥ

pūrvamaṣṭadalampadmampraṇavādipratiṣṭhitam |
māyābījandalāṣṭāgre yantramuddhārayediti ||

ādityambhāskarambhānuṃ raviṃ sūryandivākaram |
mārttaṇḍantapanañceti daleṣvaṣṭasu yojayet ||

dīptā sūkṣmā jayā bhadrā vibhūtirvimalā tathā |
<p. 532> amoghā vidyutā ceti madhye śrīḥ sarvatomukhī ||

atha mantroddhāraḥ

tāro ghṛṇirbbhṛguḥ paścādvāmakarṇavibhūṣitaḥ |
vahnyāsano maruccheṣaḥ sanetrodityapaścimaḥ ||
aṣṭākṣaro manuḥ prokto bhānorabhimataḥ paraḥ ||

atha mantraḥ 

oṃ ghṛṇi sūrya ādityaḥ |

atha pūjāvidhiḥ

prātaḥkṛtyādi prāṇāyāmānta(/) vvidhāya pīṭhanyāsaṅkuryāt | tatra 
viśeṣaḥ || hṛdayasya pūrvādidikṣu madhye ca prabhūta(/) vvimala(/) sāraṃ 

<p. 533> samārādhyamparasukha(/) vvinyasyādhāraśaktyādi 
aṃsūryamaṇḍalāya daśakalātmanenamaḥ ityanta(/) vvinyaset || tathā ca 
nibandhe || pīṭhe ca kḷpte prathamandikṣu madhye ca sa(/)yyajet || prabhūta(/) 
vvimala(/) sāraṃ samārādhyamanantaram || paramādisukhampīṭhaṃ 
svabimbāntamprakalpayet || tataḥ kesareṣu madhye ca || rāṃdīptāyainamaḥ || 
evaṃ rīṃsūkṣmāyai(0,) rūṃjayāyai(0,) raiṃbhadrāyai(0,) vaiṃvibhūtyai(0,) 
voṃvimalāyai(0,) vauṃ(-)amoghāyai(0,) raṃvidyutāyai(0,) raḥ sarvatomukhyai(0) || 
tathā ca nibandhe || dīptā sūkṣmā jayā bhadrā vibhūtirvimalā punaḥ || 
amoghā vidyutā sarvatomukhī pīṭhaśaktayaḥ || 
dīptadīpaśikhākārābījānyāsā(/) vviduḥ kramāt || 
aklībahrasvatritayasvarān bindvagnisa(/)yyutān || oṃ tadupari 
brahmaviṣṇuśivātmakāya saurāya yogapīṭhāya namaḥ || tathā ca 
śāradāyām || vadetpadañcaturtthyantambrahmaviṣṇuśivātmakam || saurāya 
yogapīṭhāya namaḥ padamanantaram || piṭhamantro'yamākhyāto dineśasya 
jagatpateḥ || tataḥ ṛṣyādinyāsaḥ || śirasi devabhāgaṛṣayenamaḥ || mukhe 
gāyatrīchandasenamaḥ || hṛdi ādityāya devatāyainamaḥ || tathā ca nibandhe || 
devabhāgo muniḥ prokto gāyatrīchanda īritam || ādityo devatā proktā 
dṛṣṭādṛṣṭaphalapradā || tataḥ karāṅganyāsau || satyāya tejojvālāmaṇe 
huṃphaṭsvāhā  aṅguṣṭhābhyānnamaḥ || evaṃ brahmaṇe tejojvālāmaṇe(0) 
(10) tarjjanībhyāṃ svāhā | viṣṇave te(0) (10) madhyamābhyāṃ vvaṣaṭ || 
rudrāya te(0) (10) anāmikābhyā(/) hum || agnaye te(0) (10) kaniṣṭhābhyā(/) vvauṣaṭ || 
sarvāya te(0) (10) karatalakarapṛṣṭhābhyāṃ phaṭ || evaṃ hṛdayādiṣu || tathā 
ca śāradāyām || satyāya hṛdayamproktambrahmaṇe śira īritam || viṣṇave 
syācchikhā varma rudrāya parikīrttitam || agnaye netramākhyātaṃ 
sarvāyāstramudāhṛtam || tejojvālāmaṇe hūṃ phaṭ dviṭhāntāḥ 
parikīrttitāḥ ||

<p. 534> tato mūrttinyāsaḥ | yathā || oṃśirasi ādityāyanamaḥ || evaṃ mukhe 
e(/)ravaye(0,) hṛdaye u(/)bhānave(0,) guhye i(/)bhāskarāya(0,) caraṇayoḥ a(/)sūryāya(0) || 
tathā ca nibandhe || āditya(/) vvinyasenmūrdhni ravimmukhagatannyaset || 
hṛdayaṃ bhānunāmānambhāskaraṅguhyadeśataḥ || 
sūryañcaraṇayornnyasya varṇaiḥ satyādipañcabhiḥ || tato nyāsaḥ || śirasi 
oṃnamaḥ(,) āsye oṃ ghṛnamaḥ(,) kaṇṭhe oṃṇinamaḥ(,) hṛdi oṃsūnamaḥ(,) kukṣau 
oṃryyanamaḥ(,) nābhau oṃānamaḥ(,) liṅge oṃ dinamaḥ(,) pādayoḥ oṃtyanamaḥ || 
tathā ca oṃ mūrddhā''syakaṇṭha(-)hṛdaya(-)kukṣi(-)nābhi(-)dhvajāṅghriṣu || 
mantravarṇānnyasedaṣṭau pratyekampraṇavādikam || tato dhyānam

raktābjayugmābhayadānahastaṅkeyūrahārāṅgadakuṇḍalāḍhyam ||
māṇikyamaulindinanāthamīḍe bandhūkakāntiṃ vilasattrinetram || 
evandhyātvā mānasaiḥ sampūjya kumbhasthāpanaṅkuryāt || tato 
gurupaṅktipūjāṅkṛtvā pīṭhapūjāṅkuryāt || oṃkhaṃkhakholkāyanamaḥ 
itimantreṇa mūrttiṃ saṅkalpya 
punarddhyātvā''vāhanādipañcapuṣpāñjalidānaparyanta(/) 
vvidhāyā''varaṇapūjāmārabhet || tathā ca nibandhe || 
tārādikhaṃkhakholkāya manunā mūrtikalpanā || sākṣiṇaṃ 
sarvalokānāntasyāmāvāhya pūjayet || kesareṣvagnyādikoṇe madhye dikṣu 
ca satyāya tejojvālāmaṇi hū(/)phaṭ svāhā hṛdayāyanamaḥ evaṃ 
brahmaṇe(0) (10) śirasesvāhā || viṣṇave(0) (10) śikhāyaivaṣaṭ || rudrāya(0) (10) 
kavacāyahum | agnaye(0) (10) netratrayāyavauṣaṭ || sarvāya(0) (10) astrāyaphaṭ || dik 
ṣatreṣu pūrvādi oṃ ādityāyanamaḥ evaṃ e(/)ravaye(0) u(/)bhānave 
īṃbhāskarāya(0) vidikpatreṣu agnyādi ū(/)uṣāyai(0) evaṃ praṃ prajñāyai(0,) 
pamprabhāyai(0,) sa(/)sandhyāyai(0) || tathā ca || aṅgāni pūjayedādau dikpatre 
sūryamūrttayaḥ || ādityādyāścatasro'rccyāḥ śaktayaḥ koṇapatragāḥ ||

<p. 535> svasvanāmādivarṇāḥ syustāsāmbījānyanukramāt || uṣā(-)prajñā(-)
prabhā(-)sandhyāḥ śaktayaḥ parikīrttitāḥ || tataḥ patreṣu brāhmyādyāḥ 
purato'ruṇamarccayet || tathā ca śāradāyām || patrāgrasaṃsthā 
brāhmyādyāḥ purato'ruṇamarccayediti || tadbāhye 
pūrvādicandrādīnpūjayet || oṃ candrāyanamaḥ(,) oṃ maṅgalāyanamaḥ(,) evaṃ 
budhāya(0,) bṛhaspataye(0,) śukrāya(0,) śanaiścarāya(0,) rāhave(0,) ketavenamaḥ || 
tathā ca śāradāyām || candrādīnvajrādīṃśca sampūjya 
dhūpādivisarjjanāntaṅkarma samāpayet || asya 
puraścaraṇamaṣṭalakṣajapaḥ || tathā ca || vasulakṣañjapenmantramājyena ca 
daśāṃśataḥ || tilairvā madhurāsiktairjjuhuyādvijitendriyaḥ || iti pūjā ||


atha stotram 

vasiṣṭha uvāca 

stuvaṃstatra tataḥ sāmbaḥ kṛśodharmanisantataḥ |
rājannāma sahasreṇa sahasrāṃśundivākaram ||

vidyamānantu tandṛṣṭvā sūryaḥ kṛṣṇātmajantadā |
svapne tu darśanandattvā punavvacanamabravīt || 

śrīsūrya uvāca

sāmba sāmba mahābāho śṛṇu jāmbavatīsuta |
alannāma sahasreṇa paṭhasvemaṃ stavaṃ śubham ||

yāni nāmāni guhyāni pavitrāṇi śubhāni ca |
tāni te kīrttayiṣyāmi śrutvā vatsāvadhāraya ||

vikarttano vivasvāṃśca mārttaṇḍo bhāskaro raviḥ |
lokaprakāśakaḥ śrīmā(/)llokacakṣurggraheśvaraḥ ||

lokasākṣī trilokeśaḥ karttā harttā tamisrahā |
tapanastāpasaścaiva śuciḥ saptāśvavāhanaḥ ||

gabhastihasto brahmā ca sarvadevanamaskṛtaḥ |
ekaviṃśatirityeṣa stava iṣṭaḥ sadā mama ||

śrīrārogyakaraścaiva dhanavṛddhiyaśaskaraḥ |
stavarāja iti khyātastriṣu lokeṣu viśrutaḥ ||

ya etena mahābāho dve sandhye stavanodaye |
stauti māṃ praṇaṭo bhūtvā sarvapāpaiḥ pramucyate ||

kāyika(/) vvācikañcaiva mānasa(/) yyacca duṣkṛtam |
<p. 536> eṣa jāpyena tatsarvampraṇaśyati na saṃśayaḥ ||

eṣa japyaśca homaśca sandhyopāsanameva ca |
balimantro'rgghyamantraśca dhūpamantrastathaiva ca ||

annapradāne snāne ca praṇipāte pradakṣiṇe |
pūjitoyammahāmantraḥ sarvapāpaharaḥ śubhaḥ ||

evamuktvā tu bhagavān bhāskaro jagadīśvaraḥ |
āmantrya kṛṣṇatanayantatraivāntaradhīyata ||

sāmbo'pi stavarājena stutvā saptāśvavāhanam |
pūtātmā nīrujaḥ śrīmāṃstasmādrogādvimuktavān ||

iti sāmbapurāṇe sūryastavaḥ sampūrṇaḥ ||


atha kavacam

śrīsūrya uvāca

sāmba sāmba mahābāho śṛṇu me kavacaṃ śubham |
trailokyamaṅgalannāma kavacamparamādbhutam || 

yajjñātvā mantravitsamyakphalamāpnoti niścitam |
yaddhṛtvā ca mahādevo gaṇānāmadhipo'bhavat ||
paṭhanāddhāraṇādviṣṇuḥ sarveṣāmpālakaḥ sadā |
evamindrādayaḥ sarve sarvaiśvaryamavāpnuyuḥ ||
kavacasya ṛṣirbbrahmā chando'nuṣṭubudāhṛtam |
śrīsūryo devatā cātra sarvadevanamaskṛtaḥ ||
ārogyayaśomokṣeṣu viniyogaḥ prakīrttitaḥ |
praṇavo me śiraḥ pātu ghṛṇirme pātu bhālakam ||

sūryo'vyānnayanadvandvamādityaḥ karṇayugmakam |
aṣṭākṣaro mahāmantraḥ sarvābhīṣṭaphalapradaḥ ||

hrīṃbījamme mukhampātu hṛdayambhuvaneśvarī |
candrabīja(/) vvisargāḍhyampātu me guhyadeśakam ||

akṣaro'sau mahāmantraḥ sarvatantreṣu gopitaḥ |
śivovahnisamāyukto vāmākṣivindubhūṣitaḥ || 

ekākṣaro mahāmantraḥ śrīsūryasya prakīrttitaḥ |
guhyādguhyataro mantro vāñchācintāmaṇiḥ smṛtaḥ ||

śīrṣādipādaparyantaṃ sadā pātu manūttamaḥ |
iti te kathitandivyantriṣu lokeṣu durllabham ||

śrīpradaṅkāntidannityandhanārogyavivarddhanam |
kuṣṭhādhirogaśamanammahāvyādhivināśanam ||

trisandhya(/) yyaḥ paṭhennityamarogī balavānbhavet |
bahunā kimihoktena yadyanmanasi varttate ||

<p. 537> tattatsarvambhavatyeva kavacasya ca dhāraṇāt |
bhūtapreta(-)piśācāśca yakṣa(-)gandharva(-)rākṣasāḥ ||

brahma(-)rākṣasa(-)vetālā naiva draṣṭumapi kṣamāḥ |
dūrādeva palāyante tasya saṅkīrttanādapi ||

bhūrjapatre samālikhya rocanāgurukuṅkumaiḥ |
ravivāre ca saṅkrāntyāṃ saptamyāñca viśeṣataḥ ||

dhārayetsādhakaśreṣṭhastrailokyavijayī bhavet |
trilohamadhyagaṅkṛtvā dhārayeddakṣiṇe bhuje || 

śikhāyāmathavā kaṇṭhe so'pi sūryo na saṃśayaḥ |
iti te kathitaṃ sāmba trailokyamaṅgalābhidham ||

kavacandurllabha(/) lloke tava snehātprakāśitam |
ajñātvā kavacandivya(/) yyo japetsūryamuttamam ||

siddhirnna jāyate tasya kalpakoṭiśatairapi || (18) ||

iti brahmayāmale trailokyamaṅgalaṃ nāma śrīsūryakavacaṃ sampūrṇam ||


atha hṛdayam

tato yuddhapariśrāntaṃ samare cintayā sthitam |
rāvaṇañcāgrato dṛṣṭvā yuddhāya samupasthitam || (1) ||

daivataiśca samāgamya draṣṭumabhyāgato raṇam |
upagamyābravīdrāmamagastyo bhagavāṃstadā || (2) ||

rāma rāma mahābāho śṛṇu guhyaṃ sanātanam |
yena sarvānarīnvatsa samare vijayiṣyase || (3) ||

ādityahṛdayampuṇyaṃ sarvaśatruvināśanam |
jayāvahañjapannityamakṣayamparamaṃ śivam || (4) ||

sarvamaṅgalamāṅgalyaṃ sarvapāpapraṇāśanam |
cintāśokapraśamanamāyurvarddhanamuttamam || (5) ||

raśmimantaṃ samudyantandevāsuranamaskṛtam |
pūjayasva vivasvantambhāskarambhuvaneśvaram || (6) ||

sarvadevātmako hyeṣa tejasvī raśmibhāvanaḥ |
eṣa devāsuragaṇā(/)llokān pāti gabhastibhiḥ || (7) ||

eṣa brahmā ca viṣṇuśca śivaḥ skandaḥ prajāpatiḥ |
mahendro dhanadaḥ kālo yamaḥ somo hyapāmpatiḥ || (8) ||

pitaro vasavaḥ sādhyā aśvinau maruto manuḥ |
vāyurvahniḥ prajāḥ prāṇa ṛtukarttā prabhākaraḥ || (9) ||

<p. 538> ādityaḥ savitā sūryaḥ khagaḥ pūṣā gabhastimān |
suvarṇasadṛśo bhānurhiraṇyaretā divākaraḥ || (10) ||

haridaśvaḥ sahasrārcciḥ saptasaptirmarīcimān |
timironmathanaḥ śambhustvaṣṭā mārttaṇḍakoṃ'śumān || (11) ||

hiraṇyagarbbhaḥ śiśirastapano'haskaro raviḥ |
agnigarbbho'diteḥ putraḥ śaṅkhaḥ śiśiranāśanaḥ || (12) ||

vyomanāthastamomedī ṛgyajussāmapāragaḥ |
dhanavṛṣṭirapāmmitro vindhyavīthī plavaṅgamaḥ || (13) ||

ātapī maṇḍalī mṛtyuḥ piṅgalaḥ sarvatāpanaḥ |
kavirviśvo mahātejā raktaḥ sarvabhavodbhavaḥ || (14) ||

nakṣatragrahatārāṇāmadhipo viśvabhāvanaḥ |
tejasāmapi tejasvī dvādaśātmannamo'stu te || (15) ||

namaḥ pūrvāya giraye paścimāyādraye namaḥ |
jyotirgaṇānāmpataye dinādhipataye namaḥ || (16) ||

jayāya jaya bhadrāya haryaśvāya namo namaḥ |
namo namaḥ sahasrāṃśo ādityāya namo namaḥ || (17) ||

nama ugrāya vīrāya sāraṅgāya namo namaḥ |
namaḥ padmaprabodhāya pracaṇḍāya namo'stu te || (18) ||

brahmeśānācyuteśāya sūrāyā''dityavarccase |
bhāsvate sarvabhakṣāya raudrāya vapuṣe namaḥ || (19) ||

namoghnāya himaghnāya śatrughnāyāmitātmane |
kṛtaghnaghnāya devāya jyotiṣāmpataye namaḥ || (20) ||

taptacāmīkarābhāya haraye viśvakarmaṇe |
namastamobhinighnāya rucaye lokasākṣiṇe || (21) ||

nāśayatyeṣa vai bhūtantameva sṛjati prabhuḥ |
pāyatyeṣa tapatyeṣa varṣatyeṣa gabhastibhiḥ || (22) ||

eṣa supteṣu jāgartti bhūteṣu pariniṣṭhitaḥ |
eṣa caivāgnihotrañca phalañcaivāgnihotriṇām || (23) ||

devāśca kratavaścaiva kratūnāmphalameva ca |
yāni kṛtyāni lokeṣu sarveṣu paramaprabhuḥ || (24) ||

enamāpatsu kṛcchreṣu kāntāreṣu bhayeṣu ca |
kīrttayanpuruṣaḥ kaścinnāvasīdati rāghava || (25) ||

pūjayasvainamekāgro devadevañjagatpatim |
<p. 539> etattriguṇitañjaptvā yuddheṣu vijayiṣyase || (26) ||

asminkṣaṇe mahābāho rāvaṇantvañjayiṣyasi |
evamuktvā tato'gastyo jagāma sa yathāgatam || (27) ||

evaṃ tacchrutvā mahātejā naṣṭaśoko'bhavattadā |
dhārayāmāsa suprīto rāghavaḥ prayatātmavān || (28) ||

āditya(/) vvīkṣya japtvedamparaṃ harṣamavāptavān |
trirācamya śucirbbhūtvā dhanurādāya vīryavān || (29) ||

rāvaṇamprekṣya hṛṣṭātmā jayārtthaṃ samupāgatam |
sarvayatnena mahatābṛtastasya vadhe'bhavat || (30) ||

atha raviravadannirīkṣya rāmammuditamanāḥ paramamprahṛṣyamāṇaḥ |
niśicarapatisaṅkṣaya(/) viditvā suragaṇamadhyagato vacastvareti || (31) ||

iti vālmīkīye śrīmadrāmāyaṇe ādityahṛdayastotraṃ sampūrṇam ||


atha sūktam 

vvibhrāḍ bṛhatpibatu somyaṃ maddhvāyurddadhadyajñapatāvavihrutam |
vātajūto yo .ābhirakṣati tmanā prajāḥ pupoṣa purudhā vi rājati || (1) ||

udu tyañjātavedasandeva(/) vvahanti ketavaḥ |
dṛśe viśvāya sūryam || (2) ||

yenā pāvaka cakṣasā bhuraṇyantañjanā(/) (2) .ānu |
tva(/) vvaruṇa paśyasi || (3) ||

daivyāvaddhvaryū āgataṃ rathena sūryatvacā |
maddhvā yajñaṃ samañjāthe || (4) ||

tamprattnathā pūrvathā viśśvathemathā jjyeṣṭhatātimbarhiṣada(/) svarvidam 
|
pratīcīna(/) vvṛjanandohase dhunimāśuñjayantamanu yāsu varddhase || (5) ||

aya(/) vvenaśccodayatpṛśnnigarbbhā jyotirjjarāyū rajaso vimāne |
imamapā(/) saṅgame sūryasya śiśunna viprā matibhī rihanti || (6) ||

citrandevānāmudagādanīkañcakṣurmitrasya varuṇasyāgneḥ |
āprā dyāvā  pṛthivī .āntarikṣaṃ sūrya ātmā jagatastasthuṣaśca || (7) ||

ā na '(-)iḍābhirvidathe suśasti vviśvānaraḥ savitā deva '(-)etu |
<p. 540> api yathā yuvāno matsathā no viśvañjagadabhipittve manīṣā || (8) ||

yadadya kacca vṛtrahannudagā .ābhi sūrya ||

sarvantadindra te vvaśe || (9) || taraṇirviśvadarśato jyotiṣkṛdasi sūrya ||

viśvamābhāsi rocanam || (10) ||

tatsūryasya devattvantanmahitvammaddhyā karttorvitataṃ sañjabhāra ||

yadedayukta haritaḥ sadhasthādādrātrī vvāsastanute simasmai || (11) ||

tanmitrasya vvaruṇasyābhicakṣe sūryo rūpaṅkṛṇute dyorupasthe |
anantamanyadruśadasya pājaḥ kṛṣṇamanyaddharitaḥ sambharanti || (12) ||

baṇmahā(/) (2) || ' asi sūrya baḍāditya mahā(/) (2) || ' asi || mahaste sato mahimā 
panasyate 'ddhā deva mahā(/) (2) || ' asi || (13) || baṭsūrya śravasā mahā(/) (2) || ' 
asi satrā deva mahā(/2) || ' asi || mahnā devānāmasuryaḥ purohito vvibhu 
jyotiradābhyam || (14) ||

śrāyanta iva sūrya(/) viśvedindrasya bhakṣata ||

vvasūni jāte janamāna '(-)ojasā pprati bhāganna dīghima || (15) ||

adyā devā '(-)uditā sūryasya niraṃhasaḥ pipṛtā niravadyāt ||

tanno mitro vvaruṇo māmahantāmaditiḥ sindhuḥ pṛthivī '(-)uta dyauḥ || (16) ||

ā kṛṣṇena rajasā vvarttamāno niveśayannamṛtammarttyañca |
hiraṇyayena savitā rathenā devo yāti bhuvanāni paśyan || (17) ||

iti sūktam ||


atha śatanāma 

dhaumya uvāca 

sūryo'ryamā bhagastvaṣṭā pūṣārkaḥ savitā raviḥ |
gabhastimānajaḥ kālo mṛtyurddhātā prabhākaraḥ || (1) ||

pṛthivyāpaśca tejaśca kha(/) vvāyuśca parāyaṇam |
somo bṛhaspatiḥ śukro budhoṅgāraka eva ca || (2) ||

indro vivasvāndīptāṃśuḥ śuciḥ śauriḥ śanaiścaraḥ |
brahmā viṣṇuśca rudraśca skando vai varuṇo yamaḥ || (3) ||

vaidyuto jāṭharaścāgniraindhanastejasāmpatiḥ |
dharmadhvajo vedakarttā vedāṅgo vedavāhanaḥ || (4) ||

<p. 541> kṛtantretā dvāparaśca kaliḥ sarvamalāśrayaḥ |
kalā kāṣṭhā muhūrttaśca kṣapā yāmastathā kṣaṇaḥ || (5) ||

sa(/)vvatsarakarośvatthaḥ kālacakro vibhāvasuḥ |
puruṣaḥ śāśvato yogī vyaktāvyaktaḥ sanātanaḥ || (6) ||

kālādhyakṣaḥ prajādhyakṣo viśvakarmā tamonudaḥ |
varuṇaḥ sāgaroṃśaśca jīmūto jīvano'rihā || (7) ||

bhūtāśrayo bhūtapatiḥ sarvalokanamaskṛtaḥ |
sraṣṭā sa(/)rvattako vahniḥ sarvasyādiralolupaḥ || (8) ||

anantaḥ kapilo bhānuḥ kāmadaḥ sarvatomukhaḥ |
jayo viśālo varadaḥ sarvadhātuniṣevitaḥ || (9) ||

manaḥ suparṇo bhūtādiḥ śīghragaḥ prāṇadhāraṇaḥ |
dhanvantarirddhūmraketurādidevo'diteḥ sutaḥ || (10) ||

dvādaśātmā'ravindākṣaḥ pitāmātāpitāmahaḥ |
prajādvāraṃ sargadvārammokṣadvārantriviṣṭapam || (11) ||

dāhakarttā praśāntātmā viśvātmā viśvatomukhaḥ |
carācarātmā sūkṣmātmā maitreyaḥ karuṇānvitaḥ || (12) ||

etadvai kīrttanīyasya sūryasyāmitatejasaḥ |
nāmāṣṭaśatakañcedamproktametatsvayambhuvā || (13) ||

suragaṇapitṛyakṣaseviteṃ hyasuraniśācarasiddhavanditam |
varakanakahutāśanaprabhampraṇipatitosmi hitāya bhāskaram || (14) ||

sūryodaye yaḥ susamāhitaḥ paṭhet sa(-)putradārān dhanaratnasañcayān |
labheta jātismaratāntataḥ sadā dhṛtiñca medhāñca sa vindate pumān || (15) ||

imaṃ stavandevavarasya yo naraḥ prakīrttayecchuddhamanāḥ samāhitaḥ |
vimucyate śokadavāgnisāgarāllabhet kāmānmanasā yathepsitān || (16) ||

iti śrīmahābhārate vanaparvaṇi dhaumyayudhiṣṭhirasa(/)vvāde 
śrīsūryasyāṣṭottaraśatanāmastotraṃ samāptam ||


atha sahasranāma

sumanturuvāca

māghe māsi site pakṣe saptamyāṅkurunandana |
<p. 542> nirāhāro ravimbhaktyā pūjayedvidhinā nṛpa || (1) ||

pūrvoktena japejjapyandevasya purataḥ sthitaḥ |
śuddhaikāgramanā rājañjitakrodho jitendriyaḥ || (2) ||

śatānīka uvāca

kena mantreṇa japtena darśanambhagavānvrajet |
stotreṇa vāpi savitā tanme kathaya suvrata || (3) ||

sumanturuvāca

stuto nāmasahasreṇa yadā bhaktimatā mayā |
tadā me darśana(/) yyātaḥ sākṣāddevo divākaraḥ || (4) ||

śatānīka uvāca

nāmnāṃ sahasraṃ savituḥ śrotumicchāmi te dvija |
yena te darśana(/) yyātaḥ sākṣāddevo divākaraḥ || (5) ||

sumanturuvāca

sarvamaṅgalamāṅgalyaṃ sarvapāpapraṇāśanam |
na cedasti bhayaṅkiñcidyajanena ca śāmyati || (6) ||

jvarādvimucyate rājan stotre'sminpaṭhite naraḥ |
anye ca rogāśśāmyanti paṭhataḥ śṛṇvatastathā || (7) ||

sampadyante yathākāmāssarvabhogā yathepsitāḥ |
ya etadāditaḥ śrutvā saṅgrāmampraviśennaraḥ || (8) ||

sa jitvā samare śatrūnabhyeti gṛhamakṣataḥ |
vandhyānāmputrajananambhītānāmbhayanāśanam || (9) ||

bhūtakāri daridrāṇāṅkuṣṭhināmparamauṣadham |
bālānāñcaiva sarveṣāṅgraharakṣonivāraṇam || (10) ||

paṭhedetaddhi yo rājan sa śreyaḥ paramāpnuyāt |
saṃsiddhassarvasaṅkalpaḥ sukhamatyantamaśnute || (11) ||

dharmārtthibhirddharmalabdhyai sukhāya ca sukhārtthibhiḥ |
rājyāya rājyakāmaiśca paṭhitavyamidannaraiḥ || (12) ||

vidyā vahantu viprāṇāṃ kṣatriyāṇāñjayāvaham |
paśvā vahantu vaiśyānāṃ śūdrāṇāndharmabarddhanam || (13) ||

paṭhatāṃ śṛṇvatāmetadbhavatīti na saṃśayaḥ |
tacchṛṇuṣva nṛpaśreṣṭha prayatātmā bravīmi te || (14) ||

nāmnāṃ sahasra(/) vvikhyātandevadevasya bhāsvataḥ |

oṃ asya śrīsūryasahasranāmnāmbhagavān parāśaraṛṣiranuṣṭupchanda 
śrīsūryo devatā sakalābhīṣṭasiddhyartthe jape viniyogaḥ ||

oṃ viśvavidviśvajitkarttā viśvātmā viśvatomukhaḥ |
<p. 543> viśveśvaro viśvayonirnniyatātmā jitendriyaḥ || (1) ||

kālāśrayaḥ kālakarttā kālahā kālanāśanaḥ |
mahāyogī mahābuddhirmahātmā sumahābalaḥ || (2) ||

prabhurvibhurbbhūtanātho bhūtātmā bhuvaneśvaraḥ |
bhūtabhavyo bhāvitātmā bhūtāntaḥ karaṇaśśivaḥ || (3) ||

śaraṇyaḥ kamalānando nandano nandavarddhanaḥ |
vareṇyo varado yogī susa(/)yyuktaḥ prakāśakaḥ || (4) ||

prākprāṇaḥ paramaḥ prāṇaḥ prītātmā priyataḥ priyaḥ |
nayaḥ sahasrapātsādhurddivyakuṇḍalamaṇḍitaḥ || (5) ||

avyaṅgadhārī dhīrātmā pracetā vāyuvāhanaḥ |
samāhitamatirddhātā vidhātākṛtamaṅgalaḥ || (6) ||

kaparddī kalpakṛdrudraḥ sumanā dharmavatsalaḥ |
samāyuktā vimuktātmā kṛtātmā kṛtinā(/) vvaraḥ || (7) ||

avicintyavapuḥ śreṣṭho mahāyogī maheśśvaraḥ |
kāntaḥ kāmādirādityo niyatātmā nirākulaḥ || (8) ||

kāmaḥ kāruṇikaḥ karttā kamalākarabodhanaḥ |
saptasaptiracintyātmā mahākāruṇikottamaḥ  || (9) ||

sañjīvano jīvanātho jagajjīvo jagatpatiḥ |
ajayo viśvanilayassa(/)vvibhāgo vṛṣadhvajaḥ || (10) ||

vṛṣākapiḥ kalpakarttā kalpāntakaraṇo raviḥ |
ekacakraratho maunī suratho rathinā(/) vvaraḥ || (11) ||

akrodhano raśmimālī tejorāśirvibhāvasuḥ |
divyakṛddinakṛddevo devadevo divaspatiḥ || (12) ||

dīnanātho havirhotā divyabāhurddivākaraḥ |
yajño yajñapatiḥ pūṣā svarṇaretāḥ parāvahaḥ || (13) ||

parāparajñastaraṇiraṃśumālī manoharaḥ |
prājñaḥ prajāpatissūryaḥ savitā viṣṇuraṃśumān || (14) ||

sadāgatirggandhabāhurvihito vidhirāśugaḥ |
pataṅgaḥ patagaḥ sthāṇurvihaṅgo vihago varaḥ || (15) ||

haryaśvo haritāśvaśca haridaśvo jagatpriyaḥ |
tryambakassarvadamano bhāvitātmā bhiṣagvaraḥ || (16) ||

ālokakṛllokanātho lokālokanamaskṛtaḥ |
<p. 544> kālaḥ kalpāntako vahnistapanassampratāpanaḥ || (17) ||

virocano virūpākṣassahasrākṣaḥ purandaraḥ |
sahasraraśmirmihiro vividhāmbarabhūṣaṇaḥ || (18) ||

khagaḥ pratarddano dhanyo hayago vāgviśāradaḥ |
śrīmāṃśca śiśiro vāggmī śrīpatiḥ śrīniketanaḥ || (19) ||

śrīkaṇṭhaḥ śrīdharaśśrīmāñchrīnivāso vasupradaḥ |
kāmacārī mahāmāyo maheśo viditāśayaḥ || (20) ||

tīrtthakriyāvānsunayo vibhavo bhaktavatsalaḥ |
kīrttiḥ kīrttikaro nityaḥ kuṇḍalī kavacī rathī || (21) ||

hiraṇyaretāḥ saptāśvaḥ prayatātmā parantapaḥ |
buddhimānamaraśreṣṭho rociṣṇuḥ pākaśāsanaḥ || (22) ||

samudro dhanado dhātā māndhātā kaśmalāpahaḥ |
tamoghno dhvāntahā vahnirhotāntaḥ karaṇo guhaḥ || (23) ||

paśumānprayatānando bhūteśaḥ śrīmatā(/) vvaraḥ |
nityodito nityarathaḥ sureśaḥ surapūjitaḥ || (24) ||

ajito vijayo jetā jaṅgamassthāvarātmakaḥ |
jīvānando nityagāmī vijetā vijayapradaḥ || (25) ||

parjjanyognisthitiḥ stheyaḥ sthaviro'ṇurnnirañjanaḥ |
pradyotano rathārūḍhaḥ sarvalokaprakāśakaḥ || (26) ||

dhruvo medhī mahāvīryo haṃsassaṃsāratārakaḥ |
sṛṣṭikarttā kriyāheturmārttaṇḍo marutāṃpatiḥ || (27) ||

marutvāndahanastvaṣṭā bhago bhāgyo'ryamāpatiḥ |
varuṇāṃśo jagannāthaḥ kṛtakṛtyaḥ sulocanaḥ || (28) ||

vivasvānbhūnumānkāryakāraṇantejasānnidhiḥ |
asaṅgagāmī tigmāṃśurddharmādirddvīptidīdhitiḥ || (29) ||

sahasradīdhitirbbradhnaḥ sahasrāṃśurddivākaraḥ |
gabhastimāndīdhitimānsragvimānatuladyutiḥ || (30) ||

bhāskarassurakāryajñaḥ sarvajñastīkṣṇadīdhitiḥ |
surajyeṣṭhaḥ surapatirbbahujño vacasāmpatiḥ || (31) ||

tejonidhirbṛhattejā bṛhatkīrttirbṛhaspatiḥ |
ahimānūrjjito dhīmānāmuktaḥ kīrttivarddhanaḥ || (32) ||

mahāvaidyogaṇapatirgaṇeśo gaṇanāyakaḥ |
<p. 545> tīvrapratāpanastāpī tāpano viśvatāpanaḥ || (33) ||

kārttasvaro hṛṣīkeśaḥ padmānandobhinanditaḥ |
padmanābho'mṛtāhāraḥ sthitimānketumānnabhaḥ || (34) ||

anādyanto'cyuto viśvo viśvāmitro ghṛṇī virāṭ |
āmuktaḥ kavacī vāggmī kañcukī viśvabhāvanaḥ || (35) ||

animittagatiśreṣṭhaḥ śaraṇyaḥ sarvatomukhaḥ |
vigāhī reṇurasahassamāyuktassamāhitaḥ || (36) ||

dharmaketurddharmaratissaṃharttā sa(/)yyamo yamaḥ |
praṇatārttiharo vādī siddhakāryo janeśvaraḥ || (37) ||

nabhovigāhanassatyastāmasaḥ sumanoharaḥ |
hārī harirharo vāyurṛtuḥ kālānaladyutiḥ || (38) ||

mukhasevyo mahātejā jagatāmantakāraṇam |
mahendro viṣṭutastotraṃ stutihetuḥ prabhākaraḥ || (39) ||

sahasrakara āyuṣmānaroṣaḥ sukhadassukhī |
vyādhihā sukhadaḥ saukhyaṅkalyāṇaḥ kalpinā(/)vvaraḥ || (40) ||

ārogyakarmaṇāṃ siddhirvṛddhi ṛddhirahaspatiḥ |
hiraṇyaretā ārogya(/) vvidvānbandhurbudho mahān || (41) ||

praṇavāndhṛtimāndharmo dharmakarttā rucipradaḥ |
sarvapriyassarvasahaḥ sarvaśatrunivāraṇaḥ || (42) ||

prāṃśurvidyotano dyotassahasrakiraṇaḥ kṛtiḥ |
keyūrabhūpaṇodbhāsī bhāsito bhāsanonalaḥ || (43) ||

śaraṇyārttiharo hotā khadyotaḥ khagasattamaḥ |
sarvadyoto bhavadyotaḥ sarvadyutikaromalaḥ || (44) ||

kalyāṇaḥ kalyāṇakaraḥ kalpaḥ kalpakaraḥ kaviḥ |
kalyāṇakṛtkalpavapuḥ sarvakalyāṇabhājanaḥ || (45) ||

śāntipriyaḥ prasannātmā praśāntaḥ praśamapriyaḥ |
udārakarmā sunayaḥ suvarccā varcasojjvalaḥ || (46) ||

varccasvī varccasāmīśastrailokyeśo vaśānuṃgaḥ |
tejasvī suyaśovarṇirvarṇādhyakṣo balipriyaḥ || (47) ||

yaśasvī vedanilayastejasvī prakṛtisthitaḥ |
ākāśagaḥ śīghragatirāśugaḥ śrutimānkhagaḥ || (48) ||

gopatirgrahadeveśo gomānekaḥ prabhañjanaḥ |
<p. 546> janitā prajanañjīvo dīpaḥ sarvaprakāśakaḥ || (49) ||

karmasākṣī yoganityo nabhasvānasurāntakaḥ |
rakṣoghno vighnaśamanaḥ kirīṭī sumanaḥpriyaḥ || (50) ||

marīcimālī sumatiḥ kṛtātithyoviśeṣakaḥ |
śiṣṭācāraḥ śubhācāraḥ svācārācāratatparaḥ || (51) ||

mandāro māṭharo reṇuḥ kṣobhaṇaḥ pakṣiṇāṅguruḥ |
svaviśiṣṭo viśiṣṭātmā vidheyo jñānaśobhanaḥ || (52) ||

mahāśvetāpriyo jñeyaḥ sāmago modadāyakaḥ |
sarvavedapragītātmā sarvavedālayo layaḥ || (53) ||

vedamūrttiścaturvvedo vedabhṛdvedapāragaḥ |
kriyāvānatirociṣṇurvarīyāṃśca varapradaḥ || (54) ||

vratacārī vratadharo lokabandhuralaṅkṛtaḥ |
alaṅkārākṣaro divyavidyāvān viditāśayaḥ || (55) ||

akāro bhūṣaṇobhūṣyo bhūṣṇurbbhavanapūjitaḥ |
cakrapāṇirvajradharaḥ sureśo lokavatsalaḥ || (56) ||

rājñīpatirmahābāhuḥ prakṛtirvikṛtirguṇaḥ |
andhakārāpahaḥ śreṣṭho yugāvartto yugādikṛt || (57) ||

aprameyaḥ sadāyogī virahaṅkāra īśvaraḥ |
śubhapradaḥ śubhaśśobhā śubhakarmā śubhāspadaḥ || (58) ||

satyavāndhṛtimānarccyo hyakāro vṛddhidonalaḥ |
balabhṛdbalado bandhurbalavānbalināmbaraḥ || (59) ||

anaṅgo nāgarāḍindraḥ padmayonirgaṇeśvaraḥ |
sa(/)vvatsarakraturnnetā kālacakrapravarttakaḥ || (60) ||

padmekṣaṇaḥ padmayoniḥ prabhavonasaradyutiḥ |
sumūrttiḥ sumatissomo govindo jagadādijaḥ || (61) ||

pītavāsāḥ kṛṣṇavāsā digvāsātīndriyo hariḥ |
atīndro'nekarūpātmā skandaḥ parapurañjayaḥ || (62) ||

śaktimāñchūladhṛgbhāsvānmokṣaheturayonijaḥ |
sarvadarśājito darśo duḥsvapnāśubhanāśanaḥ || (63) ||

maṅgalyakarttā taraṇirvegavānkaśmalāpahaḥ |
spaṣṭākṣaro mahāmantro viśākho yajanapriyaḥ || (64) ||

viśvakarmā mahāśaktirjyotirīśo vihaṅgamaḥ |
vicakṣaṇo dakṣa indraḥ pratyūhaḥ priyadarśanaḥ || (65) ||

<p. 547> aśvinau vedanilayo vedavidviditāśayaḥ |
prabhākaro jitaripuḥ sujanoruṇasārathiḥ || (66) ||

kuberasurathaḥ skando mahitobhihito guruḥ |
graharājo grahapratirgrahanakṣatramaṇḍanaḥ || (67) ||

bhāskaraḥ satatānando nandano nandivarddhanaḥ |
maṅgalo'tha maṅgalavānmāṅgalyo maṅgalāvahaḥ || (68) ||

maṅgalācāracaritaḥ śīrṇaḥ sarvavrato vratī |
caturmukhaḥ padmamālī pūtātmā praṇatārttihā || (69) ||

akiñcanassatyasandho nirguṇo guṇavānguṇī |
sampūrṇaḥ puṇḍarīkākṣo vidheyo yogatatparaḥ || (70) ||

sahasrāṃśuḥ kratupatiḥ sarvasvaṃ sumatiḥ suvāk |
suvāhano mālyadāmā dhṛtāhāro haripriyaḥ || (71) ||

brahmapracetā prathitaḥ pratītātmā sthirātmakaḥ |
śatabinduḥ śatamakho garīyānanalaprabhuḥ || (72) ||

dhīro mahattaro dhanyaḥ puruṣaḥ puruṣottamaḥ |
vidyādhārādhirājo hi vidyāvānbhūtidaḥ sthitaḥ || (73) ||

anirddeśyavapuḥ śrīmānviśvātmā bahumaṅgalaḥ |
susthitaḥ surathaḥ svarṇo mokṣādhāraniketanaḥ || (74) ||

nirdvandvo dvandvahā sargaḥ sarvagaḥ samprakāśakaḥ |
dayālussūkṣmadhīḥ śāntiḥ kṣemākṣemasthitipriyaḥ || (75) ||

bhūdharo bhūpatirvaktā pavitrātmā trilocanaḥ |
mahāvarāhaḥ priyakṛddhātā bhoktā bhayapradaḥ || (76) ||

caturvedadharo nityo vinidro vividhāśanaḥ |
cakravarttī dhṛtikaraḥ sampūrṇo'tha maheśvaraḥ || (77) ||

vicitraratha ekākī saptasaptiḥ parātparaḥ |
sarvodadhisthitikaraḥ sthitiḥ stheyaḥ sthitipriyaḥ || (78) ||

niṣkalaḥ puṣkalanibhā vasumānvāsavapriyaḥ |
vasumānvāsavasvāmī vasudātā vasupradaḥ || (79) ||

balavāñjñānavā(/)stattvamoṅkārastriṣu saṃsthitaḥ |
saṅkalpayonirddinakṛdbhagavānkāraṇāvahaḥ || (80) ||

nīlakaṇṭho dhanādhyakṣaścaturvedapriya(/)vvadaḥ |
<p. 548> vaṣatkāro hutaṃ hotā svāhākāro hutāhutiḥ || (81) ||

janārddano janānando naro nārāyaṇo'mbudaḥ |
svarṇāṅgakṣapaṇo vāyuḥ surāsuranamaskṛtaḥ || (82) ||

vigrahī vimalo bindurviśoko vimaladyutiḥ |
dyotito dyotano vidvānvivasvānvarado balī || (83) ||

dharmayonirmahāmoho viṣṇubhrātā sanātanaḥ |
sāvitrībhāvito rājā visṛto vighṛṇī virāṭ || (84) ||

saptārcciḥ saptaturagaḥ saptalokanamakṛtaḥ |
sampanno'tha jagannāthaḥ sumanāśśobhanapriyaḥ || (85) ||

sarvātmā sarvakṛtsṛṣṭiḥ saptimānsaptamīpriyaḥ |
sumedhā mādhavo medhyo medhāvī madhusūdanaḥ || (86) ||

aṅgirā gatikālajño dhūmaketussuketanaḥ |
sukhī sukhapradaḥ saukhyaṅkāmī kāntipriyo muniḥ || (87) ||

santāpanaḥ santapana ātapī tapasāmpatiḥ |
ugraśravāssahasrosraḥ priyaṅkārī priyaṅkaraḥ || (88) ||

prīto vimanyurambhodo jīvano jagatāmpatiḥ |
jagatpitā prītamanāḥ sarvaḥ sarvoguhābalaḥ || (89) ||

sarvago jagadānando jagannetā surārihā |
śreyaḥ śreyaskaro jyāyānuttamottama uttamaḥ || (90) ||

uttamo'tha mahāmerurddhāraṇo dharaṇīdharaḥ |
dhārādharo dharmarājo dharmo dharmapravarttakaḥ || (91) ||

rathādhyakṣo rathapatistvaramāṇomitānalaḥ |
uttaronuttarastāpī tārāpatirapāmpatiḥ || (92) ||

puṇyasaṅkīrttanaḥ puṇyo heturllokatrayāśrayaḥ |
svarbbhānurvihagāriṣṭo viśiṣṭotkṛṣṭakarmakṛt || (93) ||

vyādhipraṇāśanaḥ kṣemaḥ śūrassarvajitā(/) vvaraḥ |
ekanātho rathādhīśaḥ śanaiścarapitā sitaḥ || (74) ||

vaivasvatagururmṛtyurddharmanityo mahāvrataḥ |
pralambahāraḥ sañcārī pradyoto dyotitonalaḥ || (95) ||

santānakṛtparo mantro mantramūrttirmahābalaḥ |
śreṣṭhātmā supriyaḥ śambhurmahatāmīśvareśvaraḥ || (96) ||

saṃsāragativicchettā saṃsārārṇavatārakaḥ |
saptajihvaḥ sahasrārccī ratnagarbbhoparājitaḥ || (97) ||

<p. 549> dharmaketurameyātmā dharmādharmavarapradaḥ |
lokasākṣī lokagururlokeśaśchandavāhanaḥ || (98) ||

dharmarūpaḥ sūkṣmavāyurddhanuṣpāṇirddhanurddharaḥ |
pinākadhṛṅmahotsāho naikamāyo mahāśanaḥ || (99) ||

vīraḥ śaktimatāṃ śreṣṭhaḥ sarvaśastrabhṛtā(/) vvaraḥ |
jñānagamyo durārādhyo lohitāṅgorimarddanaḥ || (100) ||

ananto dharmado nityo dharmakṛccakrivikramaḥ |
daivatastryakṣaro madyo nīlāṅgo nīlalohitaḥ || (101) ||

ekonaikastrayī vyāsaḥ savitā samitiñjayaḥ |
sārṅgadhanvā nalo bhīmaḥ sarvapraharaṇāyudhaḥ || (102) ||

parameṣṭhī parañjyotirnnākapālī divaspatiḥ |
vadānyo vāsukirvedya ātreyotiparākramaḥ || (103) ||

dvāparaḥ paramodāraḥ paramabrahmacaryavān |
uddīptaveṣo mukuṭī padmahasto himāṃśubhṛt || (104) ||

smitaḥ prasannavadanaḥ padmodaranibhānanaḥ |
sāyandivādivyavapuranirddeśyo mahārathaḥ || (105) ||

mahāratho mahānīśaḥ śeṣaḥ sattvarajastamaḥ |
dhṛtātapatrapratimo vimarṣṣī nirṇayaḥ sthitaḥ || (106) ||

ahiṃsakaḥ śuddhamatiradvitīyo'rimarddanaḥ |
sarvado dhanado mokṣo vihārī bahudāyakaḥ || (107) ||

grahanātho grahapatirgraheśastimirāpahaḥ |
manoharavapuḥ śubhraḥ śobhanaḥ suprabhānanaḥ || (108) ||

suprabhaḥ suprabhākāraḥ sunetro nikṣubhāpatiḥ | 
rājñīpriyaḥ śabdakaro graheśastimirāpahaḥ || (109) ||

siṃhikeyaripurddevo varado varanāyakaḥ |
caurbbhujo mahāyogī yogīśvarapatistathā || (110) ||

anādirūpo'ditijo ratnakāntiḥ prabhāmayaḥ |
jagatpradīpo vistīrṇo mahāvistīrṇamaṇḍalaḥ || (111) ||

ekacakrarathaḥ svarṇarathaḥ svarṇaśarīradhṛk |
nirālambo gaganago dharmakarmaprabhāvakṛt || (112) ||

dharmātmā karmaṇāṃ sākṣī pratyakṣaḥ parameśvaraḥ |
merusevī sumedhāvī merurakṣākaro mahān || (113) ||

ādhārabhūto ratimāṃstathā ca dhanadhānyakṛt |
pāpasantāpasaṃharttā manovāñchitadāyakaḥ || (114) ||

<p. 550> rogaharttā rājyadāyī ramaṇīyaguṇonṛṇī |
kālatrayānantarūpo munivṛndanamaskṛtaḥ || (115) ||

sandhyārāgakaraḥ siddhaḥ sandhyāvandanavanditaḥ |
sāmrājyadānanirataḥ samārādhanatoṣavān || (116) ||

bhaktaduḥkhakṣayakaro bhavasāgaratārakaḥ |
bhayāpaharttā bhagavānaprameyaparākramaḥ ||
manusvāmī manupatirmānyo manvantarādhipaḥ || (117) ||

etatte sarvamākhyāta(/) yyanmāntvamparipṛcchasi |
nāmnāṃ sahasraṃ savituḥ pārāśaryo yadāha me || (118) ||

dhanya(/) yyaśasyamāyuṣyanduṣṭaduḥsvapnanāśanam |
bandhamokṣakarañcaiva bhānornnāmānukīrttanam || (119) ||

yastvidaṃ śṛṇuyānnityampaṭhitvā prayato naraḥ |
akṣayaṃ sukhamannādyambhavettasyopasādhitam || (120) ||

nṛpāgnitaskarabhaya(/) vvyādhibhyo na bhayambhavet |
vijayī ca bhavennityaṃ śreyaśca paramāpnuyāt || (121) ||

kīrtimānsubhago vidvānsa sukhī priyadarśśanaḥ |
bhavedvarṣaśatāyuśca sarvavyādhivivarjitaḥ || (122) ||

nāmnāṃ sahasramidamaṃśumataḥ paṭhedyaḥ prātaḥ 
śucirnniyamavānsusamādhiyuktaḥ |
dvāreṇa tampariharanti sadaiva rogā bhītāssuparṇamiva sarvamahoragendrāḥ 
|| (123) ||

iti śrībhaviṣyapurāṇe saptamīkalpe bhagavataḥ śrīsūryasya nāmnāṃ 
sahasraṃ sampūrṇam ||

iti sūryatantraṃ samāptam 



[śrīḥ
 
śivahararājadhānīpatiśrīrājādevanandanasiṃha(-)
bahāduranarādhipasaṃgṛhītaviracita(-)

śāktapramodāntargataṃ 

saptadaśaṃ


viṣṇutantram ]


uktarājaguruvaṃśyapaṇḍitaśrīraghurājadubejīdvārā 

saṃśodhitam 

tadetat

śrīkṛṣṇadāsātmaja(-)khemarājena

svakīye 'śrīveṃkaṭeśvara' yantrālaye 

mudrayitvā prakāśitam 

mumba(-)ī


śrīgaṇeśāya namaḥ

atha viṣṇutantram

atha śrīviṣṇudhyānam

śāntākārambhujagaśayanampadmanābhaṃ sureśa(/) 
vviśvādhāraṅgaganasadṛśammeghavarṇaṃ śubhāṅgam ||
lakṣmīkāntaṅkamalanayana(/) yyogibhirddhyānagamya(/)
vvande viṣṇumbhavabhayaharaṃ sarvalokaikanātham || (1) ||

atha yantroddhāraḥ

anuktakalpe yantrantu likhetpadmadalāṣṭakam |
ṣaṭkoṇaṃ karṇikantatra vedadvāropaśobhitam ||

<p. 554> atha mantroddhāraḥ

sa(-)caturtthīnamo'ntaiśca nāmabhirvinyasetsudhīḥ |
tārannamaḥ padambrūyānnarau dīrgghasamanvitau ||
yavarṇo ṇāyamantroyamprokto vasvakṣaraḥ paraḥ ||

atha mantraḥ 

oṃ namo nārāyaṇāya |

atha pūjāprayogaḥ

prātaḥ kṛtyādi mātṛkānyāsāntaṅkarma vidhāya 
keśavakṛtyādinyāsaṅkuryāt || atha ṛṣyādinyāsaḥ || śirasi 
prajāpatayeṛṣayenamaḥ || mukhe gāyatrīchandasenamaḥ || hṛdi 
arddhalakṣmīharaye devatāyai namaḥ || tataḥ karāṅganyāsau || śrī(/) 
aṅguṣṭhābhyānnama ityādi || tathā ca gautamīye || ṛṣiḥ prajāpatiśchando 
gāyatrī devatā punaḥ || arddhalakṣmīhariḥ proktaḥ 
śrīṃbījenāṅgakalpaneti || tato dhyānam ||

udyatpradyotanaśatarucintaptahemāvadātampārśśvadvandve jaladhisutayā 
viśvadhātryā ca juṣṭam || nānāratnollasitavividhākalpamāpītavastra(/) 
vviṣṇu(/) vvande darakamalakaumodakīcakrapāṇim || evandhyātvā nyaset |
varṇānmuktvā sārddhacandrāniti darśanāt || aṃkeśavakṛtyainamo lalāṭe 
|| āṃnārāyaṇāyakāntyainamo mukhe || iṃ mādhavāyapuṣṭyainamo 
dakṣanetre || īṃ govindāyapuṣṭyainamo vāmanetre || namaḥ sarvatra || uṃ 
viṣṇavedhṛtyai(0) dakṣakarṇe || ūṃ madhusūdanāyaśāntyai(0) vāmakarṇe | 
ṛṃtrivikramāyakriyāyai(0) dakṣanāsāpuṭe || ṝṃvāmanāyadayāyai(0) 
vāmanāsāpuṭe | ḷṃśrīdharāyamedhāyai(0) dakṣagaṇḍe | 
ḹṃhṛṣīkeśāyadurgāyai(0) vāmagaṇḍe | eṃ padmanābhāyaśraddhāyai(0) 
oṣṭhe | aiṃdāmodarāyalajjāyai(0) adhare | oṃvāsudevāyalakṣmyai(0) 
ūrddhvadantapaṅktau || 

<p. 555> auṃ saṅkarṣaṇāyasarasvatyai(0) adhodantapaṅktau | 
aṃpradyumnāyadhṛtyai(0) mastake | aḥ(-)aniruddhāyaratyai(0) mukhe || 
kaṃcakriṇejayāyai(0,) khaṃgadinedurgāyai(0,) gaṃśārṅgiṇeprabhāyai(0,) 
ghaṃkhaḍginesatyāyai(0,) ṅaṃśaṅkhinecandrāyai(0) 
dakṣakaramūlasandhyagrakeṣu || caṃhalinevāṇyai(0,) 
chaṃmusalinevilāsinyai(0,) jaṃśūlinevijayāyai(0,) jhaṃpāśinevirajāyai(0,) 
ñaṃ(-)aṅkuśinebimbāyai(0,) vāmakaramūlasandhyagrakeṣu || 
ṭaṃmukundāya vinadāyai(0,) ṭhaṃnandajāya sunandāyai(0,) 
ḍaṃnandinesmṛtyai(0,) ḍhaṃnarāyaṛddhyai(0,) ṇaṃnarakajitesamṛddhyai(0) 
dakṣapādamūlasandhyagrakeṣu || taṃharayeśuddhyai(0,) 
thaṃkṛṣṇāyabṛddhyai(0,) daṃsatyāyabhūmyai(0,) dhaṃsātvatāyamatyai(0,) 
naṃsaurāṣṭrāyakṣamāyai(0) vāmapādamūlasandhyagrakeṣu || 
paṃśūrāya ramāyai(0) dakṣapārśve || phaṃjanārddanāya umāyai(0,) 
vāmapārśve | baṃbhūdharāya kledinyai(0) pṛṣṭhe | bhaṃviśvamūrttaye 
klinnāyai(0) nābhau | maṃvaikuṇṭhāyavasudāyai(0) udare | yaṃ tvagātmane 
puruṣottamāyavasudhāyai(0) hṛdi | raṃ asṛgātmanebalineparāyai(0) 
dakṣāṃse | laṃmāṃsātmanevālānujāyaparāyaṇāyai(0) kakudi | 
vaṃmada(-)ātmanebalāyasūkṣmāyai(0) vāmāṃse | śaṃ(-)
asthyātmanevṛṣaghnāyasaṃghāyai(0) hṛdādidakṣakare | 
ṣaṃmajjātmanevṛṣāyaprajñāyai(0) hṛdādibāmakare || 
saṃśuklātmanehaṃsāyaprabhāyai(0) hṛdādidakṣapāde | 
haṃprāṇātmanevarāhāyaniśāyai(0) hṛdādivāmapāde | 
laṃjīvātmanevimalāya(-)amoghāyai(0) hṛdādyudare | kṣaṃkrodhātmane 
nṛsiṃhāyavidyutāyai(0) hṛdādimukhe || tathā ca gautamīye || 
keśavādirayannyāso nyāsamātreṇa dehinām || acyutatvandadātyeva 
satyaṃ satyanna saṃśayaḥ || mātṛkārṇaṃ samuccārya keśavāya iti 
smaret || kīrttyai ca namasāyuktamityādi nyāsamācaret || keśavāya tataḥ 
kīrttyai kāntyai nārāyaṇāya ca || ityādyagastyasaṃhitāvacanāccāyaṃ 
kramaḥ || na tu keśavakīrttibhyānnama ityādi || tathā 
bhuktimuktimicchatā'yannyāsaḥ karttavyaḥ śrībījādi ||

<p. 556> yathā (--) ||

śrīṃ aṃ keśavāyakīrtyainama ityādi || athopacārakrameṇa pūjā || 
athāvāhanam || yasya darśanamicchanti devāḥ svābhīṣṭasiddhaye || 
kṛpayā devadeveśa madagre sannidhībhava || yasya te parameśāna 
svāgataṃ svāgatamprabho || kṛtārthonugṛhīto'smi saphalañjīvanammama 
|| yadāgato'si deveśa cidānandamayāvyaya || ajñānādvā pramādādvā 
vaikalpātsādhakasya ca | yadapūrṇambhavetkṛtyantathāpyabhimukhobhava || 
ityāvāhanam || atha pādyam || 
yadbhaktileśasamparkkātparamānandasambhavaḥ || tasmai te parameśāna 
pādyaṃ śuddhāya kalpaye || iti pādyam || 

athācamanam ||

devānāmapi devāya devānāndaivatāya ca |
ācāmaṅkalpayāmīśa svadhayā śuddhihetave || ityācamanam ||

athārgghyam ||

tāpatrayaharandivyamparamānandalakṣaṇam ||
tāpatrayavimokṣāya tavārgghyaṅkalpayāmyaham || ityargghyam || 

atha madhuparkam ||

sarvakāluṣyahīnāya paripūrṇasudhātmakam |
madhuparkkamimandeva kalpayāmi prasīda me || iti madhuparkkam ||

atha punarācamanīyam ||

ucchiṣṭopyaśucirvāpi yasya smaraṇamātrataḥ | 
śuddhimāpnoti tasmai te punarācamanantvidam || iti punarācamanīyam ||

athābhyaṅgam ||

gandhatailaṅgṛhītvā paṭhet | snehaṅgṛhāṇa snehena lokanātha mahāśaya 
|| sarvalokeṣu śuddhātmandadāmi snehamuttamam || ityabhyaṅgam ||

athasnānam || oṃ sahasraśīrṣā puruṣaḥ sahasrākṣaḥ sahasrapāt |
sa bhūmiṃ sarvatasspṛtvātyatiṣṭhaddaśāṅgulam || (1) ||

puruṣa evedaṃ sarva yyadbhūta(/) yyacca bhāvyam |
utāmṛtattvasyeśāno yadannenātirohati || (2) ||

etāvānasya mahimāto jjyāyā(/)śca pūruṣaḥ |
pādosya viśvā bhūtāni tripādasyāmṛtandivi || (3) ||

tripādūrddhva '(-)udaitpuruṣaḥ pādo'syehābhavatpunaḥ |
tato viṣvaṅvyakrāmatsāśanānaśane'(-)abhi || (4) ||

<p. 557> tato vvirāḍajāyata vvirājo '(-)adhi pūruṣaḥ |
sa jāto atyaricyata paścādbhūmimatho puraḥ || (5) ||

tasmādyajñātsarvahutaḥ sambhṛtampṛṣadājyam |
paśū(/)stā(/)ścakre vāyavyānāraṇyā ggrāmyāśca ye || (6) ||

tasmādyajñātsarvahuta '(-)ṛcaḥ sāmāni jajñire |
chandāṃsi jajñire tasmādyajustasmādajāyata || (7) ||

tasmādaśvā '(-)ajāyanta ye ke cobhayādataḥ |
gāvo ha jajñire tasmāttasmājjātā '(-)ajāvayaḥ || (8) ||

ta(/) yyajñambarhiṣi praukṣanpuruṣañjātamagrataḥ |
tena devā '(-)ayajanta sāddhyā '(-)ṛṣayaśca ye || (9) ||

yatpuruṣa(/) vvyadadhuḥ katidhā vyakalpayan |
mukhaṅkimasyāsītkimbāhū kimūrū pādā '(-)ucyete || (10) ||

brāhmaṇo'sya mukhamāsīd bāhū rājanyaḥ kṛtaḥ |
ūrū tadasya yadvaiśyaḥ padbhyā(/) śūdro '(-)ajāyata || (11) ||

candramā manaso jātaścakṣoḥ sūryo '(-)ajāyata |
śrotrādvāyuśca prāṇaśca mukhādagnirajāyata || (12) ||

nābbhyā'(-)āsīdantarikṣaṃ śīrṣṣṇo dyauḥ samavarttata |
padbhyāmbhūmirddiśaḥ śrotrāttathā lokā(/) (2) || '(-)akalpayan || (13) ||

yatpuruṣeṇa haviṣā devā yajñamatanvata |
vasanto'syāsīdājyaṅgrīṣma '(-)idhmaḥ śaraddhaviḥ || (14) ||

saptāsyāsanparidhayastriḥ sapta samidhaḥ kṛtāḥ |
devā yadyajñantanvānā '(-)abadhnanpuruṣampaśum || (15) ||

yajñena yajñamayajanta devāstāni dharmāṇi prathamānyāsan |
te ha nākammahimānaḥ sacanta yatra pūrve sādhyāḥ santi devāḥ || (16) ||

atha tāntrikamantrāḥ 

paramānandabodhābdhinimagnanijamūrttaye |
sāṅgopāṅgamidaṃ snānaṅkalpayāmyahamīśa te || iti snānam ||

atha vāsaḥ ||

māyā(/) vvinā na te janma nijagūhorutejase |
nirāvaraṇavijñāya vāsaste kalpayāmyaham || iti vāsaḥ ||

yamāśritya mahāmāyā jagatsaṃmohinī tu sā |
tasmai te parameśāna kalpayāmyuttarīyakam ||

<p. 558> atha yajñasūtram ||

yasya śaktitrayeṇedaṃ samproktamakhilañjagat || yajñasūtrāya tasmai te 
yajñasūtramprakalpayet || iti yajñasūtram || atha bhūṣaṇam || 
svabhāvasundarāṅgāya satyāsatyāśrayāya te || bhūṣaṇāni vicitrāṇi 
kalpayāmi surārccita || iti bhūṣaṇam ||

atha jalam 

samastadevadeveśa sarvatṛptikaramparam ||
akhaṇḍānandasampūrṇaṅgṛhāṇa jalamuttamam || iti jalam ||

atha gandham 

paramānandasaurabhyaparipūrṇadigantaram |
gṛhāṇa paramaṅgandhaṃ kṛpayā parameśvara || iti gandham ||

atha puṣpam 

turīyaguṇasampanna(-)nānāguṇamanoharam |
ānandasaurabhampuṣpaṃ gṛhyatāmidamuttamam || iti puṣpam ||

atha dhūpaḥ 

vanaspatirasotpanno gandhāḍhyo gandha uttamaḥ |
āghreyaḥ sarvadevānāndhūpo'yampratigṛhyatām || iti dhūpaḥ ||

atha dīpaḥ 

suprakāśo mahādīpaḥ sarvatastimirāpahaḥ |
sabāhyābhyantarajyotirdīpoyampratigṛhyatām || iti dīpaḥ ||

atha naivedyam 

satpātrasiddhaṃ sa havirvividhānekabhakṣaṇam |
nivedayāmi deveśa sānugāya gṛhāṇa tat || iti naivedyam ||

athācamanārtthajalam 

samastadevadeveśa sarvajñaptikaramparam |
akhaṇḍānandasampūrṇaṃ gṛhāṇa jalamuttamam || iti jalam ||

atha tāmbūlam

tāmbūlañca varandivyaṅkarpūrādi suvāsitam |
mayāniveditambhaktyā gṛhāṇa parameśvara || iti tāmbūlam ||

iti pūjā


atha stotram

ādāya vedānsakalānsamudrānnihatya conmathya madhuṃ hyudagram |
dattāḥ purā yena pitāmahāya viṣṇuntamādyambhaja matsyarūpam || (1) ||

divyāmṛtārtthammathite mahābdhau devāsurairvāsukimandarābhyām |
bhūmermahāvegavidhūrṇitāyāntaṅkūrmamādhāragatannamāmi || (2) ||

samudrakāñcīsariduttarīyā vasundharāmerukirīṭabhārā |
daṃṣṭrāgato yena samuddhṛtā'bhūttamādikolaṃ śaraṇamprapadye || (3) ||

<p. 559> bhaktārttibhaṅgakṣamayādhipāya stambhāntarālādudito 
nṛsiṃhaḥ |
ripuṃ surāṇānniśitairnnakhāgrairvidārayantanna ca vismarāmi || (4) ||

catussamudrābharaṇādharitrīnyāsāya nālañcaraṇasya yasya |
ekasya nānyasya padaṃ surāṇāntrivikramaṃ sarvagatannamāmi || (5) ||

trissaptakṛtvo nṛpatīnnihatya yastarpaṇaṃ raktamayampitṛbhyaḥ |
cakāra dorddaṇḍabalena samyaktamādiśūrampraṇamāmi rāmam || (6) ||

kule raghūṇāṃ samavāpya janma vidhāya setuñjaladherjalāntaḥ |
laṅkeśvara(/) yyaḥ śamayāñcakāra sītāpatintampraṇamāmi bhaktyā || (7) ||

halena sarvānasurānnikṛṣya cakāra cūrṇammusalaprahāraiḥ |
yaḥ kṛṣṇamāsādya balambalīyānbhaktyā bhaje tambalabhadrarāmam || (8) ||

purā surāṇāmasurānvijetuṃ sambhāvayacchrīvaracihnaveṣam |
cakāra yaḥ śāstramamoghakalpantammūlabhūtampraṇato'smi buddham || 
(9) ||

kalpāvasāne nikhilaiḥ suraissvaissaṅghaṭṭayāmāsa nimeṣamātrāt | 
yastejasā svena dadāha bhīmo viśvātmakantanturagambhajāmaḥ || (10) ||

śaṅkhaṃ sucakraṃ sugadāṃ 
sarojandorbbhirddadhānaṅgaruḍādhirūḍham |
śrīvatsacihnañjagadādimūlantamālanīlaṃ hṛdi viṣṇumīḍe || (11) ||

kṣīrāmbudhau śeṣaviśeṣatalpe śayānamantaḥsmitaśobhivaktram |
utphullanetrāmbujamambudāmbhasāmādyaṃ śrutīnāmasakṛtsmarāmi || 
(12) ||

prīṇayedanayā stutyā jagannāthañjaganmayam |
dharmārtthakāmamokṣāṇāmāptaye puruṣottamam || (13) ||

iti śrīviṣṇustotraṃ samāptam ||


atha kavacam 

śrīnārada uvāca

bhagavansarvadharmajña kavaca(/) yyatprakāśitam |
trailokyamaṅgalannāma kṛpayā kathaya prabho || (1) ||

sanatkumāra uvāca

śṛṇu vakṣyāmi viprendra kavacamparamādbhutam |
nārāyaṇena kathitaṃ kṛpayā brahmaṇe purā || (2) ||

<p. 560> brahmaṇā kathitammahyamparaṃ snehādvadāmi te |
atiguhyatarantattvambrahmamantraughavigraham || (3) ||

yaddhṛtvā paṭhanādbrahmā sṛṣṭiṃ vvitanute dhruvam |
yaddhṛtvā paṭhanātpāti mahālakṣmīrjjagattrayam || (4) ||

paṭhanāddhāraṇācchambhuḥ saṃharttā sarvamantravit |
trailokyajananī durgā mahiṣādimahāsurān || (5) ||

varadṛptāñjaghānaiva paṭhanāddhāraṇādyataḥ |
evamindrādassarve sarvaiśvaryamavāpnuyuḥ || (6) ||

idaṅkavacamatyantaguptaṅkutrāpi no vadet |
śiṣyāya bhaktiyuktāya sādhakāya prakāśayet || (7) ||

śaṭhāya paraśiṣyāya dattvā mṛtyumavāpnuyāt |
trailokyamaṅgalasyāsya kavacasya prajāpatiḥ || (8) ||

ṛṣiśchandaśca gāyatrī devo nārāyaṇaḥ svayam |
dharmārtthakāmamokṣeṣu viniyogaḥ prakīrttitaḥ || (9) ||

praṇavo me śiraḥ pātu namo nārāyaṇāya ca |
bhālamme netrayugalamaṣṭārṇo bhaktimuktidaḥ || (10) ||

klīmpāyācchrotrayugmañcaikākṣarassarvamohanaḥ |
klīṃkṛṣṇāya sadā ghrāṇaṅgovindāyeti jihvikām ||
gopījanapada(/) vvallabhāya svāhānanammama || (11) ||

aṣṭādaśākṣaro mantraḥ kaṃṭhampātu daśākṣaraḥ || (12) ||

gopījanapada(/) vvallabhāya svāhā bhujadvayam |
klīṃglauṃklīṃśyāmalāṅgāya namaḥ skandhau daśākṣaraḥ || (13) ||

klīṃkṛṣṇaḥ klīṃ karau pāyātklīṃkṛṣṇāyāṅgato'vatu |
hṛdayambhuvaneśānī klīṃkṛṣṇāya klīṃ stanau mama || (14) ||

gopālāyāgnijāyāntaṅkukṣiyugmaṃ sadāvatu |
klīṃkṛṣṇāya sadā pātu pārśśvayugmamanuttamaḥ || (15) ||

kṛṣṇagovindakau kaṭyāṃ smarādyau ṅeyutau manuḥ |
aṣṭākṣaraḥ pātu nābhiṃ kṛṣṇeti dvyakṣakṣaro'vatu || (16) ||

pṛṣṭhaṃ klīṃkṛṣṇakaṅkālaṃ klīṃkṛṣṇāya dviṭhāntakaḥ |
sakthinī satatampātu śrīṃhrīṃklīṃ kṛṣṇa ṭhadvayam || (17) ||

ūrūsaptākṣaraḥ pāyāttrayodaśākṣaro'vatu |
śrīṃhrīṃklīṃpadato gopījanavallabha dantataḥ || (18) ||

<p. 561> bhāya svāheti pāyuṃ vai klīṃhrīṃśrīṃ sadaśārṇakaḥ |
jānunī ca sadā pātu hrīṃśrīṃklīṃ ca daśākṣaraḥ || (19) ||

trayodaśākṣaraḥ pātu jaṅghe cakrādyudāyudhaḥ |
aṣṭādaśākṣaro hrīṃśrīṃpūrvako viṃśadarṇakaḥ || (20) ||

sarvāṅgamme  sadā pātu dvārakānāyako balī |
namo bhagavate paścādvāsudevāya tatparam || (21) ||

tārādyo dvādaśārṇo'yamprācyāmmāṃ sarvadā'vatu |
śrīṃhrīṃklīṃ ca daśārṇastu klīṃhrīṃśrīṃ ṣoḍaśārṇakaḥ || (22) ||

gadādyudāyudho viṣṇummāmamagnerddiśi rakṣatu |
hrīṃśrīṃ daśākṣaro mantro dakṣiṇe māṃ sadā'vatu || (23) ||

tāro namo bhagavate rukmiṇīvallabhāya ca |
svāheti ṣoḍaśārṇo'yannairṛtyāndiśi rakṣatu || (24) ||

klīṃhṛṣīkeśadeśāya namo mā(/) vāruṇe'vatu |
aṣṭadaśārṇaḥ kāmānto vāyavye māṃ sadāvatu || (25) ||

śrīṃmāyākāmakṛṣṇāya hrīṃgovindāya dviṭho manuḥ |
dvādaśārṇātmako viṣṇuruttare māṃ sadāvatu || (26) ||

vāgbhāvaṅkāmaṃ kṛṣṇāya hrīṃgovindāya tatparam |
śrīṃgopījanavallabhānte bhāya svāhā hsaustataḥ || (27) ||

dvāviṃśatyakṣaro mantro māmaiśānye sadāvatu |
kāliyasya phaṇāmadhye divyannṛtyaṅkaroti tam || (28) ||

namāmi devakīputrannṛtyarājānamacyutam |
dvātriṃśadakṣaro mantro'pyadho māṃ sarvadāvatu || (29) ||

kāmadevāya vidmahe puṣpabāṇāya dhīmahi |
tanno'naṅgaḥ pracodayādeṣā māmpātu corddhvataḥ || (30) ||

iti te kathita(/) vvipra brahmamantraughavigraham |
trailokyamaṅgalannāma kavacambrahmarūpakam || (31) ||

brahmaṇā kathitampūrvannārāyaṇamukhāccyutam |
tava snehānmamā'khyātampravaktavyanna kasyacit || (32) ||

gurumpraṇamya vidhivatkavacamprapaṭhettataḥ |
sakṛddvistriryathājñānaṃ so'pi sarvatapomayaḥ || (33) ||

mantreṣu sakaleṣveva deśiko nātra saṃśayaḥ |
śatamaṣṭottarañcāsya puraścaryāvidhiḥ smṛtaḥ || (34) ||

<p. 562> havanādīndaśāṃśena kṛtvā tatsādhayeddhruvam |
yadi syātsiddhakavaco viṣṇureva bhavetsvayam || (35) ||

mantrasiddhirbbhavettasya puraścaryāvidhānataḥ |
sparddhāmudbhūya satata(/) lakṣmīrvāṇī vasettataḥ || (36) ||

puṣpāñjalyaṣṭakandatvā mūlenaiva paṭhetsakṛt |
daśavarṣasahasrāṇāmpūjāyāḥ phalamāpnuyāt || (37) ||

bhūrjje vilikhya guṭikāṃ svarṇasthāndhārayedyadi |
kaṇṭhe vā dakṣiṇe bāhau so'pi viṣṇurnna saṃśayaḥ || (38) ||

aśvamedhasahasrāṇi vājapeyaśatāni ca |
mahādānādi yānyeva prādakṣiṇyambhuvastathā || (39) ||

kalānnārhanti tānyeva sakṛduccāraṇāttataḥ |
kavacasya prasādena jīvanmukto bhavennaraḥ || (40) ||

trailokyaṅkṣobhayatyeva trailokyavijayī bhavet |
idaṅkavacamajñātvā yajedyaḥ puruṣottamam || 
śatalakṣaprajapto'pi na mantrastasya siddhyati || (41) ||

iti kavacaṃ samāptam ||


atha hṛdayam 

ācamya prāṇānāyamya deśakālau smṛtvā mamābhīṣṭasiddhyartthaṃ 
saṅkalīkaraṇarītyā sampūṭīkaraṇarītyā vā nārāyaṇahṛdayasya 
sakṛdāvarttanaṅkariṣye ||

asya śrīnārāyaṇahṛdayastotramantrasya(,) bhārggavaṛṣiḥ(,) anuṣṭupchandaḥ(,) 
śrīlakṣmīnārāyaṇo devatā(,) oṃbījam(,) namaḥ śaktiḥ(,) nārāyaṇāyeti 
kīlakam(,) śrīlakṣmīnārāyaṇaprītyartthe jape viniyogaḥ ||

oṃ nārāyaṇaḥ parañjyotirityaṅguṣṭhābhyānnamaḥ(,) 
oṃ nārāyaṇaḥ parabrahmeti tarjjanībhyāṃ(,) 
oṃ nārāyaṇaḥ paro deva itimadhyamābhyāṃ(,) 
oṃ nārāyaṇaḥ paro dhyāteti anāmikābhyā(0,) 
oṃ nārāyaṇaḥ parandhāmeti kani(0,) oṃ nārāyaṇaḥ paro dharma iti 
karatalakara(0,) evaṃ hṛdayādi || atha digbandhaḥ || oṃ aiṃddryādi daśa diśam 
|| 'oṃ namaḥ sudarśanāya sahasrārāya hūmphaṭ badhnāmi namaścakrāya 
svāhā' iti pratidiśaṃ yojyam ||

<p. 563> atha dhyānam || udyadādityasaṅkāśampītavāsasamacyutam |
śaṅkhacakragadāpāṇindhyāyellakṣmīpatiṃ harim |

'oṃ namo nārāyaṇāya' iti japaḥ || atha mūlāṣṭakam ||

oṃ nārāyaṇaḥ parañjyotirātmā nārāyaṇaḥ paraḥ ||

nārāyaṇaḥ parabrahma nārāyaṇa namostu te || (1) ||

nārāyaṇaḥ paro devo dātā nārāyaṇaḥ paraḥ |
nārāyaṇaḥ paro dhyātā nārāyaṇa namo'stu te || (2) ||

nārāyaṇaḥ parandhāma dhyānannārāyaṇaḥ paraḥ |
nārāyaṇaḥ paro dharmmo nārāyaṇa namo'stu te || (3) ||

nārāyaṇaparo vedo vidyā nārāyaṇaḥ parā |
viśvannārāyaṇassākṣānnārāyaṇa namo'stu te || (4) ||

nārāyaṇādvidhirjjāto jāto nārāyaṇācchivaḥ |
jāto nārāyaṇādindro nārāyaṇa namo'stu te || (5) ||

ravirnnārāyaṇantejaścāndrannārāyaṇammahaḥ |
vahnirnnārāyaṇaḥ sākṣānnārāyaṇa namo'stu te || (6) ||

nārāyaṇa upāsyaḥ syādgururnnārāyaṇaḥ paraḥ |
nārāyaṇaḥ paro bodho nārāyaṇa namo'stu te || (7) ||

nārāyaṇaḥ phalammukhyaṃ siddhirnnārāyaṇaḥ sukham |
sevyo nārāyaṇaśśuddho nārāyaṇa namo'stu te || (8) ||

iti mūlāṣṭakam || atha prārthanādaśakam ||

nārāyaṇastvamevāsi daharākhye hṛdi sthitaḥ |
prerakaḥ preryamāṇānāntvayā preritamānasaḥ || (1) ||

tvadājñāṃ śirasā dhṛtvā japāmi janapāvanam |
nānopāsanamārgāṇāmbhāvahṛdbhāvabodhakaḥ || (2) ||

bhāvārtthakṛdbhāvabhūto bhāvasaukhyaprado bhava |
tvanmāyāmohita(/) vviśvantvayaiva parikalpitam || (3) ||

tvadadhiṣṭhānamātreṇa saiṣā sarvārthakāriṇī |
tvameva tāmpuraskṛtya mama kāmānsamarppaya || (4) ||

na me tvadanyastrātāsti tvadanyanna hi daivatam |
tvadanyanna hi jānāmi pālakampuṇyarūpakam || (5) ||

yāvatsāṃsāriko bhāvo manaḥstho bhāvanātmakaḥ |
<p. 564> tāvatsiddhirbhavetsādhyā sarvathā sarvadā vibho || (6) ||

pāpināmahamevāgryo dayālūnāntvamagraṇīḥ |
dayanīyo madanyo'sti tava ko'tra jagattraye || (7) ||

tvayāpyahanna sṛṣṭaścenna syāttava dayālutā |
āmayo naiva sṛṣṭaścedauṣadhasya vṛthodayaḥ || (8) ||

pāpasaṅghaparikrāntaḥ pāpātmā pāparūpadhṛk |
tvadanyaḥ ko'tra pāpebhyastrātā me jagatītale || (9) ||

tvameva mātā ca pitā tvameva tvameva bandhuśca sakhā tvameva |
tvameva vidyā ca gurustvameva tvameva sarvammama devadeva || (10) ||

prārtthanādaśakañcaiva mūlāṣṭakamudāhṛtam |
yaḥ paṭhecchṛṇuyānnityaṃ tasya lakṣmīḥ sthirā bhavet || (11) ||

nārāyaṇasya hṛdayaṃ sarvābhīṣṭaphalapradam |
lakṣmīhṛdayakaṃ stotra(/) yyadi cettadvinā kṛtam || (12) ||

tatsarvanniṣphalamprokta(/) lakṣmīḥ kruddhyati sarvadā |
etatsaṅkalitaṃ stotraṃ sarvakarmaphalapradam || (13) ||

lakṣmīhṛdayakañcaiva tathā nārāyaṇātmakam |
japedyaḥ saṅkalīkṛtya sarvābhīṣṭamavāpnuyāt || (14) ||

nārāyaṇasya hṛdayamādau japtvā tataḥ param |
lakṣmīhṛdayakaṃ stotrañjapennārāyaṇampunaḥ || (15) ||

punarnnārāyaṇañjaptvā punarllakṣmīkṛtañjapet |
punarnnārāyaṇañjāpyaṃ saṅkalīkaraṇambhavet || (16) ||

evammadhye dvivāreṇa japetsaṅkalitaṃ hi tat |
lakṣmīhṛdayakaṃ stotraṃ sarvakāmaprakāśitam || (17) ||

tadvajjapādikaṅkuryādetatsaṅkalitaṃ śubham |
sarvānkāmānavāpnoti ādhivyādhibhayaṃ haret || (18) ||

gopyametatsadā kuryānna sarvatra prakāśayet |
iti guhyatamaṃ śāstramprāptambrahmādikaiḥ purā || (19) ||

tasmātsarvaprayatnena gopayet sādhayetsudhīḥ |
yatraitatpustakantiṣṭhellakṣmīnārāyaṇātmakam || (20) ||

bhūtapaiśācavetālā na sthirāstatra sarvadā |
lakṣmīhṛdayakamprokta(/) vvidhinā sādhayetsudhīḥ || (21) ||

bhṛguvāre ca rātrau ca pūjayetpustakadvayam |
sarvasvaṃ sarvadā satyaṅgopayetsādhayetsudhīḥ || (22) ||

<p. 565> gopanātsādhanālloke dhanyo bhavati tattvataḥ || (23) ||

ityatharvaṇarahasye uttarabhāge śrīnārāyaṇahṛdayaṃ sampūrṇam ||



athopaniṣat 

kaśyapa uvāca

ekaśṛṅga vṛṣasindho vṛṣākape suravṛṣa anādisambhava rudra kapila 
viṣvaksena sarvabhūtapate dhruvadharma vaikuṇṭha vṛṣāvartta 
anādimadhyanidhana dhanañjaya śuciśravaḥ pṛśnitejaḥ nijajaya 
amṛtaśaya sanātana tridhāman tuṣita mahātattva lokanātha padmanābha 
virañca bahurūpa akṣaya akṣara havyabhuk khaṇḍaparaśo śakra 
muñjakeśa haṃsa mahādakṣiṇa hṛṣīkeśa sūkṣma mahāniyamadhara 
virajaḥ lokapratiṣṭha arūpa agraja dharmaja dharmanābha havyabhuk 
gabhastinātha śatakratunātha candraratha sūryatejaḥ samudravāsaḥ aja 
sahasraśiraḥ sahasrapāda ayomukha mahāpuruṣa puruṣottama sahasrabāho 
sahasramūrtte sahasrāsya sahasrasambhava viśvantvāmāhuḥ ||

puṣpahāsacarama tvameva vauṣaṭ vaṣaṭkārastvāmāhuramyamakheṣu 
praśitāram || 

śatadhāraṃ sahasradhāraṃ babhūva ||
bhūvandya bhūnātha bhṛguputra vedavedya brahmaśaya brāhmaṇapriya 
tvameva dyaurasi mātariśvāsi dharmosi hotā potā hantā mantā netā 
homahetustvameva ||

agryaśca dhāmnāṃ tvameva ṛgbhiḥ subhāṇḍa ijyo'si sumedhosi 
samidhastvameva matirgatirddātā tvamasi mokṣo'si yogo'si sṛjasi dhātā 
paramayajño'si somosi dīkṣito'si dakṣiṇāsi viśvamasi ||
sthavira hiraṇyagarbbha nārāyaṇa trinayana ādivarṇa ādityatejaḥ 
mahāpuruṣa puruṣottama ādideva bhūmikrama trivikrama prabhākara 
śambho svayambhū bhūtādimahābhūto'si || viśvabhūta viśvaṃ 
tvameva viśvagoptāsi pavitramasi viśvabhava ūrddhvakarman amṛta 
divaspate vācaspate ghṛtārcce anantakarma vaṃśaprāgvaṃśadhīḥ 
tvamaśvamedhaḥ varārtthinā(/) vvarado'si tvam || 

<p. 566> caturbbhiśca caturbbhiśca dvābhyāmpañcabhireva ca | hūyate ca 
punarddvābhyāntubhyaṃ hotrātmane namaḥ || ityupaniṣatsamāptā ||


athāṣṭottaraśatanāma 

aṣṭottaraśatannāmnā(/) vviṣṇoratulatejasaḥ |
yasya śravaṇamātreṇa naro nārāyaṇo bhavet || (1) ||

viṣṇurjjiṣṇurvaṣaṭkāro devadevo vṛṣākapiḥ |
dāmodaro dīnabandhurādidevo ditessutaḥ || (2) ||

puṇḍarīkaḥ parānandaḥ paramātmā parātparaḥ |
paraśudhārī viśvātmā kṛṣṇaḥ kālīmalāpahaḥ || (3) ||

kaustubhodbhāsitorasko naro nārāyaṇo hariḥ |
haro harapriyaḥ svāmī vaikuṇṭho viśvatomukhaḥ || (4) ||

hṛṣīkeśo'prameyātmā varāho dharaṇīdharaḥ |
vāmano vedavaktā ca vāsudevassanātanaḥ || (5) ||

rāmo virāmo virajo rāvaṇārī ramāpatiḥ |
vaikuṇṭhavāsī vasumān dhanado dharaṇīdharaḥ || (6) ||

dharmeśo dharaṇīnātho dhyeyo dharmabhṛtā(/)vvaraḥ |
sahasraśīrṣāpuruṣaḥ sahasrākṣassahasrapāt || (7) ||

sarvagaḥ sarvavitsarvaḥ śaraṇyaḥ sādhuvallabhaḥ |
kausalyānandanaśśrīmānkṣaḥkulavināśakaḥ || (8) ||

jagatkarttā jagaddharttā jagajjetā janārttihā |
jānakīvallabho devo devo jayarūpo jaleśvaraḥ || (9) ||

kṣīrābdhivāsī kṣīrābdhitanayāvallabhastathā |
śeṣaśāyī pannagārivāhano viṣṭaraśravāḥ || (10) ||

mādhavo mathurānātho mohado mohanāśanaḥ |
daityāriḥ puṇḍarīkākṣo hyacyuto madhusūdanaḥ || (11) ||

somasūryāgninayano nṛsiṃho bhaktavatsalaḥ |
nityo nirāmayaśśuddho naradevo jagatprabhuḥ || (12) ||

hayagrīvo jitaripurupendro rukmiṇīpatiḥ |
sarvadevamayaḥ śrīśaḥ sarvādhāraḥ sanātanaḥ || (13) ||

saumyaḥ saumyapradaḥ sraṣṭā viṣvakseno janārddanaḥ |
yaśodātanayo yogī yogaśāstraparāyaṇaḥ || (14) ||

rudrātmako rudramūrttī rāghavo madhusūdanaḥ |
iti te kathitandivyannāmnāmaṣṭottaraṃ śatam || (15) ||

<p. 567> sarvapāpaharampuṇya(/) vviṣṇoramitatejasaḥ |
duḥkhadāridryadaurbhāgyanāśanaṃ sukhavarddhanam || (16) ||

sarvasampatkaraṃ saumyammahāpātakanāśanam |
prātarutthāya viprendra paṭhedekāgramānasaḥ || (17) ||
tasya naśyanti vipadāṃ rāśayaḥ siddhimāpnuyāt || (17) ||

ityaṣṭottaraśatanāmastotraṃ sampūrṇam ||


atha sahasranāma 

śrīmahādeva uvāca 

brahmahatyāsahasrāṇāmpāpaṃ śāmyetkathañcana |
na punastvayyavijñāte kalpakoṭiśatairapi || (1) ||

yasmānmayā kṛtā sparddhā pavitraṃ syātkathaṃ hare |
naśyanti sarvapāpāni tanmāṃ vada sureśvara || (2) ||

tadāha devo govindo mama prītyā yathāyatham || (3) ||

śrībhagavānuvāca

sadā nāma sahasramme pāvanammatpadāvaham |
tatparo'nudinaṃ śambho sarvaiśvarya(/) yyadīcchasi || (4) ||

śrīmahādeva uvāca 

tameva tapasā nityambhajāmi staumi cintaye | tenādvitīyamahimo 
jagatpūjyo'smi pārvati || (5) ||

śrīpārvatyuvāca

tanme kathaya deveśa yathāha mayī śaṅkara |
śarveśvarī nirupamā tava syāṃ sadṛśī prabho || (6) ||

śrīmahādeva uvāca

sādhu sādhu tvayā pṛṣṭo viṣṇorbbhagavataśśive |
nāmnāṃ sahasra(/) vvakṣyāmi mukhyantrailokyamaṅgalam || (7) ||

nārāyaṇāya puruṣottamāya ca namo mahātmane |
viśuddhasadmādhiṣṭhāya mahāhaṃsāya dhīmahi || (8) ||

oṃ asya śrīviṣṇoḥ sahasranāmamantrasya mahādeva ṛṣiḥ(,) paramātmā 
devatā(,) sūryakoṭipratīkāśa itibījam(,) gaṅgātīrthottamā śaktiḥ(,) 
prapannāśanipañjara itikīlakam(,) vāsudevamparambrahma 
ityaṅguṣṭhābhyānnamaḥ || 

mūlaprakṛtiriti tarjjanībhyānnamaḥ ||

bhūmahāvarāha itimadhyamābhyānnamaḥ ||

sūryavaṃśadhvajo rāma anāmikābhyānnamaḥ ||

brahmādikamalādi gadāsūryakeśavamiti kaniṣṭhābhyānnamaḥ ||

<p. 568> śeṣa itikaratalakarapṛṣṭhābhyānnamaḥ ||

divyāstra ityastram ||

sarvapāpakṣayārtthaṃ sarvābhīṣṭasiddhyartthaṃ || 
śrīviṣṇornnāmasahasraṃ jape viniyogaḥ ||


atha dhyānam 

viṣṇuṃ 
bhāsvatkirīṭāṅgadavalayagaṇākalpahārodarāṅghriśroṇībhūṣaṃ 
suvakṣomaṇimakaramahākuṃḍalammaṇḍitāṃsam |
hastodyaccakraśaṅkhāmbujagadamamalampītakauśeyavāsovidyudbhāsaṃ 
samudyaddinakarasadṛśampadmahastannamāmi || (9) ||

oṃ vāsudevaḥ parambrahma paramātmā parātparam |
parandhāma parañjyotiḥ parantattvamparampadam || (10) ||

paraṃ śivamparo dhyeyaḥ paraṃ jñānamparā gatiḥ |
paramārtthaḥ paraṃ śreyaḥ parānandaḥ parodayaḥ || (11) ||

paro vyaktaḥ para(/) vvyoma parārddhaḥ parameśvaraḥ |
nirāmayo nirvikāro nirvikalpo nirāśrayaḥ || (12) ||

nirañjano nirālambo nirllepo niravagrahaḥ |
nirguṇo niṣkalo'nanto'cintyo'sāvacalo'cyutaḥ || (13) ||

atīndriyo'mito'rodhyo'nīho'nīśo'vyayo'kṣayaḥ |
sarvajñaḥ sarvagaḥ sarvaḥ sarvadaḥ sarvabhāvanaḥ || (14) ||

sarvaśśaṃbhussarvasākṣīpūjyassarvasya sarvadṛk |
sarvaśaktiḥ sarvasāraḥ sarvātmā sarvatomukhaḥ || (15) ||

sarvāvāsaḥ sarvarūpaḥ sarvādissarvaduḥkhahā |
sarvārtthaḥ sarvatobhadraḥ sarvakāraṇakāraṇam || (16) ||

sarvātiśāyakaḥ sarvādhyakṣaḥ sarveśvareśvaraḥ |
ṣaḍviṃśako mahāviṣṇurmahāguhyo mahāhariḥ || (17) ||

nityodito nityayukto nityānandaḥ sanātanaḥ |
māyāpatiryogapatiḥ kaivalyapatirātmabhūḥ || (18) ||

janmamṛtyujarātītaḥ kalātīto bhavātigaḥ |
pūrṇassatyaśśuddhabuddhasvarūpo nityacinmayaḥ || (19) ||

yogipriyo yogamayo bhavabandhaikamocakaḥ |
purāṇaḥ puruṣaḥ pratyakcaitanyapuruṣottamaḥ || (20) ||

vedāntavedyo durjñeyastāpatrayavivarjjitaḥ |
brahmavidyāśrayo'laṅghyaḥ svaprakāśaḥ svayamprabhaḥ || (21) ||

sarvopeya udāsīnaḥ praṇavassarvatassamaḥ |
<p. 569> sarvānavadyo duṣprāpasturīyastamasaḥ paraḥ || (22) ||

kūṭasthaḥ sarvasaṃśliṣṭo vāṅmanogocarātigaḥ |
saṅkarṣaṇaḥ sarvaharaḥ kālaḥ sarvabhayaṅkaraḥ || (23) ||

anullaṅghyaḥ sarvagatirmmahārudro durāsadaḥ |
mūlaprakṛtirānandaḥ prajñātā viśvamohanaḥ || (24) ||

mahāmāyo viśvabījamparaśaktisukhaikabhuk |
sarvakāmyo'naṃtaśīlassarvabhūtavaśaṅkaraḥ || (25) ||

aniruddhaḥ sarvajīvo hṛsīkeśo manaḥpatiḥ |
nirupādhiḥ priyo haṃso'kṣaraḥ sarvaniyojakaḥ || (26) ||

brahmāprāṇeśvaraḥ sarvabhūtabhṛddehanāyakaḥ |
kṣetrajñaḥ prakṛtisvāmī puruṣo viśvasūtradhṛk || (27) ||

antaryāmī tridhāmā'ntaḥsākṣī triguṇa īśvaraḥ |
yogamṛgyaḥ padmanābhaḥ śeṣaśāyī śriyaḥ patiḥ || (28) ||

śrīsatyopāsyapādābjo'nantaḥ śrīḥ śrīniketanaḥ |
nityavakṣaḥsthalaśrīḥ śrīnidhiḥ śrīdharo hariḥ || (29) ||

ramyaśrīrnniścayaśrīdo viṣṇuḥ kṣīrābdhimandiraḥ |
kaustubhodbhāsitorasko mādhavo jagadārttihā || (30) ||

śrīvatsavakṣā niḥsīmaḥ kalyāṇaguṇabhājanam |
pītāmbaro jagannātho jagaddhātā jagatpitā || (31) ||

jagadbandhurjjagatsraṣṭā jagatkarttā jagannidhiḥ |
jagadekasphuradvīryo nāha(/)vvādī jaganmayaḥ || (32) ||

sarvāścaryamayassarvasiddhārtthaḥ sarvavīrajit |
sarvāmoghodyamo brahmarudrādyutkṛṣṭacetanaḥ || (33) ||

śambhoḥ pitāmaho brahmapitā śakrādyadhīśvaraḥ |
sarvadevapriyaḥ sarvadevavṛttiranuttamaḥ || (34) ||

sarvadevaikaśaraṇaṃ sarvadevaikadaivatam |
yajñabhugyajñaphalado yajñeśo yajñabhāvanaḥ || (35) ||

yajñatrātā yajñapumānvanamālī dvijapriyaḥ |
dvijaikamānado hiṃsraḥ kuladevo'surāntakaḥ || (36) ||

sarvaduṣṭāntakṛtsarvasajjanānandapālakaḥ |
sarvalokaikajaṭharaḥ sarvalokaikamaṇḍalaḥ || (37) ||

sṛṣṭisthityantakṛccakrī śārṅgadhanvā gadādharaḥ |
śaṅkhabhṛnnandakīpadmapāṇirggaruḍavāhanaḥ || (38) ||

<p. 570> anirddeśyavapuḥ sarvaḥ sarvalokaikapāvanaḥ |
anantakīrttirniḥśrīśaḥ pauruṣaḥ sarvamaṅgalaḥ || (39) ||

sūryakoṭipratīkāśo yamakoṭivināśanaḥ |
brahmakoṭijagatsraṣṭā vāyukoṭimahābalaḥ || (40) ||

koṭīndujagadānandī śambhukoṭimaheśvaraḥ |
kuberakoṭilakṣmīvāñchatrukoṭivināśanaḥ || (41) ||

kandarpakoṭilāvaṇyo durgakoṭivimarddanaḥ |
samudrakoṭigambhīrastīrtthakoṭisamāhvayaḥ || (42) ||

himavatkoṭiniṣkampaḥ koṭibrahmāṇḍavigrahaḥ |
koṭyaśvamedhapāpaghno yajñakoṭisamārccanaḥ || (43) ||

sudhākoṭisvāsthyahetuḥ kāmadhukkoṭikāmadaḥ |
brahmavidyākoṭirūpaḥ śipiviṣṭaḥ śuciśravāḥ || (44) ||

viśvambharastīrthapādaḥ puṇyaśravaṇakīrttanaḥ |
ādidevo jagajjaitro mukundaḥ kālanemihā || (45) ||

vaikuṇṭho'nantamāhātmyo mahāyogīśvareśvaraḥ |
nityatṛpto nṛsadbhāvo niḥśaṅko narakāntakaḥ || (46) ||

dīnānāthaikaśaraṇa(/) vviśvaikavyasanāpahā |
jagatkṣamākṛto nityaḥ kṛpāluḥ sajjanāśrayaḥ || (47) ||

yogeśvaraḥ sadodīrṇo vṛddhikṣayavivarjitaḥ |
adhokṣajo viśvaretāḥ prajāpatisamādhipaḥ || (48) ||

śakrabrahmārccitapadaḥ śaṃbhubrahmorddhvadhāmagaḥ |
sūryasomekṣaṇo viśvabhoktā sarvasya pāragaḥ || (49) ||

jagatseturddharmaseturddhīro'riṣṭadhurandharaḥ |
nirmmamo'khilalokeśo niḥsaṅgo'dbhutabhogavān || (50) ||

ramyamāyo viśvaviśvo viṣvakseno nagottamaḥ |
sarvaḥ śriyaḥ patirddevyāḥ sarvabhūṣaṇabhūṣitaḥ || (51) ||

sarvalakṣaṇalakṣaṇyaḥ sarvadaityendradarpahā |
samastadevasarvajñaḥ sarvadaivatanāyakaḥ || (52) ||

samastadevatādurgaḥ prapannāśanipañjaraḥ |
samastadevakavacaṃ sarvadevaśiromaṇiḥ || (53) ||

samastabhavanirbbhinno bhagavānbiṣṭaraśravāḥ |
vibhussarvahito'pyarko hatāriḥ suratipradaḥ || (54) ||

sarvadaivatajīveśo brāhmaṇādiniyojakaḥ |
brahmāśambhuparārddhāḍhyo brahmajyeṣṭhaḥ śiśuḥ svarāṭ || (55) ||

<p. 571> virāḍbhaktaparādhīnaḥ stutyaḥ sarvārtthasādhakaḥ |
sarvārtthakarttā kṛtyajñaḥ svārtthakṛtyasadojjhitaḥ || (56) ||

sadānavassadābhadraḥ sadāśāntaḥ sadāśivaḥ |
sadāpriyaḥ sadātuṣṭaḥ sadāpuṣṭaḥ sadārccitaḥ || (57) ||

sadāpūtaḥ pāvanāgro vedaguhyo vṛṣākapiḥ |
sahasranāmā triyugaścatummūrttiścaturbbhujaḥ || (58) ||

bhūtabhavyabhavannātho mahāpuruṣapūrvataḥ |
nārāyaṇo muñjakeśaḥ sarvayogavinissṛtaḥ || (59) ||

vedasāro yajñasāraḥ sāmasārastaponidhiḥ |
sādhyaśreṣṭhapurāṇarṣirniṣṭhāśāntiparāyaṇaḥ || (60) ||

śivastriśūlavidhvaṃsī śrīkaṇṭhaikavarapradaḥ |
narakṛṣṇo harirddharmanandano dharmajīvanaḥ || (61) ||

ādikarttā sarvasatyaḥ sarvastrīratnadarpahā |
vikālo jitakandarpa urvvaśīdṛṅmunīśvaraḥ || (62) ||

ādyakavirhayagrīvaḥ sarvavāgīśvareśvaraḥ |
sarvadevamayo brahmagururvāggmīśvarīpatiḥ || (63) ||

anantavidyāprabhavo mūlāvidyāvināśakaḥ |
sarvārhaṇo jagajjāḍyanāśako madhusūdanaḥ || (64) ||

anantamantrakoṭīśaḥ śabdabrahmaikapāvakaḥ |
ādividvānvedakarttā vedātmā śrutisāgaraḥ || (65) ||

brahmārtthavedābharaṇaḥ sarvavijñānajanmabhuḥ |
vidyārājo jñānarājo jñānasindhurakhaṇḍadhīḥ || (66) ||

matsyadevo mahāśṛṅkho jagadbījavihitradhṛk |
līlāvyāptānilāmbhodhiścaturvedapravarttakaḥ || (67) ||

ādikūrmo'khilādhārastṛṇīkṛtajagadbhavaḥ |
amarīkṛtadevaughaḥ pīyūṣotpattikāraṇam || (68) ||

ātmādhāro dharādhāro yajñāṅgo dharaṇīdharaḥ |
hiraṇyākṣaharaḥ pṛthvīpatiḥ śrāddhādikalpakaḥ || (69) ||

samastapitṛbhītighnaḥ samastapitṛjīvanam |
havyakavyaikabhugbhavyo guṇabhavyaikadāyakaḥ || (70) ||

lomāntalīnajaladhiḥ kṣobhitāśeṣasāgaraḥ |
mahāvarāho yajñaghnadhvaṃsano yājñikāśrayaḥ || (71) ||

narasiṃho divyasiṃhaḥ sarvāriṣṭārttiduḥkhahā |
<p. 572> ekavīro'dbhutabalo yantramantraikabhañjanam || (72) ||

brahmādiduḥsahajyotiryugāntāgnyatibhīṣaṇaḥ |
koṭivajrādhikanakho gajaduṣprekṣamūrttidhṛk || (73) ||

mātṛcakrapramathano mahāmātṛgaṇeśvaraḥ |
acintyo'moghavīryāḍhyaḥ samastāsuraghasmaraḥ || (74) ||

hiraṇyakaśipucchedī kālaḥ saṅkarṣaṇaḥ patiḥ |
kṛtāntavāhanaḥ sadyaḥsamastabhayanāśanaḥ || (75) ||

sarvavighnāntakaḥ sarvasiddhidaḥ sarvapūrakaḥ |
samastapātakadhvaṃsī siddhamantrādhikāhvayaḥ || (76) ||

bhairaveśo harārttighnaḥ kālakalpo durāsadaḥ |
daityagarbbhasrāvināmā sphuṭabrahmāṇḍavarjjitaḥ || (77) ||

smṛtimātrākhilatrātā bhūtarūpo mahāhariḥ |
brahmacarmaśiraḥ paṭṭadikpālo'rddhāṅgabhūṣaṇaḥ || (78) ||

dvādaśārkaśirodhāmā rudraśīrṣaikanūpuraḥ |
yoginīgrastagirijārato bhairavatarjjakaḥ || (79) ||

vīracakreśvaro'tyugro yamāriḥ kālasa(/)vvaraḥ |
krodheśvaro rudracaṇḍīparivādī suduṣṭabhāk || (80) ||

sarvākṣaḥ sarvamṛtyuśca mṛtyurmmṛtyunivarttakaḥ |
asādhyassarvarogaghnaḥ sarvadurgrahasaumyakṛt || (81) ||

gaṇeśakoṭidarpaghno duḥsaho'śeṣagotrahā |
devadānavadurddharṣo jagadbhakṣyapradaḥ pitā || (82) ||

samastadurgatitrātā jagadbhakṣakabhakṣakaḥ |
ugreśo'suramārjjāraḥ kālamūṣakabhakṣakaḥ || (83) ||

anantāyudhadorddaṇḍo nṛsiṃho vīrabhadrajit |
yoginīcakraguhyeśaḥ śakrāriḥ paśumāṃsabhuk || (84) ||

rudro nārāyaṇo meṣarūpaśaṅkaravāhanaḥ |
meṣarūpī śivatrātā duṣṭaśaktisahasrabhuk || (85) ||

tulasīvallabho vīro'cintyamāyo'khileṣṭadaḥ |
mahāśivaḥ śivo rudro bhairavaikakapālabhṛt || (86) ||

bhillaścakreśvaraścakro divyamohanarūpadhṛk |
gaurīsaubhāgyado māyānidhirmmāyābhayāpahaḥ || (87) ||

brahmatejomayo brahmaśrīmayaśca trayīmayaḥ |
subrahmaṇyo balidhvaṃsī vāmano'ditiduḥkhahā || (88) ||

upendro nṛpatirviṣṇuḥ kaśyapānvayamaṇḍanaḥ |
<p. 573> balisvarājyadaḥ sarvadevaviprātmadocyutaḥ || (89) ||

urukramastīrtthapādastridaśaśca trivikramaḥ |
vyomapādaḥ svapādāmbhaḥpavitritajagattrayaḥ || (90) ||

brahmeśādyābhivandyāṅghrirddrutakarmā'dridhāraṇaḥ |
acintyādbhutavistāro viśvavṛkṣo mahābalaḥ || (91) ||

bahumūrddhāparāṅgacchid bhṛgupatnīśiroharaḥ |
pāpasteyaḥ sadāpuṇyo daityeśo nityakhaṇḍakaḥ || (92) ||

pūritākhiladeveśo viśvārtthaikāvatārakṛt |
amaro nityaguptātmā bhaktacintāmaṇiḥ sadā || (93) ||

varadaḥ kārttavīryādirājarājyaprado'naghaḥ |
viśvaślāghyo'mitācāro dattātreyo munīśvaraḥ || (94) ||

paraśaktisamāyukto yogānandamadonmadaḥ |
samastendrāritejohṛtparamānandapādapaḥ || (95) ||

anasūyāgarbbharatno bhogamokṣasukhapradaḥ |
jamadagnikulādityo reṇukādbhutaśaktihṛt || (96) ||

mātṛhatyāghanirllepaḥ skandajidviprarājyadaḥ |
sarvakṣatrāntakṛdvīradarpahā kārttavīryajit || (97) ||

yogī yogāvatāraśca yogīśo yogatatparaḥ |
paramānandadātā ca śivācāryayaśaḥpradaḥ || (98) ||

bhīmaḥ paraśurāmaśca śivācāryaikaviśvabhūḥ |
śivākhilajñānakośī bhīṣmācāryo'gnidaivataḥ || (99) ||

droṇācāryagururviśvajaitradhanvā kṛtāntakṛt |
advitīyatamomūrttirbrahmacaryaikadakṣiṇaḥ || (100) ||

manuśreṣṭhaḥ satāṃseturmahīyānvṛṣabho virāṭ |
ādirājaḥ kṣitipitā sarvaratnakadohakṛt || (101) ||

pṛthujanmādyekadakṣo hrīḥ śrīḥ kīrttiḥ svayaṃdhṛtiḥ |
jagadvṛttipradaścakravarttiśreṣṭho durastradhṛk || (102) ||

sanakādimuniprāpadbhagavadbhaktivarddhanaḥ |
varṇāśramādidharmāṇāṅkarttā vaktāpravarttakaḥ || (103) ||

sūryavaṃśadhvajārāmo rāghavaḥ sadguṇārṇavaḥ |
kakutsthavīratādharmo rājadharmadhurandharaḥ || (104) ||

nityasusthāśayaḥ sarvabhadragrāhī śubhaikadṛk |
navaratnaṃ ratnanidhiḥ sarvādhyakṣo mahānidhiḥ || (105) ||

<p. 574> sarvaśreṣṭhāśrayaḥ sarvaśastrāstragrāmavīryavān |
jagadvaśī dāśarathiḥ sarvaratnāśrayo nṛpaḥ || (106) ||

dharmaḥ samastadharmastho dharmadraṣṭā'khilārttihṛt |
atīndrojñānavijñānapāradṛśvā kṣamāmbudhiḥ || (107) ||

sarvaprakṛṣṭaḥ śiṣṭeṣṭo harṣaśokādyanākulaḥ |
pitrājñā tyaktasāmrājyaḥ sapatnodayanirbbhayaḥ || (108) ||

guhādeśārpitaiśvaryaḥ śivasparddhājaṭādharaḥ |
citrakūṭāptaratnādrijagadīśo raṇecaraḥ || (109) ||

yatheṣṭāmoghaśastrāstro devendratanayākṣihā |
brahmendrādinataiṣīko mārīcaghno virādhahā || (110) ||

brahmaśāpahatāśeṣadaṇḍakāraṇyapāvanaḥ |
caturddaśasahasrākhyarakṣoghnaikaśaraikabhṛt || (111) ||

kharāristriśirohantā dūṣaṇaghno janārddanaḥ |
jaṭāyuṣognigatidaḥ kabandhasvargadāyakaḥ || (112) ||

līlādhanuḥ koṭyapāstadundubhyasthimahācayaḥ |
saptatālavyathākṛṣṭadhvajapātāladānavaḥ || (113) ||

sugrīvarājyado dhīmān manasaivābhayapradaḥ |
hanūmadrudramukhyeśaḥ samastakapidehabhṛt || (114) ||

agnidaivatyabāṇaikavyākulīkṛtasāgaraḥ |
samlecchakoṭibāṇaikaśuṣkanirddagdhasāgaraḥ || (115) ||

sanāgadaityadhāmaikavyākulīkṛtasāgaraḥ |
samudrādbhutapūrvaikabaddhaseturyaśonidhiḥ || (116) ||

asādhyasādhako laṅkāsamūlotkarṣadakṣiṇaḥ |
varadṛptajanasthānapaulastyakulakṛntanaḥ || (117) ||

rāvaṇaghnaḥ prahastacchitkumbhakarṇābhidugrahā |
rāvaṇaikamukhacchettā niśśaṅkendraikarājyadaḥ || (118) ||

svargāsvargatvavicchedī devendrādindratāharaḥ |
rakṣodevatvahṛddharmādharmaharmyaḥ puruṣṭutaḥ || (119) ||

nātimātradaśāsyārirddattarājyavibhīṣaṇaḥ |
sudhāsṛṣṭimṛtāśeṣasvasainyajīvanaikakṛt || (120) ||

devabrāhmaṇanāmaikadhātā sarvāmarārccitaḥ |
brahmasūryendrarudrādivandyo'rccitaḥ satāmpriyaḥ || (121) ||

ayodhyākhilarājyārhassarvabhūtamanoharaḥ |
<p. 575> svāmyatulyakṛpādatto hīnotkṛṣṭaikasatpriyaḥ || (122) ||

svapakṣādinyāyadarśī hīnārttho'dhikasādhakaḥ |
vyādhavyājānucitakṛttāvako'khilatuṣṭikṛt || (123) ||

pārvatyadhikayuktātmā priyātyaktasurārijit |
sākṣātkuśalavatsadmendrāgninātoparājitaḥ || (124) ||

kośalendro vīrabāhuḥ satyārtthastyaktasodaraḥ |
yaśodānandano nandī dharaṇīmaṇḍalodayaḥ || (125) ||

brahmādikāmyasānnidhyasanāthīkṛtadaivataḥ |
brahmalokāptacāṇḍālādyaśeṣaprāṇisārtthapaḥ || (126) ||

svarṇītagarddabhaśvādicirāyodhyābalaikakṛt |
rāmādvitīyaḥ saumitrilakṣmaṇaprahatendrajit || (127) ||

viṣṇubhaktāśivāṃhaḥkṣitpādukārājyanirvṛtaḥ |
bharato'sahyagandharvakoṭighno lavaṇāntakaḥ || (128) ||

śatrughno vaidyarāḍāyurvedagarbbhauṣadhīpatiḥ |
nityānityākaro dhanvantariryajño jagaddharaḥ || (129) ||

sūryavighnaḥ surājīvo dakṣiṇeśo dvijapriyaḥ |
chinnamūrddhopadeśārkatanūjakṛtamaitrikaḥ || (130) ||

śeṣāṅgasthāpitanaraḥ kapilaḥ karddamātmajaḥ |
yogātmakadhyānabhaṅgasagarātmajabhasmakṛt || (131) ||

dharmo viśvendrasurabhīpatiḥ śuddhātmabhāvitaḥ |
śambhutripuradāhaikasthairyaviśvarathoddhataḥ || (132) ||

viśvātmā'śeṣarudrārtthaśiraścchedākṣatākṛtiḥ |
vājapeyādināmāgnirvedadharmaparāyaṇaḥ || (133) ||

śvetadvīpapatiḥ sāṅkhyapraṇetā sarvasiddhirāṭ |
viśvaprakāśitadhyānayogo mohotamisrahā || (134) ||

bhaktaśambhujito daityāmṛtavāpīsamastapaḥ |
mahāpralayaviśvaiko'dvitīyokhiladaityarāṭ || (135) ||

śeṣadevaḥ sahasrākṣaḥ sahasrā'ṅghriśirobhujaḥ |
phaṇīphaṇiphaṇākārayojitābhyambudakṣitiḥ || (136) ||

kālāgnirudrajanako musalāstro halāyudhaḥ |
nīlāmbaro vāruṇīśo manovākkāyadoṣahā || (137) ||

svasantoṣatṛptimātraḥ pātitaikadaśānanaḥ |
<p. 576> balisa(/)yyamano ghoro rauhiṇeyaḥ pralambahā || (138) ||

muṣṭikaghno dvividahā kālindībhedano balaḥ |
revatīramaṇaḥ pūrvabhaktirevācyutāgrajaḥ || (139) ||

devakīvasudevottho'ditikaśyapanandanaḥ |
vārṣṇeyaḥ sātvatāṃśreṣṭhaḥ śauriryadukulodvahaḥ || (140) ||

narākṛtiḥ pūrṇabrahma savyasācī paraṃtapaḥ |
brahmādikāmanānityajagatparvetaśaiśavaḥ || (141) ||

pūtanāghnaḥ śakaṭabhidyamalārjjunabhañjanaḥ |
vatsāsurāriḥ keśighno dhenukārirggavīśvaraḥ || (142) ||

dāmodaro gopadevo yaśodānandakārakaḥ |
kālīyamarddanaḥ sarvagopagopījanapriyaḥ || (143) ||

līlāgovarddhanadharo govindo gokulotsavaḥ |
ariṣṭamathanaḥ kāmonmattagopīvimuktidaḥ || (144) ||

sadyaḥ kuvalayāpīḍaghātī cāṇūramarddanaḥ |
kaṃsārirugrasenādirājyasthāpyarihā'maraḥ || (145) ||

sudharmāṅkitabhūloko jarāsandhavalāntakaḥ |
tyaktabhaktajarāsandhabhīmasenayaśaḥpradaḥ || (146) ||

sāndīpanimṛtāpatyadātā kālāntakādijit |
rukmiṇīramaṇo rukmiśāsano narakāntakṛt || (147) ||

samastanarakatrātā sarvabhūpatikoṭijit |
samastasundarīkānto'surārirggaruḍadhvajaḥ || (148) ||

ekākījitarudrārkamarudāpo'khileśvaraḥ |
devendradarpahā kalpadrumālaṃkṛtabhūtalaḥ || (149) ||

bāṇabāhusahasracchitskandhādrigaṇakoṭijit |
līlājitamahādevo mahādevaikapūjitaḥ || (150) ||

indrārtthārjjunanirbbhartsurjjayadaḥ pāṇḍavaikadhṛk |
kāśīrājaśiraśchettā rudraśaktyekamarddanaḥ || (151) ||

viśveśvaraprasādāḍhyaḥ kāśīrājasutārddanaḥ |
śambhupratijñāpātā ca svayambhūgaṇapūjakaḥ || (152) ||

kāśīśagaṇakoṭighno lokaśikṣādvijārccakaḥ |
śivatīvratapovaśyaḥ purāśivavarapradaḥ || (153) ||

gayāsurapratijñādhṛk svāṃśaśaṅkarapūjakaḥ |
śivakanyāvratapatiḥ kṛṣṇarūpaḥ śivārihā || (154) ||

mahālakṣmīvapurgaurītrāṇo devalavātahā |
<p. 577> vinidramucukundaikabrahmāstrayuvanāśvahṛt || (155) ||

akrūro'krūramukhyaikabhaktasvacchandamuktidaḥ |
sabālastrījalakrīḍāmṛtavāpīkṛtārṇavaḥ || (156) ||

yamunāpatirānītapariṇītadvijātmakaḥ |
śrīdāmaśaṅkubhaktārtthabhūmyānītendrabhairavaḥ || (157) ||

durvvṛttaśiśupālaikamuktiko dvārakeśvaraḥ |
ācāṇḍālādikamprāpyadvārakānidhikoṭikṛt || (158) ||

brahmāstradagdhagarbbhasthaparīkṣijjīvanaikakṛt |
pariṇītadvijasutānetārjjunamadāpahaḥ || (159) ||

gūḍhamudrākṛtigrastabhīṣmādyakhilagauravaḥ |
pārtthārtthakhaṇḍitāśeṣadivyāstraḥ pārtthamohabhṛt || (160) ||

brahmaśāpacchaladhvastayādavo vibhavāvahaḥ |
anaṅgo jitagaurīśo ratikāntaḥ sadepsitaḥ || (161) ||

puṣpeṣurviśvavijayī smaraḥ kāmeśvarīpatiḥ |
uṣāpatirviśvaheturviśvatṛpto'dhipūruṣaḥ || (162) ||

caturātmā caturvarṇaścaturvedavidhāyakaḥ |
caturviśvaikaviśvātmā sarvotkṛṣṭāsukoṭiṣu || (163) ||

āśrayātmā purāṇarṣirvyāsaḥ śāstrasahasrakṛt |
mahābhāratanirmātā kavīndro bādarāyaṇaḥ || (164) ||

kṛṣṇadvaipāyanaḥ sarvapuruṣārtthakabodhakaḥ |
vedāntakarttā brahmekavyañjakaḥ puruvaṃśakṛt || (165) ||

buddho dhyānajitāśeṣadevadevo jagatpriyaḥ |
nirāyudho jagajjaitraḥ śrīdhano duṣṭamohanaḥ || (166) ||

daityadevabahiṣkarttā vedārtthaśrutigopakaḥ |
śuddhodanirnnaṣṭadiṣṭaḥ sukhadaḥ sadasatpatiḥ || (167) ||

yathāyogyākhilakṛpaḥ sarvaśūnyo'khileṣṭadaḥ |
catuṣkoṭipṛthaktattvaṃ prajñāpāramiteśvaraḥ || (168) ||

pāṣaṇḍaśrutimārgeṇa pāṣaṇḍaśrutigopakaḥ |
kalkī viṣṇuyaśaḥ putraḥ kalikālavilopakaḥ || (169) ||

samastamlecchahastaghnaḥ sarvaśiṣṭadvijātikṛt |
satyapravarttako devadvijadīrgghakṣudhāpahaḥ || (170) ||

aśvarāvādivedena pṛthvīdurgatināśanaḥ |
sadyaḥkṣmānantalakṣmīkṛnnaṣṭaniḥśeṣadharmakṛt || (171) ||

<p. 578> anantasvargayāgaikahemapūrṇākhiladvijaḥ |
asādhyaikajagacchāstā viśvavandyo jayadhvajaḥ || (172) ||

ātmātattvādhipaḥ karttṛśreṣṭho vidhirumāpatiḥ |
bharttuḥśreṣṭhaḥ prajeśāgryo marīcijanakāgraṇīḥ || (173) ||

kaśyapo devārāḍindraḥ prahlādo daityarāṭśaśī |
nakṣatreśo ravistejaḥ śreṣṭhaḥ śukraḥ kavīśvaraḥ || (174) ||

maharṣirāḍbhṛgurviṣṇurādityeśo baliḥ svarāṭ |
vāyurvahniḥ śuciḥ śreṣṭhaḥ śaṅkaro rudrarāḍguruḥ || (175) ||

vidvattamaścitraratho gandharvāgryo vasūttamaḥ |
varṇādiragryāstrīgaurīśaktyagryāśrīśca nāradaḥ || (176) ||

devarṣirāṭ pāṇḍavāgryo'rjjuno nāradavādarāṭ |
pavanaḥ pavaneśāno varuṇo yādasāmpatiḥ || (177) ||

gaṅgātīrtthottamoddhṛtañchatrakāgrya(/) vvarauṣadham |
annaṃ sudarśśanāstrāgryo vajrapraharaṇottamam || (178) ||

uccaiḥśravā vājirāja airāvata imeśvaraḥ |
arundhatyekapatnīśo hyaśvattho'śeṣavṛkṣarāṭ || (179) ||

adhyātmavidyāvidyātmā praṇavañchandasā(/)vvaraḥ |
merurgiripatirmārgo sāmāgryaḥ kālasattamaḥ || (180) ||

dinādyātmā pūrvasiddhiḥ kapilaḥ sāmavedarāṭ |
tārkṣyaḥ khagendra ṛtvagryo vasantaḥ kalpapādapaḥ || (181) ||

dātṛśreṣṭhaḥ kāmadhenurārttighnāgryaḥ surottamaḥ 
cintāmaṇirguruśreṣṭho mātāhitatamaḥ pitā || (182) ||

siṃho mṛgendro nāgendro vāsukirbbhūdharo nṛpaḥ |
varṇeśo brāhmaṇaścāntaḥkaraṇāgryannamo namaḥ || (183) ||

ityetadvāsudevasya viṣṇornnāma sahasrakam |
sarvāparādhaśamanamparambhaktivivarddhanam || (184) ||

akṣayabrahmalokādisarvartthāptyaikasādhanam |
viṣṇulokaikasopānaṃ sarvaduḥkhavināśanam || (185) ||

samastasukhadaṃ satyamparannirvāṇadāyakam |
kāmakrodhādiniśśeṣamanomalaviśodhanam || (186) ||

śāntidampāvanannṝṇāmmahāpātakināmapi |
sarveṣāmprāṇināmāśu sarvābhīṣṭaphalapradam || (187) ||

<p. 579> sarvavighnapraśamanaṃ sarvāriṣṭavināśanam |
ghoraduḥkhapraśamanantīvradāridryanāśanam || (188) ||

tāpatrayāpahaṅguhyandhanadhānyayaśaskaram |
sarvaiśvaryapradaṃ sarvasiddhidaṃ sarvakāladam || (189) ||

tīrtthayajñatapodānavratakoṭiphalapradam |
aprajñajāḍyaśamanaṃ sarvavidyāpravarttakam || (190) ||

rājyadaṃ rājyakāmānāṃ rogiṇāṃ sarvaroganut |
vandhyānāṃ sutadañcāśu sarvaśreṣṭhaphalapradam || (191) ||

astragrāmaviṣadhvaṃsi grahapīḍāvināśanam |
māṅgalyampuṇyamāyuṣyaṃ śravaṇātpaṭhanājjapāt || (192) ||

sakṛdasyākhilā vedāḥ sāṅgā mantrāśca koṭiśaḥ |
purāṇaśāstraṃ smṛtayaḥ paṭhitāḥ pāṭhitāstathā || (193) ||

japtvā'sya ślokārddhampāda(/) vvā paṭhataḥ priye |
nityaṃ siddhyati sarveṣāmacirātkimuto'khilam || (194) ||

prāṇena sadṛśaṃ sadyaḥ pratyahaṃ sarvakarmasu |
idambhadre tvayā gopyampāṭhyaṃ svārtthaikasiddhaye || (195) ||

nāvaiṣṇavāya dātavya(/) vvikalpopahatātmane |
bhaktiśraddhāvihīnāya viṣṇusāmānya darśśine || (196) ||

deyamputrāya śiṣyāya śuddhāya hitakāmyayā |
matprasādādṛte nedaṃ grahīṣyantyalpamedhasaḥ || (197) ||

kalau sadyaḥ phalaṅkalpagrāmameṣyati nārada |
lokānāmbhāgyahīnānā(/) yyena duḥkha(/) vvinaśyati || (198) ||

kṣetreṣu vaiṣṇaveṣvetadāryāvartte bhaviṣyati |
paraṃ satyannāsti viṣṇoḥ paraṃ satyannāsti viṣṇoḥ parampadam || (199) ||

nāsti viṣṇoḥ paraṃ jñānannāsti mokṣo hyavaiṣṇavaḥ |
nāsti viṣṇoḥ paro mantro nāsti viṣṇoḥ parantapaḥ || (200) ||

nāsti viṣṇoḥ parandhyānannāsti mantro hyavaiṣṇavaḥ |
kintasya bahubhirmmantraiḥ kiñjapairbbahuvistaraiḥ || (201) ||

vājapeyasahasraiḥ kiṃ bhaktiryasya janārddane |
sarvatīrtthamayo viṣṇuḥ sarvaśāstramayaḥ prabhuḥ || (202) ||

sarvakratumayo viṣṇuḥ satyaṃ satya(/) vvadāmyaham |
<p. 580> ābrahmasārasarvasvaṃ sarvametanmayoditam || (203) ||

śrīpārvatyuvāca

dhanyāsmyanugṛhītāsmi kṛtārtthāsmi jagadguro |
yanmayedaṃ śrutaṃ stotraṃ tvadrahasyaṃ sudurllabham || (204) ||

aho bata mahatkaṣṭaṃ samastasukhade harau |
vidyamāne'pi sarveśe mūḍhāḥ kliśyanti saṃsṛtau || (205) ||

yamuddiśya sadā nātho maheśopi digambaraḥ |
jaṭilo bhasmaliptāṅgastapasvī vikṣito janaiḥ || (206) ||

ato'dhiko na devo'sti lakṣmīkāntānmadhudviṣaḥ |
yattattvañcintyate nityantvayā yogīśvareṇa hi || (207) ||

ataḥ paraṅkimadhikampadaṃ śrīpuruṣottamāt |
tamavijñāya tānmūḍhā yajante jñānamāninaḥ || (208) ||

muṣitāsmi tvayā nātha cira(/) yyadayamīśvaraḥ |
prakāśito na me yasya dattādyā divyaśaktayaḥ || (209) ||

aho sarveśvaro viṣṇuḥ sarvadevottamottamaḥ |
bhavadādigururmmūḍhaiḥ sāmānya iva lakṣyate || (210) ||

mahīyasāṃ hi māhātmyambhajamānān bhajaṃti cet |
dviṣato'pi tathā pāpānupekṣyante kṣamālayāḥ || (211) ||

mayāpi bālye svapituḥ prajā hṛṣṭā bubhukṣitāḥ |
duḥkhādaśaktāḥ svampoṣṭuṃ śriyā nādhyāsitāḥ purā || (212) ||

tvayā sa(/)vvarddhitābhiśca prajābhirvibudhādayaḥ |
viśasadbhiḥ svaśaktyādyāḥ sasuhṛnmitrabāndhavāḥ || (213) ||

tvayā vinā kva devatvaṅkva dhairyaṃ kva parigrahaḥ |
sarve bhavanti jīvanto yātanāḥ śirasi sthitāḥ || (214) ||

tāmṛtenaiva dharmārtthau kāmo mokṣo'pi durllabhaḥ |
kṣudhitānāndurgatānāṅkuto yogasamādhayaḥ || (215) ||

sā ca saṃsārasāraikā sarvalokaikapālikā |
vaśyā sā kamalā yasya tyaktvā tvāmapi śaṅkara || (216) ||

śriyā dharmeṇa śauryeṇa rūpeṇārjavasampadā |
sarvātiśayavīryeṇa sampūrṇasya mahātmanaḥ || (217) ||

kastena tulyatāmeti devadevena viṣṇunā |
yasyāṃśāṃśakabhāgena vinā sarvaṃ vilīyate || (218) ||

<p. 581> jagadetattathā prāhurddoṣāyetadvimohitāḥ |
nāsya janma jarā mṛtyurnnāprāpya(/) vvārtthameva vā || (219) ||

tathāpi kurute dharmānpālanāya satāṃ kṛte |
vijñāpaya mahādevampraṇamyaikammaheśvaram || (220) ||

avadhārya tathā sā'haṃ kānta kāmada śāśvata |
kāmādyāsaktacittatvātkintu sarveśvara prabho || (221) ||

tvanmayatvātprasādādvā śaknomi paṭhitunna cet |
viṣṇossahasranāmaitatpratyaha(/) vvṛṣabhadhvaja |
nāmnaikena tu yena syāttatphalambrūhi me prabho || (222) ||

śrīmahādeva uvāca

rāmarāmeti rāmeti rame rāme manorame |
sahasranāmamitātulyaṃ rāmanāma varānane || (223) ||

ataḥ sarvāṇi tīrtthāni jalañcaiva prayāgajam |
viṣṇornnāma sahasrasya kalānnārhanti ṣoḍaśīm || (224) ||

[iti nāradapañcarātroktaṃ śrīviṣṇornnāmasahasraṃ samāptam] ||

[iti viṣṇutantraṃ samāptam] 

[iti śrīśāktapramodassamāptaḥ]


[granthasya viṣayānukramaṇikā] 

kālīdhyānaṃ taduktaṃ paramiha likhitaṃ citritāṅgañca kālyā 
yantroddhārassayantro manurapi kathitaḥ soddhṛtiḥ pūjanañca | 
saṅkṣiptaṃ cāpyanalpaṃ stutirapi kathitā cāparādhārddanī ca || 
nāmnāṃ sāhasramuktaṃ śatamupaniṣadāvarmahṛccoktamatra || (1) ||

tārāyāḥ pūjanaṃ stotramiha hi gadita(/) vvarma cokta(/) vvareṇyaṃ 
tatpaścāddhyṛtsamuktaṃ paramupaniṣadaṣṭottarampūtanāmnām ||

yatnātproktantadīyaṃ śatamiha śubhadantatsahasrañca 
ramyantārārūpantamoghnantvaritaphalakaraṣoḍaśīyantathaiva || (2) ||

lakṣmyā lālityayuktaṃ sakalamapi tathā suktamatrādikañca dhūmā 
dharmārtthayuktantadiha ca bhuvanābhaktidañchinnamastā ||

<p. 582> 
śatrucchedapradantadbalayutabagalābuddhidambhairavīyammātaṅgyā 
mānanīya(/) yyajanamatha nutirvarma hṛtproktamatra || (3) ||

nāmnāmaṣṭotta(/)yyacchatamiha likhitantatsahasramparañca pūjā proktā 
kumāryāḥ stutirapi kathitā varma tattarpaṇañca |

homo dānambaleśca pracaritamiha vai śobhi śāktapramode prāpte 
daurlabhyameṣāmiha tu samuditaṃ sarvamekatra labhyam || (4) ||

dhyānantaduktañcitrañca yantramantrau ca kīrttitau ||
soddhāro daśavidyānāmasmiñchāktapramodake || (5) ||

viṣṇorddhyānaṃ sacitra(/) yyajanavidhirapi stotramasminsa(-)varma 
hṛtproktañcāpi yuktaṃ samamupaniṣadāṣṭottarannāma tasya |
mantrograndevagopyaṃ śatamiha likhitañcāpi nāmnāṃ sahasraṃ 
soddhārau yantramantrāvahṛdayamakhilantādṛśantacca devyāḥ || (6) ||

etatsarvaṅgaṇeśeśvarahṛdayavihīnaṃ samuktaṃ 
sadasminmārttaṇḍasyāpi tādṛksakalamiha paraṃ hṛcca sūktena yuktam |
nāstyasmiṃstasya cogropaniṣadavagatā boddhyametadvicitraṃ 
sarvantūpāttamasminsakalabudhajanairyadyathāsthānalabdham || (7) ||

ṣaṭvedāṅkendu (1946) yukte śaradi vidhudine sattithau ṣaṇmukhasya akṣe 
pakṣe sumāse jayasukhaśubhade mādhave mānavānām |
granthaḥ śāktapramodo'gamadayamakhilaḥ sampradeśaḥ samāptiṃ 
śrīdevairnnandanāntairnnṛpakulakamalāhaskaraiḥ supraṇītaḥ || (8) ||

[iti granthasya viṣayāḥ samāptāḥ] 


